#: ../developer/operations.md:11
msgid "Cloud agent sandbox — operations"
msgstr "Cloud Agent 沙箱运维手册"

#: ../developer/operations.md:13
msgid ""
"This is a task-based runbook; you do not need to read it from beginning "
"to end. Use it to provision hosts, deploy Cloud Agent, protect retained "
"workspaces, and diagnose job or network failures. The control plane owns "
"the job API, database, publisher, MCP relay, and admin settings. The "
"gateway provides inference and identity over HTTP."
msgstr ""
"这份手册按任务组织，不需要从头读到尾。开通主机、部署 Cloud "
"Agent、保护保留的工作区、排查任务或网络故障时，来这里找对应的章节。控制平面负责任务 API、数据库、发布器、MCP 中继和管理设置；网关通过"
" HTTP 提供推理和身份认证。"

