"the package pi moved to: a repository's own extension does not load, the "
"relay's tools are registered as `<alias>__<tool>`, and a call reaches the"
" upstream. On 1.2.0 the flag also keeps pi's built-in MCP client off, so "
"neither `.pi/mcp.json` nor the config directory's `mcp.json` starts a "
"server, with the project trusted or not"
msgstr ""
