msgstr "如果任务在一个还没声明支持 MCP 的运行时上指定了连接，会在创建时就被拒绝，而不是在工具悄悄缺失的情况下照样运行。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1146
msgid ""
"Codex's system policy is installed from the trusted deployment address "
"without a per-deployment image build."
msgstr "Codex 的系统策略直接根据受信任的部署地址写入，不需要为每个部署单独构建镜像。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1149
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Use the runtime's credential-reference syntax.** Claude Code expands "
"`${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`. The OpenCode family substitutes "
"`{env:AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}` in the raw configuration before parsing it. The "
"wrong syntax sends a literal placeholder as the bearer token, causing 401"
" responses. Both forms were checked against the pinned binaries. The "
"adapters in `apps/backend/cloud_agent_host/runtimes/` choose the address;"
" the adjacent CLI adapter in `deploy/sandbox/` writes the reference. The "
"token travels in the environment, never in argv or the configuration "
"file."
msgstr ""
"**按各个运行时自己的语法引用凭据。** Claude Code 会展开 `${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`；OpenCode "
"系列则在解析原始配置之前，替换其中的 `{env:AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}`。语法用错了，就会把占位符字面量当作 bearer "
"令牌发出去，结果是 401。两种写法都已在固定版本的二进制上实测过。中继地址由 "
"`apps/backend/cloud_agent_host/runtimes/` 里的适配器决定；凭据引用由 `deploy/sandbox/`"
" 里对应的 CLI 适配脚本写入。令牌通过环境变量传递，绝不出现在命令行参数或配置文件里。"

