#: ../developer/operations.md:1191
msgid "0. The sandbox network needs its host rules, a resolver and both relays"
msgstr "0\\. 沙箱网络需要主机防火墙规则、一个 DNS 解析器和两个中继"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1193
msgid ""
"Every sandbox group runs on one routable bridge of its own — setup, the "
"agent and each Fork sibling alike — and this deployment's host nftables "
"tables decide what it reaches: public IPv4 on TCP 80/443, the one "
"resolver in `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`, and the group's two relays — the "
"gateway tunnel for inference and the MCP tunnel for tools — and nothing "
"else. There is no mode to choose and no setting that opens it further; "
"changing what a sandbox can reach is a design change. [The sandbox "
"network](#the-sandbox-network) below has the whole rule set, how to read "
"it on a host, and what each refusal means."
msgstr ""
"每个沙箱组都跑在它自己的一个可路由网桥上，setup、agent 和每个 Fork 出来的兄弟对话都一样；它能访问什么，由这个部署在主机上的 "
"nftables 表决定：TCP 80/443 上的公网 IPv4、`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 指定的那一个 DNS "
"解析器，以及这个组的两个中继（推理走网关隧道，工具走 MCP "
"隧道），除此之外什么都访问不了。没有可以切换的模式，也没有能进一步放开的设置；要改变沙箱能访问的范围，就是一次设计变更。完整的规则、如何在主机上查看，以及每种拒绝是什么意思，见下面的[沙箱网络"
"](#the-sandbox-network)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1202
msgid "A host therefore needs, before it can run a job:"
msgstr "所以，主机在能跑任务之前，需要具备："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1204
msgid ""
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`. Neither "
"has a default: the pool must be this deployment's own, and the resolver "
"is the only DNS a sandbox can use."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` 和 "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`。两者都没有默认值：地址池必须是这个部署独有的，而解析器是沙箱唯一能用的 DNS。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1207
msgid ""
"Both relays running on the relay network, `AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK`, which "
"the host compose derives as `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-relays`. It is "
"declared `internal: true` and no sandbox group ever joins it: lifecycle "
"code finds the two tunnels there by alias and attaches them, under the "
"same aliases, to each group's bridge. If either alias has no running "
"container there, or more than one, the group network is refused before "
"the Agent CLI starts."
msgstr ""
"两个中继都在中继网络 `AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK` 上运行，主机 compose 会把它定为 `<COMPOSE_PROJECT"
">-agent-relays`。这个网络声明了 `internal: "
"true`，任何沙箱组都不会加入它：生命周期代码在这里按别名找到两条隧道，再以同样的别名把它们接到每个组的网桥上。如果某个别名在这里没有正在运行的容器，或者不止一个，那么在"
" Agent CLI 启动之前，组网络就会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1213
msgid ""
"A kernel with nftables, bridge family included. Every runner's preflight "
"installs this deployment's tables and reads them back before it claims "
"anything."
msgstr "内核要支持 nftables，包括 bridge 族。每个 runner 在认领任何任务之前，预检都会装好这个部署的表，并读回来确认。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1216
msgid ""
"Docker 28 or newer, client and daemon. Each relay joins a group bridge "
"with a gateway priority of -1: a container on several networks takes its "
"default route from the highest priority and then by network name, and "
"`freeinference-chat-net-*` sorts before `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>_internal`, so "
"at the default priority the first group a relay joined would become its "
"way out — and its SSH session would meet the sandbox rules and die for "
"every group sharing it. Preflight refuses an older Docker, and a relay "
"found on a bridge without the priority is attached again with it."
msgstr ""
"Docker 28 或更新版本，客户端和守护进程都要。每个中继以网关优先级 -1 "
"加入组网桥。原因是：一个连着多个网络的容器，会先按优先级从高到低、再按网络名选默认路由，而 `freeinference-chat-net-*` "
"排在 `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>_internal` 前面；如果用默认优先级，中继加入的第一个沙箱组就会成为它的出口，它的 SSH "
"会话就会撞上沙箱的防火墙规则而断掉，所有共用这个中继的沙箱组都会受影响。预检会拒绝更旧的 "
"Docker；如果发现某个中继接在网桥上却没有设优先级，会带上优先级重新接一次。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1225
msgid "Checks run at four points:"
msgstr "检查发生在四个时间点："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1227
msgid ""
"`sandbox_host.sh prepare` validates network settings with the candidate "
"runner image's parser before draining any runner."
msgstr "`sandbox_host.sh prepare` 在排空任何 runner 之前，用候选 runner 镜像里的解析器校验网络设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1229
msgid ""
"`sandbox_host.sh check` sends requests from containers on the relay "
"network. It requires HTTP 200 from inference `/health` and MCP `/healthz`"
" before publishing the exact-SHA ready marker. The runner's lower-level "
"inference probe accepts any HTTP response as reachability; that weaker "
"probe cannot release a deployment."
msgstr ""
"`sandbox_host.sh check` 从中继网络上的容器发出请求。只有推理的 `/health` 和 MCP 的 `/healthz` "
"都返回 HTTP 200，才会写入按确切 SHA 的就绪标记。runner 自己那个更底层的推理探测，只要收到任何 HTTP "
"响应就认为连通；这种较弱的探测，不能用来放行一次部署。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1234
msgid "Each runner's preflight installs and reads back the host nftables tables."
msgstr "每个 runner 的预检，都会安装主机上的 nftables 表并读回确认。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1235
msgid ""
"Each group cold start checks inside the guest, as the sandbox user, for a"
" default route, the configured resolver, and both relay TCP ports. "
"Failure stops the sandbox, preserves its workspace, and fails the turn."
msgstr ""
"每个沙箱组冷启动时，都会在 guest 里以沙箱用户的身份，检查默认路由、配置的解析器，以及两个中继的 TCP "
"端口。任何一项失败，都会停止沙箱、保留工作区，并让这一轮失败。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1239
msgid ""
"DNS resolution alone does not establish relay health: a tunnel can retain"
" its name while its upstream is down."
msgstr "DNS 能解析，并不说明中继是好的：隧道的名字可能还在，但它的上游早就挂了。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1242
msgid ""
"For a runner host that is not the gateway's, see [Running runners on "
"another machine](#running-runners-on-another-machine): the two relays are"
" SSH tunnels to the gateway and to the MCP-only listener."
msgstr ""
"如果 runner 主机不在网关那台机器上，见[在另一台机器上运行 runner](#running-runners-on-another-"
"machine)：那时两个中继分别是通往网关、以及通往 MCP 专用监听器的 SSH 隧道。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1246
msgid ""
"Let Compose create the relay network. A network created by hand under the"
" same name is refused because its labels do not match. The "
"`freeinference-chat-net-*` networks are different: lifecycle code creates"
" them through the Docker API, deriving their names and labels from the "
"sandbox group and generation and their host interface names from this "
"deployment's prefix. It allocates one `/29` from "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and lets Docker arbitrate concurrent "
"claims. A group's bridge is disconnected and deleted on idle or lost stop"
" while Docker keeps the container writable layer, and wake creates it "
"again. Sandbox Manager reconciliation also removes labelled bridges left "
"by an interrupted create after a five-minute grace period. The grace "
"prevents status reconciliation from deleting a bridge between creation "
"and sandbox attachment while still reclaiming bridge interfaces and IPAM."
" A bridge that an environment test or prebuild still runs on is that "
"run's, and the run removes it when it ends. A bridge reconciliation "
"cannot remove, such as one with an unknown container attached, is logged "
"as `chat_network_prune_failed` and left for the next pass; it does not "
"fail the host's sandbox listing."
msgstr ""
"中继网络让 Compose 来创建。用同样的名字手动建的网络，会因为标签对不上而被拒绝。`freeinference-chat-net-*` "
"网络则不一样：它们由生命周期代码通过 Docker API 创建，名字和标签根据沙箱组和代次生成，主机上的接口名根据这个部署的前缀生成。每个网络从"
" `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` 里分一个 `/29`，同时申请时由 Docker "
"来仲裁。空闲停止或丢失停止时，组的网桥会被断开并删除，Docker "
"保留容器的可写层；唤醒时再重新创建。对于创建到一半被中断而遗留的、带标签的网桥，Sandbox Manager "
"的调和会在五分钟宽限期之后删掉。设这个宽限期，是为了防止状态调和在网桥刚建好、沙箱还没接入时就把它删了，同时又能回收网桥接口和 IPAM "
"地址。环境测试或预构建还在用的网桥归那次运行所有，运行结束时由它自己删除。调和删不掉的网桥，比如还接着一个未知容器的，会记一条 "
"`chat_network_prune_failed`，留到下一轮再处理；它不会让主机的沙箱列表失败。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1263
msgid "1. Only enrolled sandbox hosts run jobs"
msgstr "1\\. 只有已注册的沙箱主机才会运行任务"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1265
msgid ""
"Jobs run on enrolled hosts. The deleted `agent-job-runner` Actions "
"workflow used an unisolated `process` backend and shared dispatcher "
"credential; it is not an execution or fallback path in this service."
msgstr ""
"任务都在已注册的主机上运行。已经删除的 `agent-job-runner` Actions 工作流，用的是没有隔离的 `process` "
"后端和共享的 dispatcher 凭据；在本服务里，它既不是执行路径，也不是备用路径。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1269
msgid ""
"Deploy at least one host through `deploy/host/deploy.sh`, enroll it with "
"the control plane, and let its runner service poll "
"`/v1/agent/worker/claim`. A runner cannot claim until its exact replica "
"attests the retained protocol, container image/runtime pins, sandbox "
"manager configuration, execution profile, and host capacity."
msgstr ""
"用 `deploy/host/deploy.sh` 至少部署一台主机，把它注册到控制平面，让它的 runner 服务去轮询 "
"`/v1/agent/worker/claim`。runner "
"要等它所在的那个副本证明了以下几项，才能认领任务：保留协议、容器镜像和运行时的固定版本、sandbox manager 配置、execution "
"profile，以及主机容量。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1275
msgid ""
"Standalone, the host stack needs more than an enrolment credential. Start"
" from `deploy/host/.env.example`: `COMPOSE_PROJECT`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`, `AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL` and "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` are required (`docker-compose.sandbox.yml` "
"interpolates each with `:?`, so an unset value stops the render), "
"alongside `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`, the three tunnel destinations "
"with their own keys and known-hosts files, and the sandbox manager "
"reverse-forward trio for the separate control-plane and host Compose "
"stacks."
msgstr ""
"独立部署时，主机服务需要的不只是一个注册凭据。从 `deploy/host/.env.example` "
"改起：`COMPOSE_PROJECT`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`、`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`"
" 和 `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 都是必填（`docker-compose.sandbox.yml` 对每一个都用 "
"`:?` 引用，没设就无法渲染）；此外还需要 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`、三条隧道的目标地址以及各自的密钥和 "
"known-hosts 文件，以及控制平面和主机分成两套 Compose 时用到的那三项 sandbox manager 反向转发设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1283
msgid "2. Credentials"
msgstr "2\\. 凭据"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1285
msgid ""
"**Host credential** — mint one short-lived enrollment token for a named "
"host:"
msgstr "**主机凭据**：为一台指定名字的主机，签发一个短期的注册令牌："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1292
msgid ""
"Put that value in `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` for first start. Registration "
"replaces it with a long-lived credential bound to that host and persists "
"the credential under `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`; every heartbeat and claim "
"then authenticates with it. A host name in a request is never accepted as"
" identity by itself."
msgstr ""
"第一次启动时，把这个值填进 `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN`。注册成功后，它会被一个绑定到这台主机的长期凭据取代，凭据保存在 "
"`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` 下；之后的每次心跳和认领都用它认证。请求里写的主机名，本身永远不会被当作身份接受。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1297
msgid ""
"**Sandbox manager credential** — generate one "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN` per environment and set the same value on "
"the control plane and every host's Sandbox Manager. It authorizes file, "
"terminal, Git, and session-lifecycle calls. It is not a claim credential "
"and never enters a chat container."
msgstr ""
"**Sandbox manager 凭据**：每个环境生成一个 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`，控制平面和每台主机上的"
" Sandbox Manager 都设成同一个值。它授权文件、终端、Git "
"和会话生命周期相关的调用。它不是认领任务用的凭据，也绝不会进入对话容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1303
msgid ""
"**GitHub credential** — install a GitHub App and give the _control plane_"
" its private key. Nothing needs to be minted or rotated by hand: the "
"platform signs a nine-minute App JWT (`github_app.py`; GitHub refuses "
"more than ten) and exchanges it for an hour-long token scoped to the "
"installation covering the repository being published to."
msgstr ""
"**GitHub 凭据**：安装一个 GitHub App，把它的私钥交给*控制平面*。不需要手动签发或轮换任何东西：平台会签一个九分钟有效的 "
"App JWT（`github_app.py`；超过十分钟的 GitHub "
"会拒绝），再用它换取一个一小时有效的令牌，范围限定在覆盖目标仓库的那个安装上。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1309
msgid ""
"The key reaches the container through a read-only bind mount, at a fixed "
"path. Two variables, and they are not the same variable:"
msgstr "私钥通过只读的绑定挂载，放在容器里的一个固定路径上。这里涉及两个变量，而且它们不是一回事："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1321
msgid ""
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` names the location **inside** the "
"container and defaults to that mounted path in `deploy/control-plane"
"/docker-compose.yml`, so the Compose deployment sets only "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE`. Overriding the path variable without"
" mounting anything there produces a service that starts with GitHub "
"unavailable — see below. Put the file on the host, owned by the service "
"user and `chmod 600`. The control-plane image does not carry the "
"deployment's `config/`, `distributions/`, or `var/data/` directories."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` 指的是容器**内部**的路径，`deploy/control-plane"
"/docker-compose.yml` 里它的默认值就是那个挂载路径，所以用 Compose 部署时只需要设置 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE`。如果改了路径变量，却没在那个位置挂载任何东西，服务启动后 GitHub "
"功能就是不可用的，见下文。把文件放在主机上，属主设为服务用户，并执行 `chmod 600`。控制平面镜像里不带部署的 "
"`config/`、`distributions/` 或 `var/data/` 目录。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1330
msgid ""
"**Whether GitHub is configured is decided by the saved GitHub App ID**, "
"imported from `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_ID` at the first settings initialization."
" The key path always has a default in this stack, and `/dev/null` is "
"mounted there when no App exists, so the path says nothing. With the App "
"ID set, a key that cannot be loaded — missing, empty, unreadable by the "
"service user, or not a valid key — does not stop the control plane (issue"
" #47):"
msgstr ""
"**GitHub 有没有配置，看的是已保存的 GitHub App ID**，它在第一次初始化设置时从 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_ID`"
" 导入。在这套部署里，私钥路径总是有默认值，没有 App 时那里挂载的是 `/dev/null`，所以光看路径说明不了什么。设置了 App ID "
"之后，如果私钥加载不了，比如缺失、为空、服务用户读不了，或者不是有效的密钥，控制平面也不会因此停掉（issue #47）："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1337
msgid ""
"Integrations and the task composer say GitHub is temporarily unavailable."
" Creating a job (a temporary workspace's too), a runner's claim, or a "
"branch lookup answers `503 source_control_unavailable` with `Retry-After:"
" 30`; queued jobs, pending publishes and goal wakeups wait without "
"spending any retries."
msgstr ""
"Integrations 和任务输入框会提示 GitHub 暂时不可用。创建任务（临时工作区也一样）、runner 认领任务或查询分支，都会返回 "
"`503 source_control_unavailable`，并带上 `Retry-After: "
"30`；排队的任务、待处理的发布和目标的唤醒都会等着，不会消耗任何重试次数。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1341
msgid ""
"The log carries one `ERROR` event, `source_control_load_failed`, with a "
"`reason` (`key_file_unreadable`, `key_missing`, `key_invalid`, "
"`unexpected`) and, for a file, its path and the OS error. It repeats only"
" if the reason changes. If jobs are queued and none can start, the "
"existing `queue_not_starting` alert fires as well."
msgstr ""
"日志里会记一条 `ERROR` 事件 `source_control_load_failed`，带一个 "
"`reason`（`key_file_unreadable`、`key_missing`、`key_invalid`、`unexpected`）；如果是文件的问题，还会记下文件路径和操作系统给出的错误。只有原因变了才会再记一次。如果有任务在排队却一个都启动不了，现有的"
" `queue_not_starting` 告警也会触发。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1346
msgid ""
"The service reads the key again every 30 seconds. Fixing the file in "
"place — its owner, mode or content — recovers the same process within a "
"minute and logs `source_control_load_recovered`. Change the App ID and "
"inline credentials through Admin → Settings. Changing the host path of "
"the key bind mount still needs the container recreated."
msgstr ""
"服务每 30 秒重新读一次私钥。直接在原地把文件修好，比如改属主、改权限或改内容，同一个进程在一分钟内就会恢复，并记录 "
"`source_control_load_recovered`。App ID 和内联凭据请在 Admin → Settings "
"里改。如果要改私钥绑定挂载在主机上的路径，仍然需要重建容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1352
msgid ""
"Alternatively save an inline PEM in the Settings page; it is encrypted in"
" the database and takes precedence over the mounted key. The legacy "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` environment value is accepted for the one-"
"time import in deployments that pass it through. The mounted file remains"
" available when the saved inline key is empty."
msgstr ""
"也可以在设置页面里保存一份内联 PEM，它会加密存进数据库，并且优先于挂载的私钥。如果部署还在传旧的 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY` 环境变量，它会在一次性导入时被接受。保存的内联私钥为空时，仍然使用挂载的文件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1358
msgid ""
"For checkout and publication, the App needs `contents: write` and "
"`pull_requests: write`. To enable **Create repository** in the workspace "
"and new-task pickers, also configure the GitHub App's repository "
"permission **Repository creation: write**. GitHub also accepts "
"**Administration: Read and write**, but Repository creation grants only "
"the creation operations this feature needs. See GitHub's [repository "
"creation permissions](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication"
"/permissions-required-for-github-apps#repository-permissions-for-"
"repository-creation). Existing installations may need their owners to "
"approve the updated permissions on GitHub. Without that permission, "
"repository creation reports that the App cannot create repositories; "
"existing tasks continue to use their existing permissions. The App does "
"not need `workflows`, so a patch touching `.github/` cannot be pushed "
"even if the gate were bypassed. Revocation is uninstalling the App."
msgstr ""
"检出和发布需要 App 有 `contents: write` 和 `pull_requests: write` "
"权限。要在工作区和新建任务的选择器里启用 **Create repository**，还要给 GitHub App 配置仓库权限 "
"**Repository creation: write**。GitHub 也接受 **Administration: Read and "
"write**，但 Repository creation 只授予这个功能需要的创建操作。见 GitHub "
"的[仓库创建权限说明](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/authentication/permissions-"
"required-for-github-apps#repository-permissions-for-repository-"
"creation)。已有安装的所有者，可能需要到 GitHub 上批准更新后的权限。没有这项权限时，创建仓库会提示 App "
"没有创建仓库的权限；已有的任务照常使用原来的权限。App 不需要 `workflows` 权限，所以即使绕过了补丁检查，改动 `.github/`"
" 的补丁也推不上去。要吊销，卸载这个 App 即可。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1372
msgid ""
"Creation calls GitHub's `POST /user/repos` with the connected user's "
"encrypted, refreshable GitHub App user token, kept in the control plane. "
"It creates only in that user's personal account, defaults to private, and"
" initializes a README. No long-lived credential enters a sandbox. "
"Creation does not add a local repository grant or bypass the deployment "
"allowlist: if the App installation covers only selected repositories, the"
" owner grants access to the new one through **Configure repository "
"access** and refreshes the picker. A transient access-check failure after"
" creation is handled as a created repository awaiting access, rather than"
" another creation attempt."
msgstr ""
"创建仓库时，会用已连接用户的 GitHub App 用户令牌（加密保存在控制平面、可以刷新）调用 GitHub 的 `POST "
"/user/repos`。它只在这个用户的个人账号下创建仓库，默认私有，并初始化一个 "
"README。没有任何长期凭据会进入沙箱。创建仓库不会在本地加一条仓库授权，也不会绕过部署白名单：如果 App "
"安装只覆盖了选定的仓库，所有者需要通过 **Configure repository access** "
"给新仓库授权，再刷新选择器。如果创建之后的权限检查临时失败，会把它当作\"已经创建、等待授权\"的仓库处理，而不是再创建一次。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1382
msgid ""
"For the _connect_ flow (a user authorizing their own repositories) the "
"App also needs its OAuth half, with the callback pointing at this "
"deployment's frontend:"
msgstr "*连接*流程（用户授权自己的仓库）还需要 App 的 OAuth 部分，回调地址指向这个部署的前端："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1394
msgid ""
"Set the callback to the **agent web's own origin**, where the callback "
"page and session cookie live. For a web build with a base path, use "
"`<origin><basePath>/connected?provider=github`. The authorize link sends "
"no `redirect_uri`, so GitHub uses the App's first Callback URL. Update "
"that setting whenever the web origin moves."
msgstr ""
"回调地址要设在 **agent Web 自己的源**上，回调页面和会话 cookie 都在那里。如果 Web 构建带了 base path，就用 "
"`<origin><basePath>/connected?provider=github`。授权链接里不带 `redirect_uri`，所以 "
"GitHub 会用 App 配置里的第一个 Callback URL。Web 的源一旦变了，就要更新这项设置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1400
msgid ""
"A callback left on an origin the web app no longer serves breaks the "
"connect flow without any error from GitHub, so move it together with the "
"web app."
msgstr "如果回调地址还留在 Web 应用已经不用的源上，连接流程就会出问题，而 GitHub 那边不会报任何错，所以一定要和 Web 应用一起迁移。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1403
msgid ""
"The composer and the Integrations page derive the Connect link from "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID` and GitHub's web OAuth endpoint. The install"
" URL is offered after connecting whenever the App is not on the user's "
"own account. Keeping those two URLs separate is required for reconnects: "
"GitHub sends an already-installed App's `/installations/new` link to its "
"settings page without invoking the OAuth callback."
msgstr ""
"输入框和 Integrations 页面，会根据 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID` 和 GitHub 网页端的 OAuth"
" 地址生成 Connect 链接。只要 App "
"没有装在用户自己的账号上，连接之后就会再给出安装地址。这两个地址必须分开，重新连接才能正常工作：对于已经装好的 App，GitHub 会把 "
"`/installations/new` 链接直接转到它的设置页面，而不会调用 OAuth 回调。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1410
msgid ""
"**Configure repositories** uses the installation URL; GitHub selects the "
"user or organization settings page. Set `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` to"
" `/apps/<slug>/installations/new`. Pointing it at the OAuth endpoint "
"leaves a user with no installation looping through authorization."
msgstr ""
"**Configure repositories** 用的是安装地址，GitHub 会自己判断打开用户还是组织的设置页面。把 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL` 设为 `/apps/<slug>/installations/new`。如果把它指向"
" OAuth 地址，还没安装 App 的用户就会在授权页面上无限循环。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1415
msgid ""
"The same App also supplies the runner's clone credential, and the two are"
" _not_ the same token. An installation token inherits every permission "
"the App holds unless it asks for less, so the clone token is requested as"
" `contents: read` on the single repository being worked on. Checkout does"
" not inherit the publisher's broader authority."
msgstr ""
"runner 克隆仓库用的凭据也来自同一个 App，但两者*不是*同一个令牌。安装令牌默认会继承 App "
"拥有的全部权限，除非申请时主动要求更少，所以克隆令牌是按\"只对当前这一个仓库有 `contents: "
"read`\"来申请的。检出因此不会继承发布器那么大的权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1421
msgid ""
"The claim separately mints a single-repository installation token with "
"`contents: write` and `pull_requests: write`, injected as `GH_TOKEN` in "
"the owning sandbox member's Agent CLI environment. `GH_REPO` selects the "
"job's repository and `GH_HOST` selects `github.com`; `gh` authenticates "
"as the App installation, rather than as the user's account. The token is "
"not written to Git or GitHub CLI configuration, shared workspace files, "
"or the image. Setup scripts and standalone terminal sessions do not "
"receive it. Git uses the `gh auth git-credential` helper through "
"invocation-only environment settings, so `git push` and `gh pr create` "
"can authenticate without an interactive login. The host clone credential "
"stays read-only; user account/refresh tokens and the App's private key "
"remain outside the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"认领时还会另外签发一个只限单个仓库、带 `contents: write` 和 `pull_requests: write` 的安装令牌，作为 "
"`GH_TOKEN` 注入到所属沙箱成员的 Agent CLI 环境里。`GH_REPO` 指定任务的仓库，`GH_HOST` 指定 "
"`github.com`；`gh` 以 App 安装的身份认证，而不是用户的账号。这个令牌不会写进 Git 或 GitHub CLI "
"的配置、共享的工作区文件，也不会写进镜像。setup 脚本和单独打开的终端会话都拿不到它。Git 通过只在调用时生效的环境设置，使用 `gh "
"auth git-credential` 辅助程序，所以 `git push` 和 `gh pr create` "
"不需要交互式登录就能认证。主机上的克隆凭据仍然是只读的；用户的账号令牌、刷新令牌和 App 的私钥都留在沙箱之外。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1433
msgid ""
"Direct sandbox pushes bypass the trusted publisher's patch gate, "
"including its workflow-file and secret checks. Repository branch "
"protection and GitHub rules still apply. The App installation must grant "
"Contents and Pull requests write access; token issuance failures return "
"the claim to the queue."
msgstr ""
"从沙箱里直接推送，会绕过受信任发布器的补丁检查，包括对工作流文件和 secret 的检查。仓库的分支保护和 GitHub 规则仍然有效。App "
"安装必须授予 Contents 和 Pull requests 的写权限；如果令牌签发失败，认领会被退回队列。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1438
msgid ""
"Each claim obtains a live token from the App's expiry-aware cache. When "
"that token changes, the member resumes its native session in a "
"replacement process so subsequent commands inherit the new credential. "
"Installation tokens expire after about one hour; there is no in-turn "
"renewal, so `gh` calls in a longer turn may require a new turn to obtain "
"a fresh token."
msgstr ""
"每次认领都会从 App "
"的缓存里取一个有效的令牌，缓存会考虑过期时间。如果令牌换了，成员会在一个新的进程里接上原生会话，这样之后的命令就会用上新的凭据。安装令牌大约一小时后过期，一轮之内不会续期，所以如果某一轮跑得很久，里面的"
" `gh` 调用可能要等到下一轮才能拿到新令牌。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1444
msgid ""
"With no App configured the claim returns no clone token and the runner "
"clones anonymously, which is enough for a public repository. A private "
"repository needs the App."
msgstr "没有配置 App 时，认领不会返回克隆令牌，runner 以匿名方式克隆；公开仓库这样就够了。私有仓库必须要有 App。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1448
msgid ""
"A static `AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN` still works as a fallback for the trusted "
"publisher, but it is a long-lived credential someone has to create and "
"rotate; prefer the App. Sandbox GitHub authentication requires the App "
"and never falls back to this static token. With neither, the publisher "
"loop idles and says so — jobs still run and still produce patches, they "
"just never become PRs."
msgstr ""
"静态的 `AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN` 仍然可以作为受信任发布器的备用凭据，但它是长期有效的，需要有人去创建和轮换，所以优先用 "
"App。沙箱里的 GitHub 认证必须用 "
"App，绝不会退而使用这个静态令牌。两样都没有的话，发布器的循环会空转，并给出提示：任务照样运行、照样产出补丁，只是永远不会变成 PR。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1455
msgid "Running self-hosted"
msgstr "自行部署运行"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1457
msgid ""
"Administrators can also attach an SSH-accessible server or provision a "
"CloudLab experiment from Servers, then select the ready Host as the "
"global location for new sandboxes. The [compute-resource runbook"
"](operations-compute.md) covers operator profiles, credentials, automatic"
" renewal and guarded resource release. Existing retained sandboxes remain"
" on their original Host when this selection changes; neither Host Remove "
"nor Forget destroys the underlying machine."
msgstr ""
"管理员也可以在 Servers 里挂接一台能通过 SSH 访问的服务器，或者新建一个 CloudLab 实验，然后把就绪的 Host "
"设为新沙箱的全局位置。运维 profile、凭据、自动续期，以及带保护的资源释放，见[计算资源手册](operations-"
"compute.md)。改了这个选择，已有的保留沙箱仍留在原来的 Host 上；Host 的 Remove 和 Forget "
"都不会销毁底层的机器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1464
msgid ""
"Run the host agent as a **standing service** so queued jobs can be "
"claimed after crashes and reboots. Configure enrollment and the shared "
"sandbox manager token in `.env`. The example below includes the shared-"
"kernel setting for trusted internal repositories. For untrusted "
"repositories, use the default `kata` backend and complete [Kata "
"provisioning](#provisioning-kata-on-a-runner-host)."
msgstr ""
"把主机 agent 作为**常驻服务**运行，这样即使崩溃或重启，排队的任务也能接着被认领。在 `.env` 里配置注册信息和共享的 "
"sandbox manager 令牌。下面的示例里包含了给受信任的内部仓库用的共享内核设置。不受信任的仓库，请使用默认的 `kata` "
"后端，并完成 [Kata 配置](#provisioning-kata-on-a-runner-host)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1476
msgid ""
"The `AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container` line is a **deliberate downgrade**:"
" sandbox groups share the host kernel. Before enabling Kata for new "
"groups, provision the host and verify the guest runtime and relay paths "
"with the checks below. Existing retained runc containers need the "
"separate migration treatment described there."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container` 这一行是一次**有意为之的降级**：沙箱组会共用主机的内核。要让新的沙箱组用上"
" Kata，先把主机配置好，并用下面的检查确认 guest 运行时和中继路径都正常。已有的保留 runc 容器，需要按那里说明的方式单独迁移。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1482
msgid ""
"Compose uses `restart: unless-stopped`; enable the host's Docker daemon "
"to carry the service across reboots. The host lifecycle commands are:"
msgstr ""
"Compose 用的是 `restart: unless-stopped`；把主机的 Docker "
"守护进程设为开机自启，服务在机器重启后就会自动恢复。主机的生命周期命令如下："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1498
msgid ""
"Use the standalone host stack even on the gateway's machine, with tunnel "
"destinations pointing to its local listeners. The old co-located "
"`agent_runner.sh` overlay did not move; "
"[MIGRATION.md](../../MIGRATION.md) records that decision. `preflight` "
"checks Docker, retained-session configuration, host isolation, and the "
"configured image. `up` repeats those checks against the image it deploys."
msgstr ""
"即使在网关所在的那台机器上，也要用独立的主机服务，只是把隧道的目标指向本机的监听器。以前那个和网关同机部署的 `agent_runner.sh` "
"overlay 没有搬过来，这个决定记在 [MIGRATION.md](../../MIGRATION.md) 里。`preflight` 会检查"
" Docker、保留会话的配置、主机隔离和配置的镜像；`up` 会针对它要部署的镜像，再把这些检查做一遍。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1505
msgid "Host configuration reference"
msgstr "主机配置参考"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1507
msgid ""
"The script validates the required environment before starting and "
"surfaces the runner's own preflight verdict (gateway reachable, retained "
"image/runtime usable, Docker data-root correct, relay network present and"
" route-less, host network rules installed and read back) instead of "
"leaving it in a detached log. Equivalent by hand:"
msgstr ""
"脚本在启动之前会先校验必需的环境变量，并把 runner 自己的预检结论直接显示出来（网关能否访问、保留的镜像和运行时能否使用、Docker "
"数据目录是否正确、中继网络是否存在且不带路由、主机网络规则是否已安装并读回确认），而不是把它埋在一个后台日志里。手动执行的等价命令如下："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1527
msgid ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` is required by the host compose rather than "
"defaulted (both the runner and the Sandbox Manager interpolate it with "
"`:?`), so name it explicitly; deployments tag it per environment "
"(`…-job:staging`, `…-job:prod`) so a rebuild on one side cannot replace "
"the other's image."
msgstr ""
"主机 compose 要求必须提供 `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`，不给默认值（runner 和 Sandbox Manager 都用"
" `:?` "
"引用它），所以要明确写出来。部署时会按环境给它打不同的标签（`…-job:staging`、`…-job:prod`），这样一边重新构建，不会覆盖另一边的镜像。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1533
msgid ""
"`claim_job` uses `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`, so every host shares one queue"
" with no leader and no sharding."
msgstr "`claim_job` 用的是 `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`，所以所有主机共用一个队列，不需要选主，也不需要分片。"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`kata`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"`process` (no isolation) refuses to start unless "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_UNISOLATED=1`. On the default `kata`, deploy refuses"
" until the host has the shim and one real container proves it gets its "
"own kernel; `container` is an explicit, and loudly restated, shared-"
"kernel downgrade"
msgstr ""
"`process`（没有隔离）除非设置了 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_UNISOLATED=1`，否则拒绝启动。用默认的 "
"`kata` 时，要等主机装好了 shim，并且有一个真实的容器证明自己拿到了独立的内核，部署才会放行；`container` "
"是一次明确选择的共享内核降级，系统会反复醒目地提示这一点"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Image built from `Dockerfile.agent-sandbox` or an equivalent deployment-"
"owned image"
msgstr "由 `Dockerfile.agent-sandbox` 构建的镜像，或者部署方自己提供的等效镜像"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`*_EXTRA_VERSIONS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "blank"
msgstr "空"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Comma-separated tested versions to bake beside each source-reviewed "
"default. Select one for new chats in Admin; retained chats keep the "
"version they started with. The five defaults are not host settings "
"because runner/control-plane capability admission attests them as one "
"protocol unit"
msgstr ""
"用逗号分隔、测试过的版本，和每个经过源码评审的默认版本一起打进镜像。在 Admin "
"里为新对话选其中一个；保留的对话继续用它开始时的版本。五个默认版本不是主机设置，因为 runner "
"和控制平面在做能力准入时，把它们作为一个协议单元整体证明"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_RUNTIME_DOWNLOAD_NETWORK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`bridge`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Docker network for the download step of an agent update from the admin "
"Settings page. Only npm runs there, with package scripts off; the scripts"
" and the check run with no network ([design](../agents/specs/2026-10-15"
"-agent-cli-updates-design.zh-CN.md))"
msgstr ""
"在管理员设置页面升级 agent 时，下载这一步所用的 Docker 网络。那里只运行 "
"npm，并且关闭了软件包脚本；脚本和检查都在没有网络的环境里运行（[设计](../agents/specs/2026-10-15-agent-"
"cli-updates-design.zh-CN.md)）"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "public npm"
msgstr "公共 npm"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Registry a host downloads updated agents from. Set the same value on the "
"control plane, which reads the latest release from it. pi updates come "
"from `@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent`; a private mirror must carry that "
"package as well as the image's `@mariozechner` one"
msgstr ""
"主机下载升级版 agent 用的 npm 仓库。控制平面也要设成同样的值，它从这里读取最新版本。pi 的升级来自 `@earendil-works"
"/pi-coding-agent`；如果用私有镜像源，除了镜像里用的 `@mariozechner` 那个包，也要包含这个包"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"This deployment's RFC1918 IPv4 pool, one daemon-arbitrated `/29` per "
"active group bridge. No default: it must be disjoint from every other "
"deployment's pool on the machine — of two that overlap, the host rules "
"refuse the one installed later — and from the host's Docker, VPN and "
"private-service routes. A group's bridge is removed on stop and rebuilt "
"on wake"
msgstr ""
"本部署的 RFC1918 IPv4 地址池，每个活跃的沙箱组网桥占一个 "
"`/29`，由守护进程来分配。没有默认值，并且必须和本机上其他每个部署的地址池都不重叠（两个重叠时，主机规则会拒绝后装的那个），也不能和主机上 "
"Docker、VPN 及私有服务的路由重叠。沙箱组的网桥在停止时删除，唤醒时重建"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"The one IPv4 resolver sandboxes may use, on TCP and UDP 53. It is the "
"only exception to the protected ranges, so a site resolver on a private "
"address or on this host works. Not loopback, and not inside the pool; see"
" _Choosing the resolver_ below"
msgstr ""
"沙箱唯一能用的 IPv4 DNS 解析器，走 TCP 和 UDP 53 "
"端口。它是受保护地址段里唯一的例外，所以站点的解析器即使在私有地址上，或者就在本机上，也能用。不能是回环地址，也不能在地址池里面；见下文 "
"*选择解析器*"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_PROTECTED_CIDRS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Comma-separated IPv4 blocks to refuse on top of the built-in host, "
"private, link-local/metadata, CGNAT, multicast and reserved ranges — an "
"institution's services on public addresses, for example. It can only add "
"protection. Set the same value on the control plane, where an owner's SSH"
" server check refuses these blocks too"
msgstr ""
"在内置的主机地址、私有地址、链路本地和元数据地址、CGNAT、组播以及保留地址段之外，还要额外拒绝的 IPv4 "
"地址块，用逗号分隔，比如某个机构放在公网地址上的服务。它只能增加保护。控制平面也要设成同样的值，检查所有者的 SSH 服务器时也会拒绝这些地址块"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "derived"
msgstr "自动得出"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Where lifecycle finds the two relays; the host stack derives "
"`<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-relays`. It must exist and be `internal`, or "
"preflight refuses, and no sandbox group ever joins it. Set it only to "
"name an existing network"
msgstr ""
"生命周期代码在哪里找那两个中继；主机服务会自动得出 `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-relays`。它必须存在，并且是 "
"`internal` 的，否则预检会拒绝；任何沙箱组都不会加入它。只有要指定一个已有的网络时，才需要设置"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_SETUP_TIER`, `_AGENT_TIER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "removed"
msgstr "已移除"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Retired with the network tiers and the Squid proxy, together with "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST`, `AGENT_EGRESS_NETWORK_*`, "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_PROXY_*`, `AGENT_EGRESS_STOP_GRACE`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_NETWORK` and `AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_OPEN_NETWORK`. Nothing "
"reads them, so setting one changes nothing; delete them from `.env`"
msgstr ""
"和网络分级、Squid 代理一起退役了，一起退役的还有 "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST`、`AGENT_EGRESS_NETWORK_*`、`AGENT_EGRESS_PROXY_*`、`AGENT_EGRESS_STOP_GRACE`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_NETWORK`"
" 和 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_OPEN_NETWORK`。已经没有代码读取它们，设了也不起作用；把它们从 `.env` 里删掉"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "`AGENT_RUNNER_HOST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid "host name"
msgstr "主机名"

#: ../developer/operations.md
msgid ""
"Enrolled execution environment, shared by every turn it runs — the unit "
"the admin placement switch picks between. `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` "
"fills it from the host's own name. Never derived inside the container, "
"where the hostname is a container id. After enrolment the persisted "
"credential is authoritative, so editing this renames nothing. Unset keeps"
" the environment out of the pool and changes nothing else. Distinct from "
"`AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST`, which is the display-only inventory name grouping "
"environments that share one server"
msgstr ""
"已注册的执行环境，它跑的每个轮次都共用这个名字，也是管理后台的放置开关进行选择的单位。`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` "
"会用主机自己的名字填上它。绝不会在容器里推导，因为容器里的主机名是容器 "
"ID。注册之后以保存的凭据为准，所以改这个值并不会给任何东西改名。不设置的话，这个环境不会进入资源池，除此之外什么都不变。它和 "
"`AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST` 不同，后者只用于在清单里显示，把同一台服务器上的几个环境归到一组"

