"Bootstrap value for **Storage reserve for new sandboxes**; the admin "
"runtime setting replaces it after the host's first settings heartbeat. "
"Fresh verified available space below this reserve declines a new sandbox "
"allocation without spending the turn. Existing sandboxes may resume; "
"unknown capacity does not establish a pressure verdict. This is an "
"admission guard, not a disk quota"
msgstr ""
"**Storage reserve for new sandboxes** "
"的初始值；主机第一次通过心跳拿到设置之后，就由管理后台的运行时设置取代。如果最新核实的可用空间低于这个预留值，就不分配新沙箱，但这一轮不会被消耗掉。已有的沙箱可以恢复；容量未知时，不会判定为存储紧张。这只是准入时的一道检查，不是磁盘配额"

