msgstr "如果任务没有指定自己的分支，草稿 PR 就以这里为目标分支。从某个分支开始的任务，目标就是*那个*分支；这里只是备用值"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1565
msgid ""
"The authenticated `/agents/integrations` page is the only supported place"
" to start either OAuth flow. OAuth state is unpredictable, bound to the "
"signed-in user and provider, expires after ten minutes, and is consumed "
"once. GitLab also uses PKCE. GitLab access and refresh tokens are "
"encrypted before persistence, rotated on refresh, never returned to the "
"browser, and revoked best-effort on disconnect."
msgstr ""
"两种 OAuth 流程都只能从需要登录的 `/agents/integrations` 页面发起。OAuth 的 state "
"无法预测，绑定到当前登录的用户和服务商，十分钟后过期，只能用一次。GitLab 还额外使用 PKCE。GitLab "
"的访问令牌和刷新令牌在保存之前先加密，刷新时轮换，绝不返回给浏览器，断开连接时会尽力吊销。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1572
msgid ""
"GitHub repositories retain the complete Agent lifecycle: checkout, branch"
" discovery, push, and draft PR publishing use short-lived GitHub App "
"installation tokens. Draft PR titles summarize the captured user and "
"assistant messages across the shared session through a bounded inference "
"request under a separate, owner-scoped grant, which each try of a "
"publication mints for itself and revokes when its title is written. A "
"Fork's copies of earlier turns are read once, in the chat they were "
"copied from. A session longer than one request is summarized in at most "
"four fragments, all at once, and the title is written from their "
"summaries within the same one-minute budget. A longer session is not sent"
" to the model at all (fallback reason `conversation_too_long`). Generic "
"completion text is rejected and retried. If inference is unavailable, the"
" publisher uses the first concrete line from each included turn's closing"
" summary, skipping headings and generic completion preambles. It falls "
"back to the changed files when no usable summary exists. The "
"`agent_pr_title_generation_failed` log records the snapshot ID and "
"fallback reason as structured fields, plus the exception type and HTTP "
"status when available, without logging conversation text or credentials. "
"Enable JSON logging in Admin Settings to see these fields. The original "
"task remains in the PR body. A conversation keeps one draft PR across its"
" turns while that PR is open; once someone closes or merges it, the next "
"published snapshot opens a new draft PR from the same `agent/…` branch. "
"GitLab is intentionally narrower in this release: it verifies the "
"authenticated GitLab user and shows their accessible projects for "
"discovery. GitLab projects do not appear in the Agent task composer, and "
"the control plane does not claim to read their source or publish GitLab "
"merge requests yet."
msgstr ""
"GitHub 仓库支持完整的 Agent 生命周期：检出、查找分支、推送和发布草稿 PR，用的都是短期的 GitHub App 安装令牌。草稿 "
"PR 的标题，会在一个单独的、只属于所有者的授权下，通过一次有限制的推理请求，概括整个共享会话里记录下来的用户和 assistant "
"消息；这个授权由每次发布尝试自己签发，标题写好后就吊销。Fork "
"里从之前轮次复制过来的内容只读一次，在它们原来所在的那个对话里读。会话长到一次请求装不下时，最多分成四段同时概括，再在同样一分钟的时间预算内，根据这几段的概括写出标题。再长的会话就根本不发给模型（退回原因是"
" "
"`conversation_too_long`）。空洞的\"已完成\"之类的文字会被拒绝并重新生成。如果推理用不了，发布器会从每个包含的轮次的收尾总结里，取第一行具体的内容，跳过标题和\"已完成\"之类的套话；如果连可用的总结都没有，就改用改动的文件列表。日志"
" `agent_pr_title_generation_failed` 会以结构化字段记录快照 ID 和退回的原因，能拿到时还会记录异常类型和 "
"HTTP 状态，但不会记录对话内容或凭据。在 Admin Settings 里开启 JSON 日志，就能看到这些字段。原始的任务内容保留在 PR "
"正文里。只要草稿 PR 还开着，一个对话在多轮之间就一直沿用同一个 PR；一旦有人把它关闭或合并，下一次发布的快照会从同一个 `agent/…` "
"分支开一个新的草稿 PR。这个版本对 GitLab 的支持有意做得更窄：它只核实登录的 GitLab "
"用户，并列出他能访问的项目供查看。GitLab 项目不会出现在 Agent 的任务输入框里，控制平面目前也不读取它们的源码，不发布 GitLab "
"合并请求。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1598
msgid "Provisioning Kata on a runner host"
msgstr "在 runner 主机上配置 Kata"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1600
msgid ""
"Kata gives each sandbox group a lightweight VM with its own kernel. Use "
"it for untrusted repositories, whose build and test scripts execute "
"arbitrary code. Plain containers share the host kernel and are limited to"
" trusted internal repositories."
msgstr ""
"Kata "
"给每个沙箱组一台轻量级虚拟机，有自己独立的内核。不受信任的仓库要用它，因为这些仓库的构建和测试脚本会执行任意代码。普通容器和主机共用内核，只能用于受信任的内部仓库。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1605
msgid ""
"Install the runtime on the **host**. The runner image contains a Docker "
"client; the host daemon must resolve `io.containerd.kata.v2`. Run once "
"per host as root:"
msgstr ""
"运行时装在**主机**上。runner 镜像里只有 Docker 客户端，主机的守护进程必须能识别 "
"`io.containerd.kata.v2`。每台主机以 root 身份运行一次："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1612
msgid ""
"It is idempotent, checks the host can actually start VMs (`/dev/kvm`, CPU"
" virtualization extensions) before downloading anything, verifies the "
"release against a pinned SHA-256, and links the shim into "
"`/usr/local/bin` so containerd finds it without a unit-file edit. The "
"version is pinned in the script; upgrading is a two-line change there, "
"and `--check` then fails on every host still carrying the old one."
msgstr ""
"这个脚本可以重复运行。它会在下载任何东西之前，先检查主机是否真的能启动虚拟机（`/dev/kvm`、CPU 虚拟化扩展），用固定的 SHA-256"
" 校验发布包，并把 shim 链接到 `/usr/local/bin`，这样 containerd 不用改 unit "
"文件就能找到它。版本号固定在脚本里；升级只需要改那里的两行，之后在每台还装着旧版本的主机上，`--check` 都会失败。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1619
msgid "Guest tracing and member isolation"
msgstr "Guest 内的进程追踪与成员隔离"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1621
msgid ""
"The setup also selects the release's packaged `vmlinuz-debug.container` "
"for the default Kata configuration and sets "
"`runtime.disable_guest_seccomp=false`. Kata's packaged default otherwise "
"ignores the OCI seccomp filter even when Docker accepted the container "
"security options. That kernel is built with Kata's reviewed eBPF/BTF "
"debug fragment; the ordinary guest kernel is not sufficient for the "
"process observer. `--check` verifies both the asset and the active "
"config, and runner preflight goes further: it starts a disposable sandbox"
" with the same non-root, capability-dropped and `no-new-privileges` shape"
" as a real retained guest, then exercises the same fixed privileged exec "
"used to start the bundled observer. Its self-test requires all three "
"lifecycle probes to attach, executes one short-lived child, and requires "
"that child's fork, exec, and exit records to arrive through the ring "
"buffer. A missing BPF syscall, BTF image, tracepoint, event-delivery "
"path, or exec-time permission is therefore a deployment failure before "
"the runner can claim work, not an empty process list under a completed "
"turn. The same probe also requires the fixed tool-marker helper used by "
"Claude's exact boundaries. See Kata's [debug-kernel build "
"contract](https://github.com/kata-containers/kata-"
"containers/blob/main/tools/packaging/kernel/README.md#debug-kernel)."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本还会给默认的 Kata 配置选用发布包里的 `vmlinuz-debug.container`，并设置 "
"`runtime.disable_guest_seccomp=false`。否则，即使 Docker 接受了容器的安全选项，Kata "
"默认的打包配置也会忽略 OCI 的 seccomp 过滤器。这个内核是用 Kata 评审过的 eBPF/BTF 调试配置片段构建的；普通的 "
"guest 内核支撑不了进程观察器。`--check` 会同时检查这个内核文件和当前生效的配置，而 runner "
"的预检做得更彻底：它会启动一个用完即弃的沙箱，形态和真实的保留 guest 完全一样（非 root、去掉 capability、`no-new-"
"privileges`），然后执行和启动自带观察器时同一条固定的特权 "
"exec。它的自测要求三个生命周期探针全部挂上，再运行一个很快就结束的子进程，并要求这个子进程的 fork、exec 和 exit "
"记录都经由环形缓冲区送达。所以，无论是缺 BPF 系统调用、缺 BTF 镜像、缺 tracepoint、事件送不出来，还是 exec "
"时权限不够，都会在 runner 开始认领任务之前就表现为部署失败，而不是等到某个轮次跑完后，才发现进程列表是空的。同一个探测还要求 Claude"
" 精确划分工具边界时用到的那个固定的工具标记辅助程序可用。见 Kata 的[调试内核构建说明](https://github.com/kata-"
"containers/kata-containers/blob/main/tools/packaging/kernel/README.md"
"#debug-kernel)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1639
msgid ""
"The fixed observer and platform lifecycle helpers run as guest root. "
"Agent CLIs and repository code still run under their per-member UIDs with"
" all capabilities dropped and `no-new-privileges`; they cannot read, "
"edit, or directly inject records into the root-only journal. Claude's "
"fixed non-root marker helper talks to it over a credential-checked Unix "
"socket. A same-UID tool can still execute that helper, so exact per-tool "
"association is diagnostic, never a security or billing authority; the "
"eBPF lifecycle census itself is independent of marks. Kata containers "
"retain `BPF`, `PERFMON`, `SETUID`, `SETGID`, `CHOWN`, `DAC_OVERRIDE`, "
"`KILL` and `SYS_PTRACE` in the bounding set for the fixed guest-root "
"helpers: tracing, the UID-filter self-test, socket ownership, member "
"cleanup and verifying the marker sender's `/proc/<pid>/exe` across member"
" UIDs. Kata privileged exec cannot acquire capabilities outside that "
"original set. Ordinary exec explicitly enters through `setpriv --no-new-"
"privs`, because Kata 3.32 does not inherit PID 1's setting for Docker "
"exec. Preflight requires non-root execution, zero effective/permitted "
"capabilities, `NoNewPrivs=1` and `Seccomp=2`, then runs the observer and "
"marker self-tests and requires a real non-root pre/post pair to reach the"
" trusted observer journal. Privileged helpers also verify the **inspected"
" container's** Kata runtime and execute by that verified container ID; "
"changing a runner setting cannot promote an old runc container into a "
"guest-root target. A shared container's periodic Docker statistics are "
"group totals, so current member turns deliberately report aggregate "
"CPU/memory/I/O/network as unavailable (`coverage=0`, `sampler_version"
"=shared-member-v1`) instead of duplicating a sibling's work. Process "
"existence is separate, event-driven telemetry: fork/exec/exit survives "
"even when a process begins and ends entirely between two statistics "
"samples, and the kernel's records carry what that process consumed — the "
"group's peak RSS and the bytes it read from and dirtied to storage at "
"exit, and its scheduler runtime once it left the CPU for the last time "
"(tick-based CPU time reads zero for most sub-millisecond processes, so it"
" is not used). Those are the per-call CPU, memory and I/O numbers under "
"Kata: a process is charged to the tool call whose window alone contains "
"its start, and a process that overlapping calls could both own, one whose"
" thread group has not fully settled, or any process in a census that lost"
" events, is charged to no call and marks those calls as partial. Work "
"done inside the Agent CLI's own process belongs to no call. The self-test"
" in preflight also requires a sub-millisecond child's records to carry "
"non-zero CPU, a non-zero peak RSS and a group-exit flag, so a guest "
"kernel whose BTF does not relocate them fails deployment rather than "
"reporting zeros; storage and read/write byte accounting are kernel "
"configuration and arrive as unavailable when absent. The per-turn table "
"is therefore a member-UID lifecycle census of process starts observed "
"after that turn's cursor, not a point-in-time snapshot of resident "
"processes that were already running before the turn and not a whole-"
"container total."
msgstr ""
"固定的观察器和平台生命周期辅助程序以 guest root 身份运行。Agent CLI 和仓库代码仍然以各个成员自己的 UID 运行，去掉了所有"
" capability，并带有 `no-new-privileges`；它们没法读取、修改那份只有 root "
"能写的日志，也没法直接往里面塞记录。Claude 那个固定的、非 root 的标记辅助程序，通过一个会核对调用方身份的 Unix socket "
"和它通信。同一个 UID 下的工具仍然可以执行这个辅助程序，所以精确到每个工具的归属只能用来诊断，绝不能作为安全或计费的依据；eBPF "
"的生命周期统计本身并不依赖这些标记。Kata 容器的 capability 边界集里保留了 "
"`BPF`、`PERFMON`、`SETUID`、`SETGID`、`CHOWN`、`DAC_OVERRIDE`、`KILL` 和 "
"`SYS_PTRACE`，给固定的 guest-root 辅助程序使用，用途包括：追踪、UID 过滤器的自测、socket "
"的属主设置、成员清理，以及跨成员 UID 核实标记发送方的 `/proc/<pid>/exe`。Kata 的特权 exec 拿不到原始集合以外的 "
"capability。普通的 exec 会显式地经过 `setpriv --no-new-privs` 进入，因为 Kata 3.32 下 "
"Docker exec 不会继承 PID 1 的这项设置。预检要求：以非 root 执行、有效和允许的 capability "
"都为零、`NoNewPrivs=1` 且 `Seccomp=2`；然后运行观察器和标记的自测，并要求一对真实的、非 root 的 pre/post"
" 记录送达受信任的观察器日志。特权辅助程序还会核实**被检查的那个容器**确实用的是 Kata 运行时，并按核实过的容器 ID 执行；改一下 "
"runner 的设置，没法把一个旧的 runc 容器变成 guest-root 的目标。共享容器的周期性 Docker "
"统计是整个组的总量，所以当前成员的轮次会有意把 CPU、内存、I/O "
"和网络的汇总值报告为不可用（`coverage=0`、`sampler_version=shared-"
"member-v1`），以免把兄弟对话的工作算到自己头上。进程是否存在，则是另一种由事件驱动的遥测：即使一个进程完全在两次统计采样之间开始又结束，fork、exec、exit"
" 也照样会被记录下来，而且内核的记录里带着这个进程消耗的资源：退出时线程组的峰值 RSS、从存储读取的字节数和写脏的字节数，以及它最后一次离开 "
"CPU 时的调度运行时间（基于时钟 tick 的 CPU 时间，对大多数不到一毫秒的进程读数都是零，所以不用它）。这些就是 Kata "
"下按工具调用统计的 CPU、内存和 "
"I/O：一个进程算在唯一一个包含其启动时刻的工具调用窗口上；如果一个进程可能同时属于多个重叠的调用、它的线程组还没完全结束，或者所在的统计丢过事件，就不算在任何调用上，并把相关的调用标记为数据不完整。在"
" Agent CLI 自己的进程里完成的工作，不属于任何调用。预检里的自测还要求，一个不到一毫秒的子进程的记录里，CPU 和峰值 RSS "
"都不为零，并且带有组退出标志；所以如果 guest 内核的 BTF "
"没法重定位这些字段，部署就会失败，而不是报一堆零。存储和读写字节的统计取决于内核配置，没有的话就显示为不可用。所以，每个轮次的那张表，是一份按成员"
" UID 统计、在这一轮的游标之后观察到的进程启动的生命周期清单；它既不是这一轮开始前就已经在跑的常驻进程的某一时刻快照，也不是整个容器的总量。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1683
msgid "Guest networking"
msgstr "Guest 的网络"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1685
msgid ""
"Docker's embedded DNS resolver (`127.0.0.11`) is outside the guest. After"
" each Kata activation a trusted guest-root helper therefore writes two "
"files: a relay block in `/etc/hosts` with the relays' addresses on that "
"group's bridge, and `/etc/resolv.conf` naming `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`, "
"the only resolver the host rules let a group reach. Under runc neither is"
" touched: the container was created with `--dns` set to that same server,"
" and Docker's resolver forwards to it. There is no network switch and no "
"guest restart for networking — setup and the agent share the group's "
"bridge. A running guest is never rewired underneath it either, because "
"Docker's live network changes alone do not update Kata 3.32's guest "
"interfaces: a running sandbox that is not on exactly its group bridge is "
"refused until it has been stopped."
msgstr ""
"Docker 内置的 DNS 解析器（`127.0.0.11`）在 guest 外面。所以每次 Kata 激活之后，一个受信任的 guest-"
"root 辅助程序会写两个文件：在 `/etc/hosts` 里写一段中继条目，内容是中继在这个组网桥上的地址；在 "
"`/etc/resolv.conf` 里写上 `AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`，这是主机规则允许沙箱组访问的唯一解析器。在 "
"runc 下这两个文件都不动：容器创建时就用 `--dns` 指定了同一个服务器，Docker "
"的解析器会转发给它。网络这块没有切换，也不需要为了网络重启 guest，setup 和 agent 共用这个组的网桥。运行中的 guest "
"也绝不会在底下被重新接线，因为单靠 Docker 的在线网络变更，并不会更新 Kata 3.32 里 guest "
"的网络接口：一个正在运行、却没有恰好只接在自己组网桥上的沙箱，会被拒绝，直到它被停掉为止。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1697
msgid "Existing runc groups and activation checks"
msgstr "已有的 runc 沙箱组与激活时的检查"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1699
msgid ""
"When switching a host from runc, keep its retained runc groups on a "
"compatible sandbox manager or migrate them separately. A backend setting "
"does not change the runtime of a stopped Docker container; the privileged"
" helper fence rejects those old containers. Do not delete retained "
"workspaces as part of enabling Kata for new jobs."
msgstr ""
"把一台主机从 runc 切过来时，它保留的 runc 沙箱组要么继续放在兼容的 sandbox manager "
"上，要么单独迁移。改后端设置，并不会改变一个已停止 Docker 容器的运行时；特权辅助程序的栅栏会拒绝这些旧容器。不要在给新任务启用 Kata "
"的过程中，顺手删掉保留的工作区。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1705
msgid ""
"Requirements: an x86_64 Linux host, bare metal or with nested "
"virtualization enabled. Kata cannot run without KVM."
msgstr "要求：一台 x86_64 的 Linux 主机，物理机，或者开启了嵌套虚拟化的虚拟机。没有 KVM，Kata 就跑不起来。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1708
msgid ""
"**Installing the shim is necessary, not sufficient.** A working guest "
"kernel does not prove the sandbox can reach either relay. Before changing"
" the backend for new groups, check the provisioned runtime and the "
"running stack from the host checkout, using its `.env`:"
msgstr ""
"**装好 shim 是必要的，但还不够。** guest "
"内核能用，并不说明沙箱能连到任何一个中继。在给新的沙箱组改后端之前，先在主机上的仓库目录里，用它的 `.env` "
"检查已配置的运行时和正在运行的服务："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1718
msgid ""
"`preflight` verifies the configured image and guest kernel. `check` "
"starts relay probes under Kata on the relay network "
"(`AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK`) and requires HTTP 200 from inference `/health` "
"and MCP `/healthz`. It also checks the live runner's full sandbox "
"preflight — which installs and reads back the host tables — sandbox "
"manager, and control-plane paths. The relay network is only where "
"lifecycle finds the two relays; retained groups get their own bridges "
"during activation, and the in-guest check at each cold start covers the "
"path from there. The compose `..._internal` network is the host services'"
" network and cannot substitute for either check."
msgstr ""
"`preflight` 检查配置的镜像和 guest 内核。`check` 会在中继网络（`AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK`）上用 "
"Kata 启动中继探测，要求推理的 `/health` 和 MCP 的 `/healthz` 都返回 HTTP 200。它还会检查正在运行的 "
"runner 完整的沙箱预检（这一步会安装主机的表并读回确认）、sandbox "
"manager，以及到控制平面的各条路径。中继网络只是生命周期代码找那两个中继的地方；保留的沙箱组在激活时会拿到自己的网桥，从那里出发的路径，由每次冷启动时在"
" guest 里做的检查覆盖。compose 的 `..._internal` 网络是主机上各个服务用的网络，替代不了这两项检查中的任何一项。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1728
msgid ""
"The Kata relay probes resolve only the configured relay endpoints through"
" Docker inspection and pass their addresses into the guest, matching the "
"runtime's fixed-host approach. A bare `alpine getent` probe depends on "
"Docker's embedded DNS and does not verify this path. A failed check needs"
" diagnosis of the reported guest, relay, or service path before switching"
" new groups."
msgstr ""
"Kata 的中继探测只通过 Docker inspect 解析配置好的中继端点，再把地址传进 guest，和运行时固定写 hosts "
"的做法一致。单纯用 `alpine getent` 做探测，依赖的是 Docker 内置的 DNS，验证不了这条路径。检查失败时，先根据报告找出是"
" guest、中继还是服务那段路径出了问题，再去切换新的沙箱组。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1734
msgid ""
"After those checks pass and existing runc groups have been accounted for,"
" drop `AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container` from the host's `.env` and "
"redeploy. `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh up` repeats the checks for the "
"image it builds:"
msgstr ""
"这些检查都通过、已有的 runc 沙箱组也都处理好之后，从主机的 `.env` 里删掉 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container`，重新部署。`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh up` "
"会针对它构建的镜像，把这些检查再做一遍："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1738
msgid ""
"with the default `kata` backend, the shim must be installed, **and** one "
"real container started from the sandbox image must report a kernel that "
"is not the host's. A runtime the daemon accepts while the sandbox still "
"lands on the host kernel fails this — that is the case every cheaper "
"signal misses."
msgstr ""
"用默认的 `kata` 后端时，不仅要装好 "
"shim，**而且**从沙箱镜像启动的一个真实容器，必须报告一个和主机不同的内核。如果守护进程接受了这个运行时，沙箱却仍然跑在主机内核上，这项检查就会失败；而这恰恰是所有更省事的检查方法都会漏掉的情况。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1742
msgid ""
"there is no automatic fallback to a shared kernel. Accepting one stays "
"possible and stays explicit: set `AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container`, and "
"every deploy restates what it costs."
msgstr ""
"不会自动退回到共享内核。如果你确实接受共享内核，仍然可以，但必须明确选择：设置 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND=container`，每次部署都会再提醒一遍它的代价。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1746
msgid "Scheduling and runtime attestation"
msgstr "调度与运行时证明"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1748
msgid ""
"The control plane independently enforces the same fact at scheduling "
"time. `AGENT_DEFAULT_EXECUTION_PROFILE` is already `untrusted-kata-v1` in"
" the control-plane compose (`deploy/control-plane/docker-compose.yml`), "
"so this is the default rather than an opt-in — and the consequence of "
"that default is that **a deployment whose hosts have not been through "
"Kata provisioning claims no secure work at all**, rather than falling "
"back to a shared kernel. Set it explicitly anyway so the value is visible"
" in the deployment's `.env`, after at least one enrolled Kata Host passes"
" preflight. A secure job is claimable only when all of the following are "
"true in the same claim transaction:"
msgstr ""
"控制平面在调度时，也会独立地检查同一件事。控制平面的 compose（`deploy/control-plane/docker-"
"compose.yml`）里，`AGENT_DEFAULT_EXECUTION_PROFILE` 已经是 `untrusted-"
"kata-v1`，所以这是默认行为，不需要主动开启。这个默认值意味着：**如果部署里的主机都没有配好 "
"Kata，就根本不会认领任何需要安全隔离的任务**，而不是退回到共享内核。即便如此，在至少一台已注册的 Kata Host "
"通过预检之后，还是建议显式地设置它，让这个值在部署的 `.env` "
"里一目了然。一个需要安全隔离的任务，只有在同一个认领事务里同时满足下面所有条件，才能被认领："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1760
msgid ""
"the caller presents that Host's current enrollment-issued per-host "
"credential; there is no shared dispatcher-token claim path;"
msgstr "调用方出示的是这台 Host 当前有效的、注册时签发的、本机专属的凭据；不存在用共享 dispatcher 令牌认领的途径；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1762
msgid "the exact runner replica reports `io.containerd.kata.v2`;"
msgstr "确切的那个 runner 副本报告的是 `io.containerd.kata.v2`；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1763
msgid ""
"Python preflight started the configured sandbox image under that runtime "
"and observed a non-empty guest kernel different from the Host kernel."
msgstr "Python 预检用这个运行时启动了配置的沙箱镜像，并观察到一个非空的、和 Host 内核不同的 guest 内核。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1766
msgid ""
"The claim, not the Host's mutable heartbeat row, supplies the attempt's "
"runtime, image digest, CLI version and kernel stamp. This matters during "
"rolling deploys, when runc and Kata replicas can temporarily share one "
"Host row. A missing probe, an old runner, a custom runtime, a self-"
"declared `kata` capability or a revoked Host credential simply cannot "
"claim the secure job; there is no fallback to runc. `trusted-v1` selects "
"the reviewed shared-kernel boundary for trusted internal repositories; it"
" does not select another workspace/session executor. Every follow-up and "
"fork inherits the execution profile stored on its thread. Retained chats "
"carry the original image digest in immutable container labels and use "
"that content-addressed image for a retry before Docker returned a "
"container id; a moved image tag cannot change the chat's actual image "
"while its database row still reports the old one."
msgstr ""
"attempt 记录的运行时、镜像摘要、CLI 版本和内核标记，都来自认领本身，而不是 Host "
"那条会变的心跳记录。这一点在滚动部署时很重要，因为那时 runc 副本和 Kata 副本可能暂时共用同一条 Host 记录。缺了探测、runner"
" 版本太旧、用了自定义的运行时、自己声称有 `kata` 能力，或者 Host 凭据已被吊销，这些情况都根本认领不了需要安全隔离的任务；也没有退回"
" runc 的路径。`trusted-v1` "
"选的是评审过的、给受信任内部仓库用的共享内核边界，并不是换了一种工作区或会话执行器。每条后续消息和每次 Fork，都沿用保存在对话上的 "
"execution profile。保留的对话在不可变的容器标签里记着最初的镜像摘要；在 Docker 返回容器 ID "
"之前如果需要重试，就用这个按内容寻址的镜像。所以即使镜像标签被挪到了别的镜像上，只要数据库记录里写的还是旧镜像，对话实际用的镜像就不会变。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1779
msgid "How many runners"
msgstr "需要多少 runner"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1781
msgid ""
"The retained shared-session topology is unconditional. An ordinary chat "
"is a one-member group with one container/workspace and one live CLI "
"transport. Fork immediately invokes the pinned CLI's native fork-only "
"surface and adds a second chat/session/process to that same container. "
"Parent and child may execute concurrently without a group turn lock."
msgstr ""
"保留的共享会话拓扑是无条件启用的。一个普通对话，就是一个只有一个成员的沙箱组：一个容器和工作区，一条在线的 CLI 通道。Fork "
"会立即调用固定版本 CLI 原生的、专门用于 fork "
"的接口，在同一个容器里再加一个对话、会话和进程。父对话和子对话可以同时执行，组内没有轮次锁。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1787
msgid "Member process cleanup"
msgstr "清理成员进程"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1789
msgid ""
"Each member has a distinct fixed UID. Before handing over a turn, the "
"host captures that UID's `(pid, /proc starttime)` census through the "
"root-owned, mode-0555 `member-process-reaper` installed in the sandbox "
"image. Cleanup sends that baseline over stdin to a fresh helper, rechecks"
" identity immediately before every signal, escalates TERM→KILL, rescans, "
"and fails closed if anything survives. The baseline is never a member-"
"writable file, so repository code cannot edit it to preserve a process or"
" redirect cleanup at a reused PID."
msgstr ""
"每个成员都有一个固定且互不相同的 UID。交出一个轮次之前，主机会通过沙箱镜像里装的、root 所有、权限 0555 的 `member-"
"process-reaper`，记下这个 UID 下所有进程的 `(pid, /proc starttime)` 清单。清理时，把这份基线通过 "
"stdin 交给一个新启动的辅助进程；它在每次发信号之前都会立即重新核对进程身份，从 TERM 升级到 "
"KILL，再扫描一遍，只要还有进程没退出，就判定失败。这份基线绝不是成员能写的文件，所以仓库代码没法改它来保住某个进程，或者让清理误杀一个被复用了"
" PID 的进程。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1797
msgid ""
"`shared-sandbox-v1` is a claim attestation, not a feature switch. A host "
"must advertise it from the exact process that claims the job. A host's "
"limit is at least two, because a fork's sibling runs beside its parent; "
"`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` (default three) is that limit until an admin sets one "
"on the Servers page."
msgstr ""
"`shared-sandbox-v1` 是认领时的一项证明，不是功能开关。主机必须从实际认领任务的那个进程声明它。一台主机的并发上限至少为 "
"2，因为 Fork 出来的对话要和原对话同时运行；在管理员到 Servers 页面设置数值之前，这个上限就是 "
"`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS`（默认 3）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1802
msgid "Fork compatibility and turn ordering"
msgstr "Fork 的兼容性与轮次顺序"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1804
msgid ""
"Historical Fork additionally requires `native-fork-at-anchor-v1`, and for"
" the retained group either the host's current sandbox image being the "
"group's own, or the group's `claude-session-fork` helper matching the "
"reviewed version (recorded in `agent_sandboxes.fork_helper_version` when "
"the container was created) while the host's image still ships the exact "
"CLI version the container runs. A release therefore does not take Fork "
"away from existing chats: it rebuilds the image, but the image's helpers "
"and pinned CLIs stay the same unless the release changed them. An older, "
"unknown or unreviewed fork helper keeps the exact-image rule, so it is "
"never assumed to understand a historical anchor; nor is a host's fork "
"driver pointed at a CLI version its own image no longer ships. Sending a "
"message into a running turn follows the same CLI-version rule and does "
"not depend on the fork helper."
msgstr ""
"在历史某一轮做 Fork，还需要 `native-fork-at-"
"anchor-v1`；对于保留的沙箱组，还要满足以下两者之一：主机当前的沙箱镜像就是这个组自己用的镜像；或者这个组的 `claude-"
"session-fork` 辅助程序是评审过的那个版本（创建容器时记在 `agent_sandboxes.fork_helper_version`"
" 里），同时主机的镜像里仍带着这个容器正在用的那个确切 CLI 版本。所以发布新版本并不会让已有的对话失去 Fork "
"能力：镜像会重新构建，但只要这次发布没改动，里面的辅助程序和固定版本的 CLI 都不会变。较旧的、版本未知或没评审过的 fork "
"辅助程序，仍然按\"镜像必须完全一致\"的规则处理，绝不会假定它能理解历史某一轮的锚点；主机的 fork driver "
"也绝不会指向它自己镜像里已经没有的 CLI 版本。给一个正在运行的轮次发消息，遵循同样的 CLI 版本规则，和 fork 辅助程序无关。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1817
msgid ""
"Migration `0026_fork_helper_version` records version `2` for existing "
"groups created under this schema: both the old protocol-v2 claim gate and"
" the newer helper-version gate required that same at-anchor "
"implementation. Groups copied from a legacy database stay unrecorded. A "
"runner creating a group reports the helper version in its reservation; a "
"later reservation cannot overwrite it with a rebuilt host image's "
"version. An older API ignores the optional field, and an older runner "
"omits it, leaving new rows unrecorded until their image's capability can "
"be proved rather than inferred from the host's current image."
msgstr ""
"迁移 `0026_fork_helper_version` 会给在这个 schema 下创建的已有沙箱组记上版本 `2`：旧的协议 v2 "
"认领检查和新的辅助程序版本检查，要求的都是同一个按锚点 fork 的实现。从旧数据库复制过来的沙箱组，不做记录。runner "
"新建沙箱组时，会在预留请求里上报辅助程序的版本；之后的预留不能用重新构建后的主机镜像版本去覆盖它。旧版 API 会忽略这个可选字段，旧版 "
"runner 则根本不发它，于是新记录也保持未记录状态，直到能证明它的镜像具备这项能力为止，而不是根据主机当前的镜像去推测。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1826
msgid ""
"The Docker socket (or reviewed mTLS Engine endpoint) is the only host "
"control/data interface for chat state. No repository, workspace, Agent "
"CLI home, or session file is mapped from the host. Historical rows "
"without a shared retained sandbox are non-runnable and fail closed, "
"including an old in-flight parent observed during rollout. A waiting tail"
" inserted by the old API before cutover is failed when that parent "
"settles; it is never promoted into a newly fabricated native session."
msgstr ""
"对话状态在主机上唯一的控制和数据接口，是 Docker socket（或者评审过的 mTLS Engine 端点）。仓库、工作区、Agent "
"CLI "
"的主目录和会话文件，都不会从主机映射进去。没有共享保留沙箱的历史记录无法运行，会直接失败，包括上线期间遇到的、旧版本留下的一个还在进行中的父对话。切换之前由旧"
" API 插入的、排在后面等待的轮次，会在那个父对话结束时失败；绝不会把它升格成一个新凭空造出来的原生会话。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1834
msgid ""
"All submitted turns that have not started use `queued`, including "
"messages sent while an earlier turn is still running. A runner can claim "
"a queued turn only after every earlier turn in the same chat is terminal."
" Cancelling an intermediate queued turn does not let later messages "
"overtake an active earlier turn. There is no separate promotion step or "
"`waiting` job state."
msgstr ""
"所有已提交但还没开始的轮次，都处于 `queued` "
"状态，包括在前一轮还在运行时发出的消息。只有同一个对话里所有更早的轮次都进入终态之后，runner "
"才能认领一个排队的轮次。取消中间某个排队的轮次，也不会让后面的消息插队到一个仍在进行的更早轮次前面。没有单独的\"提升\"步骤，也没有 "
"`waiting` 这种任务状态。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1840
msgid ""
"Terminal freezing is also member-concurrent: each protected job phase "
"owns a separate Sandbox Manager suspension token for the shared "
"workspace. Completing or recovering one sibling releases only that token;"
" interactive PTYs are resumed only when no sibling remains in a protected"
" phase."
msgstr ""
"终端冻结也是按成员各自处理的：每个受保护的任务阶段，都为共享工作区单独持有一个 Sandbox Manager "
"挂起令牌。一个兄弟对话完成或恢复时，只释放它自己的令牌；只有在没有任何兄弟对话还处于受保护阶段时，交互式 PTY 才会恢复。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1845
msgid "Execution slots"
msgstr "执行槽位"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1847
msgid ""
"Set concurrency from the admin Servers page. The runner container runs "
"one service per host. It enrolls, heartbeats and samples capacity — the "
"things a machine does once — and it claims a turn only while it is under "
"its limit, starting a process for that turn as it claims it. That process"
" runs the turn to completion and exits. So the limit _is_ how many turns "
"the host runs at once, and everything else waits in the queue. Each "
"turn's sandbox is capped at 4g / 2 cpus, so budget roughly that per "
"concurrent turn."
msgstr ""
"并发在管理后台的 Servers 页面设置。runner "
"容器在每台主机上只跑一个服务，负责注册、心跳和采集容量这些一台机器只需做一次的事；只有在没达到上限时，它才认领轮次，每认领一个就为它启动一个进程。这个进程把这一轮跑完就退出。所以这个上限*就是*主机同时运行的轮次数，其余的都在队列里等着。每个轮次的沙箱上限是"
" 4g / 2 cpus，按每个并发轮次大约占这么多来规划资源。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1855
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Set it on the Servers page (_Execution slots_, the field under the "
"numbers), or with `PUT /admin/agent/runner-hosts/<host>/slots` and "
"`{\"slots\": N}`; `null` returns the host to its `AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` "
"default. Nothing is started or stopped to apply it: the host reads the "
"number off its next heartbeat answer and serves it from then on."
msgstr ""
"可以在 Servers 页面上设置（*Execution slots*，在数字下方的那个字段），也可以用 `PUT /admin/agent"
"/runner-hosts/<host>/slots`，请求体是 `{\"slots\": N}`；传 `null` 会让主机回到它的 "
"`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` 默认值。应用这个值不需要启动或停止任何东西：主机会从下一次心跳的应答里读到这个数字，从那以后就按它来。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1861
msgid ""
"**Saving is not applying, and the page distinguishes them.** The "
"heartbeat reports the limit the host is serving back as `slots_total`, "
"and the claim admits against the lower of that and the saved number. "
"Lowering therefore takes effect immediately, before the host has heard "
"about it, and turns already running are untouched — they finish, and the "
"host claims nothing more until it is under the new limit; the page counts"
" those as _finishing_. Raising takes effect when the host confirms, one "
"heartbeat away, and until then the row says _applying N_. A host that is "
"offline says _N not applied_, and one whose runner predates remote limits"
" says _redeploy to change_."
msgstr ""
"**保存不等于生效，页面会把两者区分开。** 心跳会以 `slots_total` "
"回报主机实际使用的上限，认领时按它和已保存数值中较小的那个来判断。所以调低会立即生效，甚至在主机知道之前就生效了；已经在跑的轮次不受影响，它们会跑完，在降到新上限以下之前，主机不会再认领新的轮次，页面把这些显示为"
" *finishing*。调高要等主机确认之后才生效，也就是再过一次心跳；在那之前，这一行显示 *applying N*。离线的主机显示 *N "
"not applied*；如果 runner 早于\"远程设置上限\"这个功能，就显示 *redeploy to change*。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1871
msgid ""
"The bounds are two through 128. Two is the shared-live floor; 128 is a "
"typo guard the host checks again, and neither is a statement about what "
"the machine can carry — the CPU and memory on the same page are. The "
"saved number survives heartbeats, restarts and re-enrolment: it is a "
"decision about the named machine, and only _Host default_ returns it to "
"the environment."
msgstr ""
"可设范围是 2 到 128。2 是 shared-live 的下限；128 "
"只是防止手误，主机那边还会再检查一次。两者都不代表这台机器实际能承受多少，那要看同一页面上的 CPU "
"和内存。保存的数值在心跳、重启和重新注册之后都会保留，因为它是针对这台具名机器做的决定；只有选择 *Host "
"default*，才会让它回到环境变量里的值。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1877
msgid "Removing a server"
msgstr "移除服务器"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1879
msgid ""
"Open a server's details on the admin Servers page and choose **Remove "
"server** from its action menu. Confirm permanent removal to delete its "
"allocation, nodes, registered hosts, host settings and capacity history, "
"node registration tokens, admission holds, and compute activity. Shared "
"connections and deployment profiles remain available. User conversations,"
" runs, and deleted-sandbox audit records are preserved."
msgstr ""
"在管理后台的 Servers 页面打开一台服务器的详情，从操作菜单里选 **Remove "
"server**。确认永久移除后，会删除它的分配、节点、已注册的主机、主机设置和容量历史、节点注册令牌、准入限制，以及计算资源的操作记录。共用的连接和部署配置仍然保留。用户的对话、运行记录，以及已删除沙箱的审计记录，都会保留下来。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1886
msgid ""
"Release cloud resources before removing their records. Attached servers "
"without release support can be removed after their hosts are disabled. "
"Remove retained sandboxes through the sandbox deletion flow and wait for "
"cleanup to finish; clear the default placement pin, running attempts, and"
" deployment drains first. Removal checks these dependencies in the same "
"transaction as cleanup. An acquisition that never submitted to its "
"provider can be removed even when resource observation is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"删除记录之前，先把云资源释放掉。不支持释放的已挂接服务器，可以在禁用它的主机之后移除。保留的沙箱，要通过沙箱删除流程移除，并等清理完成；还要先清掉默认的放置固定、正在运行的"
" attempt 和部署排空。移除时会在清理的同一个事务里检查这些依赖。如果一次申请从没提交给服务商，即使资源观察不可用，也可以直接移除。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1894
msgid ""
"Removal also refuses with _The external operation is unresolved_ in three"
" cases. The server's **Activity** tab lists the operations involved:"
msgstr ""
"另外还有三种情况，移除会以 *The external operation is unresolved* 拒绝。服务器的 **Activity**"
" 标签页会列出涉及的操作："

#: ../developer/operations.md:1897
msgid ""
"An operation that is running, or waiting while it confirms a provider "
"call (an acquisition waiting for its experiment, an extension or a "
"release waiting for the provider's answer), is still in progress. Wait "
"for it to finish or stop."
msgstr "操作正在运行，或者正在等待确认一次服务商调用（申请在等它的实验，续期或释放在等服务商的答复），说明它还没结束。等它完成或停止。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1900
msgid ""
"An operation whose outcome is `unknown`, such as an acquisition whose "
"create request timed out, waits for an administrator, and a release "
"requested meanwhile waits behind it. Open it and retry it or, for an "
"acquisition, adopt the experiment it created."
msgstr ""
"结果为 `unknown` "
"的操作，比如创建请求超时的申请，要等管理员来处理，这期间请求的释放也排在它后面。打开它重试；如果是申请，也可以认定它创建的那个实验。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1904
msgid ""
"A server that never recorded its provider resource is refused while one "
"of its operations suggests the provider has one: an answer that named it,"
" an acquisition past submission, a registered node, or a call never "
"confirmed. Release the server. The release deletes a resource an "
"operation named, and otherwise records that there is none, so first check"
" the provider for one the request created."
msgstr "服务器从没记录过它的服务商资源，而它的某个操作显示服务商那边可能有一个时，移除会被拒绝。这类迹象包括：服务商的答复里提到过这个资源、申请已经过了提交这一步、有节点已经注册，或者某次调用一直没有得到确认。这时要释放这台服务器。释放会删除操作里提到的资源；没有提到的话，就记为不存在资源，所以先去服务商那里查一下，这次请求有没有创建出东西。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1911
msgid ""
"Once the provider has confirmed the machine gone, an operation that "
"stopped (blocked, failed or cancelled) no longer keeps the server, even "
"one that stopped while it was confirming a provider call: that call can "
"change nothing now."
msgstr "服务商一旦确认机器已经没了，停下来的操作（被阻塞、失败或已取消）就不会再挡住这台服务器，即使它是在确认服务商调用时停下的：那次调用现在已经改变不了什么了。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1915
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The compute API is `DELETE /admin/agent/servers/<allocation_id>` with "
"`{\"expected_revision\": N}`. A revision conflict requires refreshing the"
" server. For hosts without an allocation, the action uses the existing "
"guarded `DELETE /admin/agent/runner-hosts/<host>` endpoint. Stop an "
"unmanaged host agent before removal; inventory cleanup does not shut down"
" its machine or remove files."
msgstr ""
"计算资源的 API 是 `DELETE /admin/agent/servers/<allocation_id>`，请求体是 "
"`{\"expected_revision\": N}`。修订号冲突时，需要先刷新这台服务器。没有分配的主机，这个操作走现有的、带保护的 "
"`DELETE /admin/agent/runner-hosts/<host>` 接口。非托管的主机 agent "
"要先停掉再移除；清单清理不会关掉那台机器，也不会删除文件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1921
msgid "Sandbox settings"
msgstr "沙箱设置"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1923
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use the admin settings pages for sandbox and workspace limits. The turn "
"time limit, repository size limit, container CPU, memory and disk limits,"
" sandbox idle timeout, sessions per sandbox, workspace command/file "
"limits and terminal resource limits sit in the _Sandbox_ card on the "
"_Settings_ page, once for every server, and in the _Sandbox_ table of "
"each server's details on the _Servers_ page for that server alone; the "
"API is `PUT /admin/agent/host-settings` and `PUT /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts/<host>/settings` with `{\"settings\": {\"<key>\": N}}`, where "
"`null` clears a key. A server's own value wins over the global one, and a"
" setting set in neither place uses its built-in default. Migration "
"`0036_host_settings_import` imports existing valid nondefault `.env` "
"observations as per-server settings without replacing an administrator's "
"choices. Hosts without a complete report finish this import through their"
" initial heartbeats. Admin edits and resets exclude only the changed keys"
" from pending imports, so unrelated legacy customizations are preserved. "
"Global exclusions also protect newly enrolled hosts. Subsequent `.env` "
"edits have no effect, and clearing an override never restores them. "
"`ENVIRONMENT.md` §_Sandbox settings from the admin pages_ lists the "
"precedence and initial variables. They ride the heartbeat answer like the"
" slot limit, so nothing is redeployed, and the same rule holds: saving is"
" not applying. Each host reports what it applies, the runner's share as "
"it hands each turn over and the sandbox manager's as the sandbox manager "
"confirms it, and the page shows _applying_ until the report matches. "
"Nothing running is cut short: a turn keeps the time limit it started "
"with, an existing sandbox keeps its CPU, memory, disk quota and chat "
"capacity, and a shortened terminal lifetime closes terminals already past"
" it on the sandbox manager's next sweep. A runner that does not advertise"
" `host-settings-v1` keeps its `.env` values until it is redeployed."
msgstr ""
"沙箱和工作区的限制，都在管理设置页面里配置。轮次时间上限、仓库大小上限、容器的 "
"CPU、内存和磁盘上限、沙箱空闲超时、每个沙箱的会话数、工作区命令和文件的限制，以及终端资源限制，有两个地方可以设：*Settings* 页面的 "
"*Sandbox* 卡片里，对所有服务器生效；*Servers* 页面里每台服务器详情的 *Sandbox* 表格里，只对那一台生效。对应的 "
"API 是 `PUT /admin/agent/host-settings` 和 `PUT /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts/<host>/settings`，请求体是 `{\"settings\": {\"<key>\": N}}`，传 `null` "
"就清除这一项。服务器自己的值优先于全局值，两处都没设的就用内置默认值。迁移 `0036_host_settings_import` "
"会把已有的、有效的、非默认的 `.env` "
"观察值，导入为对应服务器的设置，但不会覆盖管理员已经做出的选择。还没上报完整数据的主机，靠它最初的几次心跳完成导入。管理员编辑或重置某一项时，只会把改动的那几项从待导入列表里去掉，其他旧的自定义值都保留。全局层面去掉的项，对新注册的主机同样有效。之后再改"
" `.env` 不会起任何作用，清除覆盖值也绝不会把它们恢复回来。优先级和初始变量见 `ENVIRONMENT.md` 里的 "
"*在管理页面上设置的沙箱参数* "
"一节。这些值和槽位上限一样随心跳的应答下发，不需要重新部署，同样的规则也适用：保存不等于生效。每台主机都会上报自己实际应用的值：runner "
"那部分在交出每个轮次时上报，sandbox manager 那部分在 sandbox manager 确认时上报；上报的值对上之前，页面一直显示 "
"*applying*。正在运行的东西不会被中途截断：一个轮次仍按它开始时的时间上限执行；已有的沙箱保持原来的 "
"CPU、内存、磁盘配额和对话容量；终端寿命改短之后，已经超时的终端会在 sandbox manager 下一轮巡检时关闭。不声明 `host-"
"settings-v1` 的 runner，在重新部署之前会一直用自己 `.env` 里的值。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1952
msgid ""
"The container size controls apply to each new sandbox group, shared by "
"its conversation and forks. Defaults are 2 vCPU, 4 GiB memory, and disk 0"
" (no per-container quota). CPU accepts fractional vCPU; memory and disk "
"accept MiB or GiB. A positive disk limit bounds the writable layer, "
"including the workspace and installed files, using Docker's `--storage-"
"opt size=`. It requires `overlay2` on XFS mounted with project quotas "
"(`pquota` or `prjquota`); Docker rejects creation on an unsupported host."
" Existing groups keep their original limits through follow-ups, restarts,"
" snapshots and Fork. See `ENVIRONMENT.md` for bootstrap variables and "
"storage requirements."
msgstr ""
"容器大小的设置作用于每个新建的沙箱组，组里的对话和 Fork 共用这些资源。默认是 2 vCPU、4 GiB 内存，磁盘为 "
"0（不设单容器配额）。CPU 可以填小数的 vCPU；内存和磁盘可以用 MiB 或 GiB。磁盘上限设为正数时，会用 Docker 的 "
"`--storage-opt size=` 限制可写层，包括工作区和安装的文件。这要求 `overlay2` 跑在用项目配额（`pquota` 或"
" `prjquota`）挂载的 XFS 上；主机不支持的话，Docker 会拒绝创建容器。已有的沙箱组在后续消息、重启、快照和 Fork "
"时，都保持原来的限制。初始化变量和存储要求见 `ENVIRONMENT.md`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1962
msgid ""
"**Recommended for servers that run untrusted work.** An `untrusted-"
"kata-v1` sandbox's writable layer holds its workspace and every installed"
" file, survives `docker stop`, and shares one disk with every other "
"sandbox on the server, so without a disk limit one tenant can fill that "
"disk for all of them. Set **Container disk** above 0 on each Kata server "
"once its Docker data root is on XFS with project quotas. This is a "
"recommendation, not a requirement: scheduling and admission do not "
"change, and a server left at 0 keeps taking untrusted work. Each claim "
"reports the limit a new group would get (the claim attestation's "
"`sandbox_disk_limit_mib`). The control plane logs "
"`agent_untrusted_sandbox_without_disk_quota` when it hands such a server "
"a new untrusted group, the runner logs the same event as it starts that "
"group, and the Servers page shows **No container disk quota** under that "
"server's Storage. Existing groups keep the limit they were created with "
"and are not flagged."
msgstr ""
"**建议在运行不受信任任务的服务器上设置。** 一个 `untrusted-kata-v1` "
"沙箱的可写层里存着它的工作区和所有安装的文件，`docker stop` "
"之后也还在，并且和这台服务器上其他所有沙箱共用一块磁盘；所以不设磁盘上限的话，一个租户就可能把这块磁盘写满，影响所有人。只要某台 Kata "
"服务器的 Docker 数据目录在带项目配额的 XFS 上，就把它的 **Container disk** 设成大于 "
"0。这是建议，不是硬性要求：调度和准入都不会因此改变，保持 0 的服务器照样接不受信任的任务。每次认领都会上报新建沙箱组会拿到的上限（认领证明里的"
" `sandbox_disk_limit_mib`）。控制平面把一个新的不受信任沙箱组交给这样的服务器时，会记录 "
"`agent_untrusted_sandbox_without_disk_quota`；runner "
"启动这个组时也会记录同样的事件；Servers 页面会在这台服务器的 Storage 下面显示 **No container disk "
"quota**。已有的沙箱组保持创建时的上限，不会被标记。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1977
msgid "Sandbox archives"
msgstr "沙箱归档"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1979
msgid ""
"This policy captures automatic initial and final lifecycle archives. The "
"explicit **Archive to S3 and delete** control has its own control-plane "
"storage configuration, documented in [Sandbox archive storage](#sandbox-"
"archive-storage)."
msgstr ""
"这个策略负责自动生成的初始归档和最终生命周期归档。显式操作 **Archive to S3 and delete** "
"有它自己的控制平面存储配置，见[沙箱归档存储](#sandbox-archive-storage)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1983
msgid ""
"Use the **Sandbox archives** card under **Admin → Settings → Sandbox** to"
" store the deployment-wide archive policy in the Agent database. The "
"destination is fixed at `s3://freeinference/cloud-agent/sandbox`; it is "
"displayed read-only and is never accepted from the browser. The "
"destination is a source constant (`SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_S3_URI` in "
"`cloud_agent_shared/sandbox_archive_settings.py`), so a distribution "
"archiving to another bucket changes it there; the IAM policy below names "
"the same bucket and prefix. An administrator atomically saves the enabled"
" state, AWS region, maximum compressed archive size, multipart threshold,"
" and part size. Authentication is either an AWS access key or the "
"workload-identity pair: a customer-managed KMS key ARN and the expected "
"12-digit bucket owner. An access key makes that pair optional; uploads "
"then use SSE-S3 unless a KMS key is also set. The secret is write-only, "
"encrypted at rest, and omitted from the audit row. Updates use the "
"revision returned by the last read, so two administrators cannot silently"
" overwrite each other. Every change is recorded in the Audit log."
msgstr ""
"在 **Admin → Settings → Sandbox** 下的 **Sandbox archives** "
"卡片里，把部署级别的归档策略保存到 Agent 数据库。存放位置固定为 `s3://freeinference/cloud-"
"agent/sandbox`，只读显示，绝不接受浏览器传来的值。这个位置是写在源码里的常量（`cloud_agent_shared/sandbox_archive_settings.py`"
" 里的 `SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_S3_URI`），所以如果发行版要归档到别的桶，就在那里改；下面的 IAM "
"策略写的也是同一个桶和前缀。管理员一次性保存这几项：是否开启、AWS 区域、压缩后归档的最大大小、分段上传的阈值和分段大小。认证有两种方式：一组 "
"AWS 访问密钥；或者 workload identity 需要的一对字段，即客户自管的 KMS 密钥 ARN 和预期的 12 "
"位桶所有者账号。用访问密钥时，这对字段可以不填；这时上传使用 SSE-S3，除非另外也设了 KMS 密钥。secret "
"只能写入，加密保存，也不会出现在审计记录里。更新时要带上次读取返回的修订号，所以两个管理员不会悄悄覆盖彼此的修改。每次改动都会记在 Audit "
"log 里。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:1999
msgid ""
"The dashboard uses admin-only `GET` and `PUT` `/admin/agent/sandbox-"
"archive-settings`. To inspect the same policy and host rollout directly "
"in Postgres, use read-only queries such as:"
msgstr ""
"仪表盘用的是只有管理员能调用的 `GET` 和 `PUT` `/admin/agent/sandbox-archive-"
"settings`。如果想直接在 Postgres 里查看同一份策略，以及各主机的生效情况，可以用这样的只读查询："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2016
msgid ""
"Do not put archive policy, the destination, or an AWS access key in "
"`.env`. Enter an access key on the Sandbox archives card when the sandbox"
" manager has no workload identity. The control plane encrypts the secret "
"before storing it and sends it to the sandbox manager on the "
"authenticated heartbeat channel. The sandbox manager keeps it in memory "
"for S3. Sandbox markers do not contain it, so it does not enter the "
"container. A sandbox manager that predates access-key support rejects "
"that heartbeat payload and does not confirm the revision; upgrade those "
"sandbox managers before relying on the key. With no access key, the "
"sandbox manager uses the host's AWS workload identity and the ordinary "
"SDK credential chain. That identity needs the narrow S3 multipart/write "
"and exact object-metadata permissions for the fixed prefix, plus encrypt "
"access to the configured KMS key. The bucket must have versioning "
"enabled. Configure lifecycle retention and access logging on the bucket "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"不要把归档策略、存放位置或 AWS 访问密钥写进 `.env`。如果 sandbox manager 没有 workload "
"identity，就在 Sandbox archives 卡片上填写访问密钥。控制平面会先加密这个 secret "
"再保存，并通过带认证的心跳通道发给 sandbox manager。sandbox manager 只把它放在内存里，供访问 S3 "
"用。沙箱标记里不包含它，所以它不会进入容器。不支持访问密钥的旧版 sandbox "
"manager，会拒绝这份心跳数据，也不会确认这个修订；要用访问密钥，先把这些 sandbox manager "
"升级。没有访问密钥时，sandbox manager 使用主机的 AWS workload identity 和普通的 SDK "
"凭据链。这个身份需要对固定前缀拥有范围很窄的 S3 分段上传和写入权限、对具体对象的元数据权限，以及对配置的 KMS "
"密钥的加密权限。桶必须开启版本控制。生命周期保留规则和访问日志，在桶本身上配置。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2030
msgid ""
"Concretely, grant the sandbox manager role `s3:GetBucketVersioning` on "
"`arn:aws:s3:::freeinference`; `s3:ListBucket` on that bucket constrained "
"to the `cloud-agent/sandbox/*` prefix (so an exact-key `HeadObject` can "
"distinguish a missing immutable initial object from an authorization "
"failure); and `s3:GetObject`, `s3:PutObject`, and "
"`s3:AbortMultipartUpload` on `arn:aws:s3:::freeinference/cloud-"
"agent/sandbox/*`. The configured KMS key policy must permit "
"`kms:GenerateDataKey` and `kms:Decrypt` for SSE-KMS multipart uploads. An"
" access key needs those same S3 actions; SSE-S3 uploads do not call KMS. "
"Add an `AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload` bucket lifecycle rule as defense "
"in depth for a host that disappears before its bounded abort request "
"completes."
msgstr ""
"具体来说，要给 sandbox manager 的角色授予：对 `arn:aws:s3:::freeinference` 的 "
"`s3:GetBucketVersioning`；对这个桶、并限定在 `cloud-agent/sandbox/*` 前缀下的 "
"`s3:ListBucket`（这样按确切键执行的 `HeadObject`，才能区分\"不可变的初始对象还不存在\"和\"没有权限\"）；以及对"
" `arn:aws:s3:::freeinference/cloud-agent/sandbox/*` 的 "
"`s3:GetObject`、`s3:PutObject` 和 `s3:AbortMultipartUpload`。配置的 KMS "
"密钥策略，必须允许 SSE-KMS 分段上传所需的 `kms:GenerateDataKey` 和 "
"`kms:Decrypt`。用访问密钥时，也需要同样这些 S3 操作；SSE-S3 上传不会调用 KMS。再加一条 "
"`AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload` 的桶生命周期规则作为兜底，以防某台主机在它有时限的中止请求完成之前就消失了。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2042
msgid ""
"Enabling archives requires migration `0042_sandbox_archive_settings` and "
"a runner/sandbox manager advertising `sandbox-archive-settings-v1`. The "
"settings card distinguishes the saved database revision from the revision"
" each sandbox manager has confirmed applying. While archives are enabled,"
" new claims fail closed on hosts or exact runner replicas that have not "
"applied that revision; disabling the policy preserves compatibility with "
"older hosts."
msgstr ""
"开启归档需要迁移 `0042_sandbox_archive_settings`，以及声明了 `sandbox-archive-"
"settings-v1` 的 runner 和 sandbox manager。设置卡片会把数据库里保存的修订号，和每个 sandbox "
"manager 确认已应用的修订号分开显示。归档开启期间，如果某台主机或某个 runner "
"副本还没应用这个修订，新的认领在它上面会直接失败；关闭这个策略，就能继续兼容旧主机。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2049
msgid "This is a lifecycle archive, not a per-turn transcript log:"
msgstr "这是生命周期归档，不是每一轮的对话记录："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2051
msgid ""
"the initial object captures `/workspace` once after source/setup and "
"before the first Agent process receives a prompt;"
msgstr "初始对象在源码和 setup 完成之后、第一个 Agent 进程收到提示词之前，对 `/workspace` 拍一次；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2053
msgid ""
"each sandbox-manager-managed clean stop flushes native Agent state and "
"stores a final object containing `/workspace`, `/agent-state`, and the "
"optional `/home/agent/.freeinference-platform` state;"
msgstr ""
"每次由 sandbox manager 正常执行的停止，都会先把原生 Agent 的状态写盘，再保存一个最终对象，包含 `/workspace"
"`、`/agent-state`，以及可选的 `/home/agent/.freeinference-platform` 状态；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2056
msgid ""
"repeated turns while the sandbox remains live do not create objects. A "
"later wake followed by another clean stop replaces the deterministic "
"final key; S3 bucket versioning retains its earlier object versions "
"according to the bucket's lifecycle policy."
msgstr ""
"沙箱一直在线期间的多次轮次，不会生成新的对象。之后如果唤醒、又一次正常停止，会覆盖那个固定的最终对象键；S3 "
"桶的版本控制会按桶的生命周期策略，保留它以前的对象版本。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2061
msgid ""
"Policy changes are forward-only. Enabling archives cannot reconstruct the"
" true pre-prompt baseline of a sandbox that already ran while the policy "
"was disabled, so such a sandbox can have a final object without an "
"initial object. Disabling prevents new archive preparations and can leave"
" an earlier initial object without a later final. It does not abandon "
"durable work that was already prepared while enabled: an initial baseline"
" whose upload result is unresolved, or a clean stop already fenced for "
"final capture, remains pinned to its original revision and finishes under"
" that revision. For paired before/after archives, enable the policy and "
"wait for the settings page to show the revision applied on every "
"compatible server before admitting new work; stop or drain those "
"sandboxes before disabling it."
msgstr "策略的改动只对之后生效。如果一个沙箱在策略关闭期间就已经运行过，开启归档也没法补出它真正的、提示词之前的基线，所以这样的沙箱可能只有最终对象，没有初始对象。关闭策略会阻止新的归档准备，可能留下一个只有初始对象、没有之后最终对象的情况。但它不会放弃开启期间已经准备好的持久化工作：上传结果还不确定的初始基线，或者已经为最终捕获设好栅栏的正常停止，都会固定在原来的修订上，并按那个修订完成。如果需要成对的\"前后\"归档，就开启策略，并等设置页面显示每台兼容的服务器都已应用这个修订之后，再开始接新的任务；关闭策略之前，先把那些沙箱停掉或排空。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2073
msgid ""
"The initial object is immutable and retry-safe. Final capture is "
"synchronous with the stop hook, bounded by the configured size and "
"operation deadline, and an exhausted upload is reported as a failed clean"
" stop instead of being called successful. The initial and final archives "
"are an export/forensics boundary: nothing lists, downloads or replays "
"them. Restoring a sandbox on another host uses the separate [restorable "
"checkpoints](#restorable-checkpoints) below, and the retained Docker "
"writable layer remains authoritative for normal stop/start continuity."
msgstr ""
"初始对象是不可变的，重试也安全。最终捕获和停止钩子同步执行，受配置的大小上限和操作截止时间约束；如果上传重试用尽，会报告为一次失败的正常停止，而不是谎称成功。初始归档和最终归档只用于导出和事后取证：没有任何功能会列出、下载或重放它们。要在另一台主机上恢复沙箱，用的是下面单独的[可恢复检查点"
"](#restorable-checkpoints)；平时停止再启动时，仍以保留的 Docker 可写层为准。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2082
msgid ""
"A stop the Sandbox Manager did not perform cleanly has no final archive. "
"This covers a host crash or reboot, a Sandbox Manager that exited while "
"sandboxes kept running, a `docker stop` issued behind it, and a native "
"transport that failed to close. Native history cannot be proven flushed "
"in those cases, so the Sandbox Manager records a `skipped` final marker "
"(event `sandbox_final_archive_skipped`) instead of uploading, releases "
"the bridge, and lets the chat continue: the next turn resumes through the"
" ordinary native-resume checks, exactly as with archives disabled. The "
"next clean stop archives normally, so S3 then holds no final for the "
"skipped stop. Groups that an older Sandbox Manager marked `blocked` are "
"treated the same way after the upgrade. Only a group whose skip cannot be"
" written durably, or one found before any policy has been delivered, "
"stays fenced with its bridge until reconciliation succeeds."
msgstr ""
"不是由 Sandbox Manager 正常执行的停止，就没有最终归档。这包括：主机崩溃或重启；Sandbox Manager "
"退出了，沙箱却还在跑；有人绕过它执行了 `docker stop`；以及原生传输通道没能正常关闭。这些情况下，无法证明原生历史已经写盘，所以 "
"Sandbox Manager 不会上传，而是记一个 `skipped` 的最终标记（事件 "
"`sandbox_final_archive_skipped`），释放网桥，并让对话继续：下一轮照常经过原生恢复检查后接着跑，和关闭归档时一模一样。下一次正常停止会照常归档，所以"
" S3 里不会有被跳过的那次停止的最终对象。旧版 Sandbox Manager 标为 `blocked` "
"的沙箱组，升级后也按同样的方式处理。只有在跳过记录没法持久写入，或者在任何策略下发之前就被发现的沙箱组，才会连同它的网桥一起被隔离，直到调和成功为止。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2095
msgid "Restorable checkpoints"
msgstr "可恢复检查点"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2097
msgid ""
"While archives are enabled, every clean archived stop also stores one "
"more object: a checkpoint of the container's changes over its sandbox "
"image. This is on by default; clear **Save restorable checkpoints** on "
"the same settings card to opt out, and disabling archives disables "
"checkpoints. The Sandbox Manager runs `docker container commit` on the "
"stopped container and uploads an OCI image archive that holds only the "
"commit's manifest, config and new layers to `cloud-"
"agent/sandbox/v2/<sha256(sandbox id)>/g<generation>/<checkpoint "
"id>.oci.tar`. The key names the sandbox, not the host, so another server "
"can restore it; see [Restoring a removed host's sandboxes](#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes)."
msgstr ""
"归档开启期间，每次带归档的正常停止，还会多存一个对象：容器相对于沙箱镜像的改动检查点。这项功能默认开启；在同一张设置卡片上取消勾选 **Save "
"restorable checkpoints** 就能关闭，关闭归档也会一并关闭检查点。Sandbox Manager 会对已停止的容器执行 "
"`docker container commit`，然后上传一个 OCI 镜像归档，里面只有这次 commit 的 manifest、config"
" 和新增的层，路径是 `cloud-agent/sandbox/v2/<sha256(sandbox "
"id)>/g<generation>/<checkpoint "
"id>.oci.tar`。这个路径标识的是沙箱而不是主机，所以别的服务器也能恢复它；见[恢复被移除主机上的沙箱](#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2107
msgid ""
"Checkpoints require archives and use the same bucket, credentials, size "
"limit and IAM permissions on `cloud-agent/sandbox/*`. Each object is "
"written once (`If-None-Match`); a retry after a lost response must find "
"identical bytes."
msgstr ""
"检查点依赖归档，用的是同一个桶、同样的凭据、同样的大小上限，以及对 `cloud-agent/sandbox/*` 的同一套 IAM "
"权限。每个对象只写一次（`If-None-Match`）；响应丢失后重试时，必须找到完全相同的字节。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2110
msgid ""
"A checkpoint never fails a stop. It runs after the final archive is "
"durable; a failure is logged as `sandbox_checkpoint_failed` and the stop "
"completes. It shares the final archive's capture slot and deadline, and "
"adds a commit, an export and an upload to each clean stop."
msgstr ""
"检查点绝不会让一次停止失败。它在最终归档持久化之后才运行；失败时记一条 "
"`sandbox_checkpoint_failed`，停止照常完成。它和最终归档共用同一个捕获槽位和截止时间，会让每次正常停止多做一次 "
"commit、一次导出和一次上传。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2114
msgid ""
"The Sandbox Manager reads the new layers straight from containerd's "
"content store, mounted read-only at `AGENT_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR`. Host "
"Compose binds `AGENT_HOST_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR` (default "
"`/var/lib/containerd/io.containerd.content.v1.content`, the system "
"containerd behind Docker's containerd image store) there. Blobs are named"
" by digest and every byte copied is checked against it; a damaged blob "
"fails the checkpoint. The mount grants nothing the Docker socket does not"
" already grant. When the mount is missing, empty, or belongs to another "
"daemon, the Sandbox Manager logs `sandbox_checkpoint_content_unavailable`"
" and falls back to `docker image save`, which streams the whole image "
"(once per image for the base scan, then once per checkpoint). It keeps "
"only the blobs the committed image uses: a classic (overlay2) image "
"store's save also emits metadata blobs no manifest names, which a restore"
" would refuse. On a CloudLab Kata host the save path took about 90 "
"seconds per export for a 12 MiB change; the content-store path writes "
"only the change."
msgstr ""
"Sandbox Manager 直接从 containerd 的内容存储里读取新增的层，这个存储以只读方式挂载在 "
"`AGENT_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR`。主机 Compose 会把 "
"`AGENT_HOST_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR`（默认 "
"`/var/lib/containerd/io.containerd.content.v1.content`，也就是 Docker 的 "
"containerd 镜像存储背后那个系统级 containerd）绑定到这里。blob 都以摘要命名，复制的每个字节都会对照摘要校验；blob "
"损坏的话，检查点就失败。这个挂载授予的权限，没有超出 Docker socket "
"本来就有的范围。如果挂载不存在、是空的，或者属于另一个守护进程，Sandbox Manager 会记一条 "
"`sandbox_checkpoint_content_unavailable`，退回到用 `docker image save` "
"流式导出整个镜像（扫描基础镜像时每个镜像导出一次，之后每个检查点各导出一次）。它只保留 commit 后的镜像实际用到的 blob：经典的 "
"overlay2 镜像存储在 save 时，还会输出一些没有任何 manifest 引用的元数据 blob，恢复时会拒绝它们。在一台 "
"CloudLab Kata 主机上实测，对一个 12 MiB 的改动，save 这条路每次导出大约要 90 秒；而内容存储这条路只写改动本身。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2129
msgid ""
"The Sandbox Manager keeps the latest receipt per sandbox under "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR/checkpoints` and repeats it on every "
"heartbeat. The control plane records it in `agent_sandbox_checkpoints` "
"only when it names the group's current host, generation and container. "
"The admin sandbox page shows the latest one. Receipts are recorded as "
"`reported` and become `verified` once a restore has loaded and started "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Sandbox Manager 在 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR/checkpoints` "
"下给每个沙箱保留最新的一张回执，并在每次心跳里重复上报。只有回执上写的是这个组当前的主机、代次和容器，控制平面才会把它记进 "
"`agent_sandbox_checkpoints`。管理后台的沙箱页面会显示最新的一张。回执刚记录时是 "
"`reported`，等到某次恢复成功加载并启动了它，才变成 `verified`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2135
msgid ""
"Each receipt names the control plane's start fence (`start_seq`) for the "
"run its stop ended. Every path that may start the container (a turn, a "
"workspace file, terminal, Git or environment request, a Fork, a snapshot "
"capture or a base import) advances the fence first and sends the value it"
" took with the request itself: in its body, or for a workspace request in"
" an `X-Agent-Start-Seq` header. The Sandbox Manager labels a run only "
"with the fences of the requests it admitted to that run. Once the run "
"stops, a request at or below its label that would start the container "
"again is refused (409), and the control plane advances the fence and "
"retries. A running container clears the restore point too. A receipt "
"covers its group only while its fence is still current; receipts from "
"sandbox managers that predate restore carry none and never cover a group."
msgstr ""
"每张回执都写明了这次停止所结束的那次运行对应的启动栅栏（`start_seq`）。凡是可能启动容器的路径，比如一个轮次、一次工作区文件、终端、Git"
" 或环境请求、一次 Fork、一次快照采集或基线导入，都会先把栅栏往前推，再把推出来的值随请求本身一起发出去：写在请求体里，工作区请求则放在 `X"
"-Agent-Start-Seq` 请求头里。Sandbox Manager "
"只用这次运行真正接纳了的请求的栅栏给运行打标。运行停下以后，栅栏不高于这个标记、又要重新启动容器的请求会被拒绝（409），控制平面把栅栏再往前推一次后重试。运行中的容器同样会清掉恢复点。只有回执上的栅栏仍是当前值时，它才算覆盖了这个沙箱组；还不支持恢复的旧版"
" sandbox manager 给出的回执不带栅栏，永远不算覆盖任何沙箱组。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2147
msgid ""
"The policy omits the default and carries only an opt-out "
"(`checkpoints_enabled: false`), which is sent only to hosts that "
"advertise `sandbox-checkpoints-v1`. Older sandbox managers parse the "
"policy unchanged and keep archiving without checkpoints."
msgstr ""
"策略里不写默认值，只带一个关闭选项（`checkpoints_enabled: false`），并且只发给声明了 `sandbox-"
"checkpoints-v1` 的主机。旧版 sandbox manager 照原样解析策略，继续只做归档，不做检查点。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2151
msgid ""
"The archive holds the container's writable layer: workspace, native "
"session state, and anything installed outside `/workspace`. Credential "
"tmpfs mounts are not part of a commit. It also holds the Sandbox "
"Manager's own archive markers for the generation that stopped; a restored"
" container reads a marker from an earlier generation of its group as "
"absent and writes its own. Bucket lifecycle and retention rules apply to "
"the `v2/` prefix like the rest of the archives."
msgstr ""
"归档里是容器的可写层：工作区、原生会话状态，以及装在 `/workspace` 之外的所有东西。凭据所在的 tmpfs 挂载不会被 commit "
"进去。Sandbox Manager "
"自己为停止的那一代写下的归档标记也在里面；恢复出来的容器会把本组更早一代的标记当作不存在，再写上自己的。桶的生命周期和保留规则，对 `v2/` "
"前缀和其他归档一样适用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2158
msgid "Restoring a removed host's sandboxes"
msgstr "恢复被移除主机上的沙箱"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2160
msgid ""
"When a host leaves the pool, through **Remove** on the Servers page or "
"the autoscaler releasing its node, its credential is revoked in one "
"transaction that also looks at its stopped groups. A group becomes `cold`"
" when its latest checkpoint still covers it: the same container, "
"generation and start fence, every member's last settled turn recorded, "
"and a base image another host can pull by digest. Every other group stays"
" bound to the removed host, as before, and continues only if that host is"
" enrolled again; the admin sandbox page shows which is which. A "
"checkpoint carried by a heartbeat still in flight when the credential was"
" revoked is handed on by the reaper's next pass."
msgstr ""
"当一台主机离开资源池，不管是在 Servers 页面点了 "
"**Remove**，还是自动扩缩容释放了它的节点，它的凭据都会在一个事务里被吊销，这个事务同时会检查它上面已停止的沙箱组。如果一个沙箱组最新的检查点仍然覆盖着它，它就会变成"
" "
"`cold`。\"覆盖\"的意思是：容器、代次和启动栅栏都没变；每个成员最后一个已结束的轮次都有记录；并且有一个别的主机能按摘要拉取的基础镜像。其余的沙箱组和以前一样，仍然绑在被移除的主机上，只有那台主机重新注册后才能继续；管理后台的沙箱页面会标明哪些是哪种。吊销凭据时如果还有一次带检查点的心跳在路上，这个检查点会在"
" reaper 的下一轮交出去。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2170
msgid ""
"Nothing starts a group on a removed host, since that host never reports "
"the stop that would cover it again. A workspace request (Files, Terminal,"
" Git or an environment retry) answers `workspace_unavailable` (409), a "
"Fork is refused, and a publication's capture and base import wait until "
"the group has moved. A checkpoint still in flight therefore covers its "
"group when it lands, and a request or Fork that finds the group covered "
"hands it on at once: the request answers `workspace_restoring`."
msgstr ""
"已移除的主机上，不会再启动任何沙箱组，因为那台主机不会再上报能重新覆盖它的那次停止。工作区请求（Files、Terminal、Git "
"或环境重试）会返回 `workspace_unavailable`（409），Fork "
"会被拒绝，发布时的捕获和基础导入会一直等到这个组迁走为止。所以，还在路上的检查点一到，就会覆盖它的组；请求或 Fork "
"发现组已经被覆盖，会立刻把它交出去，这时请求返回 `workspace_restoring`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2178
msgid ""
"Two other paths turn covered stopped groups `cold` without revoking the "
"host: a provider that confirms the node terminated hands over all of "
"them, and a host [moving out before its lease ends](operations-compute.md"
"#moving-sandboxes-out-before-a-lease-ends) hands over each group as its "
"final checkpoint arrives. The host row, its credential and any deployment"
" drain fence are left to the removal flow."
msgstr ""
"还有两种情况，会把有检查点覆盖的已停止沙箱组变成 "
"`cold`，但不吊销主机：一是服务商确认节点已被回收，这时会把它们全部交出去；二是主机[在租期结束前迁出](operations-"
"compute.md#moving-sandboxes-out-before-a-lease-"
"ends)，这时每个沙箱组的最终检查点一到，就把它交出去。主机记录、它的凭据和任何部署排空栅栏，都留给移除流程去处理。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2184
msgid ""
"A `cold` group does not keep its old host from being forgotten, by "
"**Forget** or by permanently removing the server: it no longer needs that"
" machine. It keeps naming the host it last ran on until a claim moves it "
"to the claiming host. Every other undeleted group still blocks "
"forgetting."
msgstr ""
"`cold` 沙箱组不会妨碍它原来的主机被遗忘，不管是点 "
"**Forget**，还是永久移除服务器：它已经不需要那台机器了。在某次认领把它迁到认领它的主机之前，它记录的一直是它最后运行的那台主机。其他没删除的沙箱组仍然会挡住遗忘。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2189
msgid ""
"The next turn of any chat in a `cold` group is claimed by any host that "
"advertises `sandbox-restore-v1` with archives enabled, except the host "
"that still holds the group's container: container names carry no "
"generation, so that host, or one enrolled again under its name, would "
"collide with it. A failed restore leaves no container, so the host that "
"tried can try again. The claim rehomes the group to that host and "
"advances its generation (`restoring`), so anything the old host still "
"holds is fenced out. The new host's Sandbox Manager:"
msgstr ""
"`cold` 沙箱组里任何一个对话的下一轮，可以被任何一台声明了 `sandbox-"
"restore-v1`、并开启了归档的主机认领，只有仍然持有这个组容器的那台主机除外：容器名里不带代次，所以那台主机（或者以同样名字重新注册的主机）会和旧容器撞名。恢复失败不会留下容器，所以试过的那台主机可以再试。认领会把这个组搬到新主机名下，并推进它的代次（`restoring`），这样旧主机手里剩下的任何东西都会被隔离在外。新主机的"
" Sandbox Manager 会："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2198
msgid "pulls the group's base image by digest if it lacks it;"
msgstr "如果本机没有这个组的基础镜像，就按摘要拉取；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2199
msgid ""
"downloads the checkpoint version the receipt names and checks its size "
"and SHA-256;"
msgstr "下载回执里写明的那个检查点版本，检查大小和 SHA-256；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2201
msgid ""
"checks the archive: one image, every blob verified, every layer either "
"the base image's or carried in the archive, nothing else. It then "
"rewrites `index.json` and `manifest.json` itself, so loading can create "
"no name but the checkpoint's own;"
msgstr ""
"检查归档的内容：只能有一个镜像，每个 blob 都校验过，每一层要么是基础镜像里的，要么包含在归档里，此外不能有别的东西。然后自己重写 "
"`index.json` 和 `manifest.json`，保证加载时只会创建检查点自己的那个名字；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2205
msgid ""
"loads it, creates the container from it with the group's own limits and "
"network, labelled with the checkpoint id, and resumes each native session"
" as after any restart."
msgstr "加载镜像，用这个组自己的资源限制和网络，从它创建容器，打上检查点 ID 的标签，然后像任何一次重启之后那样，接上每个原生会话。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2209
msgid ""
"The download and the checked archive are unnamed files in "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR/checkpoint-spool`, and Docker reads the "
"archive on standard input, so a restore or snapshot load cut short by a "
"reboot, a forced stop or the OOM killer leaves nothing in that durable "
"directory. Sandbox Managers that predate this named them `restore-*`; any"
" such file is an interrupted restore's and can be deleted while no "
"restore is running."
msgstr ""
"下载下来的文件和校验过的归档，都是 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR/checkpoint-spool` "
"里没有名字的文件，Docker 从标准输入读取归档，所以恢复或快照加载因为重启、强制停止或 OOM killer "
"而中断时，不会在这个持久目录里留下任何东西。更早版本的 Sandbox Manager 会把这些文件命名为 "
"`restore-*`；这样的文件都是被中断的恢复留下的，只要当前没有恢复在跑，就可以删掉。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2217
msgid ""
"The loaded image, `freeinference-checkpoint/<sandbox hash>:<checkpoint "
"id>`, is that container's alone, and it goes with the container: when the"
" group is deleted or discarded, and when a later move back onto the same "
"host replaces the older container. A move back that restores the older "
"container's own checkpoint uses its image and loads nothing again. A "
"restore that fails before the group starts removes the container it "
"created, with any anonymous volume, and the image it loaded: any host may"
" claim the next try, so a retry on the same host downloads the checkpoint"
" again. A failure to remove the image is logged as "
"`sandbox_checkpoint_image_remove_failed` and one to remove the container "
"as `sandbox_create_cleanup_failed`; `docker image rm` and `docker rm "
"--volumes` clear what they leave."
msgstr ""
"加载的镜像 `freeinference-checkpoint/<sandbox hash>:<checkpoint id>` "
"只属于那个容器，并随容器一起删除：沙箱组被删除或丢弃时，以及之后迁回同一台主机、替换掉旧容器时。如果迁回时恢复的是旧容器自己的检查点，就直接用它的镜像，不会再加载一次。如果恢复在沙箱组启动之前就失败了，会删除它创建的容器（连同匿名卷）和它加载的镜像：下一次尝试可能由任何主机认领，所以即使在同一台主机上重试，也会重新下载检查点。删除镜像失败会记为"
" `sandbox_checkpoint_image_remove_failed`，删除容器失败会记为 "
"`sandbox_create_cleanup_failed`；留下的东西可以用 `docker image rm` 和 `docker rm "
"--volumes` 清掉。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2229
msgid ""
"A restore that fails before the turn is admitted returns the group to "
"`cold` and the turn to the queue without spending an attempt. The group "
"is not claimed again until 30 seconds after its first failure, 5 minutes "
"after its second and 30 minutes after its third, so the attempts outlast "
"a short registry or S3 outage; the fourth failed restore marks the group "
"lost and fails its queued turns: the chat whose turn ran it out at once, "
"and its Fork siblings' within one reaper pass. A claim that ends before "
"its host reserved the group never reached the checkpoint, however it "
"ends: handed back because the control plane could not mint the turn's "
"credentials or the host could not launch the turn, failed because the "
"hand-over refused the turn (its owner lost Agent access, or its model or "
"repository is no longer allowed) or the host could not start it, or "
"reaped because the host died right after claiming. It is not a failed "
"restore and starts no wait. The checkpoint is never changed. Workspace "
"requests to a `cold` or `restoring` group return `workspace_restoring` "
"(409) until a turn has restored it. Restore reads with the archive "
"credentials hosts already receive: `s3:GetObject` and `kms:Decrypt` on "
"the archive prefix."
msgstr ""
"如果恢复在轮次被准入之前就失败了，沙箱组会回到 `cold`，轮次回到队列，不消耗 attempt。第一次失败后 30 秒、第二次失败后 5 "
"分钟、第三次失败后 30 分钟之内，这个组都不会再被认领，这样几次尝试加起来，能撑过镜像仓库或 S3 "
"的短暂故障；第四次恢复失败时，这个组会被标记为丢失，排队中的轮次也随之失败：用完最后一次机会的那个对话立即失败，它的 Fork 兄弟对话在 "
"reaper "
"的一轮之内失败。如果一次认领在主机预留这个组之前就结束了，不管是怎么结束的，它都根本没碰到检查点：可能是控制平面签发不了这一轮的凭据，或者主机启动不了这一轮，于是交回；可能是交接时拒绝了这一轮（所有者失去了"
" Agent "
"权限，或者它的模型或仓库不再被允许），或者主机没能启动它，于是失败；也可能是主机认领后马上挂了，于是被回收。这些都不算恢复失败，也不会触发等待。检查点本身永远不会被改动。在某个轮次把它恢复好之前，对"
" `cold` 或 `restoring` 沙箱组的工作区请求都会返回 `workspace_restoring`（409）。恢复时读取 S3 "
"用的，是主机本来就会拿到的归档凭据：对归档前缀的 `s3:GetObject` 和 `kms:Decrypt`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2247
msgid ""
"A turn that was running when its host disappeared is not covered and "
"still ends as LOST. A group created from a locally built sandbox image "
"cannot move, because no other host can fetch that image; autoscaled hosts"
" should pull the published image with `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE_PULL=true` "
"(see `ENVIRONMENT.md`). A host that is enrolled again after its groups "
"moved cannot start or report them: their generation has moved on. Remove "
"those old containers with the admin **Discard** action."
msgstr ""
"主机消失时正在运行的那一轮不在覆盖范围内，仍然会以 LOST "
"结束。用本地构建的沙箱镜像创建的沙箱组没法迁移，因为别的主机拿不到那个镜像；自动扩缩容的主机应该用 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE_PULL=true` 拉取已发布的镜像（见 "
"`ENVIRONMENT.md`）。如果一台主机在它的沙箱组被迁走之后又重新注册了，它没法再启动或上报这些组，因为它们的代次已经往前走了。用管理后台的"
" **Discard** 操作，把那些旧容器删掉。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2255
msgid "Environment installation snapshots"
msgstr "环境安装快照"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2257
msgid ""
"A new task whose environment has an install script can start from a saved"
" installation instead of running the script again. A snapshot is a "
"container after the environment's installation, without the repository's "
"own files, stored like a checkpoint. Design: [install "
"snapshots](../agents/specs/2026-10-15-environment-install-snapshots-"
"design.zh-CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果新任务所用的环境带有安装脚本，可以直接从保存好的安装结果启动，不必再跑一遍脚本。快照就是环境安装完成后的容器，不含仓库自己的文件，和检查点一样存储。设计见[安装快照](../agents/specs/2026-10-15"
"-environment-install-snapshots-design.zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2262
msgid ""
"**On with checkpoints.** Snapshots need archives and checkpoints enabled "
"(**Save restorable checkpoints**). With either off, every task installs "
"in full, the environment list shows no snapshot state, and nothing is "
"queued."
msgstr ""
"**跟着检查点一起开启。** 快照要求归档和检查点（**Save restorable "
"checkpoints**）都已开启。任何一个关着，每个任务都会完整安装，环境列表上也不显示快照状态，什么都不会排队。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2265
msgid ""
"**Where.** `cloud-agent/sandbox/env/v1/<sha256(owner)>/<snapshot "
"id>.oci.tar`, under the prefix hosts already write, with the same size "
"limit, KMS and `If-None-Match` writes as checkpoints. A building host "
"keeps the committed image locally as `freeinference-environment/<owner "
"hash>:<snapshot id>`; any other host loads it on first use after the same"
" checks as a restore."
msgstr ""
"**存在哪里。** `cloud-agent/sandbox/env/v1/<sha256(owner)>/<snapshot "
"id>.oci.tar`，在主机本来就会写入的那个前缀下，和检查点一样受同样的大小上限、KMS 加密和 `If-None-Match` "
"写入约束。负责构建的主机会把 commit 后的镜像在本地保存为 `freeinference-environment/<owner "
"hash>:<snapshot id>`；别的主机第一次用到时，会经过和恢复时一样的检查再加载它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2270
msgid ""
"**Who builds.** Snapshots are built only by `prebuild` runs, in "
"disposable environment-run containers, never from a chat's workspace. The"
" control plane queues one when a new task had none, its lockfiles "
"changed, the owner asked, or an environment test passed. A test's own "
"container is never saved: its start and verify scripts ran with runtime "
"values, which the setup fingerprint does not cover. Prebuilds use "
"environment-run slots, are handed only to hosts that advertise "
"`environment-snapshot-v1`, and never count as the owner's one running "
"test. After a failed build, tasks queue no new one for that installation "
"for 6 hours; a passing test or an owner's rebuild still does. Deleting "
"snapshots cancels their pending prebuilds, and a receipt is accepted only"
" while its run's lease is live. A prebuild no host has started a day "
"after it was queued is given up on: maintenance fails its snapshot and "
"then its run, which no claim would take any more, so it neither waits for"
" good nor counts as queued work for the autoscaler."
msgstr ""
"**由谁构建。** 快照只由 `prebuild` "
"运行来构建，在用完即弃的环境运行容器里进行，绝不会从对话的工作区里取。控制平面会在这几种情况下排队一次构建：新任务没有可用的快照、锁文件变了、所有者主动要求，或者某次环境测试通过了。测试自己的容器永远不会被保存，因为它的"
" start 和 verify 脚本是带着运行时的变量值跑的，而这些值不在 setup 指纹的范围内。预构建占用的是环境运行的槽位，只交给声明了 "
"`environment-snapshot-v1` 的主机，并且永远不算作所有者那唯一一个正在运行的测试。一次构建失败后，6 "
"小时内任务不会再为这个安装排队新的构建；但测试通过或所有者手动重建，仍然会触发。删除快照会取消它们还在等待的预构建；只有在运行的租约仍然有效时，才会接受它的回执。如果一个预构建排队一天之后还没有任何主机开始跑，就放弃它：维护任务先让它的快照失败，再让它的运行失败（反正也不会再有认领接手），这样它既不会永远等下去，也不会被自动扩缩容当成排队中的工作。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2284
msgid ""
"**Who uses.** A claim names a snapshot only for a new group on a host "
"whose sandbox image is the snapshot's base image, and only when the "
"binding's setup fingerprint (an HMAC of the install script and setup-time"
" variables, keyed by `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`) matches. The "
"runner also compares the checkout's lockfiles (Git object ids). Any "
"mismatch or failure creates the group from the sandbox image and installs"
" in full; the turn never fails because of a snapshot. Without the "
"encryption key, bindings carry no fingerprint and nothing is snapshotted."
" The runner's report of what the new group did with its snapshot, which "
"keeps a used one alive, deletes one that failed its checks and queues the"
" builds above, is accepted only from the attempt holding the task's live "
"lease on a host still enrolled; any other worker token gets `409 "
"lease_lost` and changes nothing."
msgstr ""
"**谁会用到。** 只有在给一台主机上的新沙箱组做认领、这台主机的沙箱镜像正好是快照的基础镜像，并且绑定上的 setup 指纹一致时（指纹是以 "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` 为密钥，对安装脚本和 setup 阶段的变量算出的 "
"HMAC），认领才会指定一个快照。runner 还会比对仓库里锁文件的 Git 对象 "
"ID。只要有任何不一致或出错，就改为从沙箱镜像创建这个组，并完整安装；轮次永远不会因为快照而失败。没有那把加密密钥时，绑定上不带指纹，也就不会生成任何快照。runner"
" 会上报新沙箱组怎么处理了它的快照：用上的快照会因此保留，没通过检查的会被删掉，还会触发上面说的构建。这份上报只接受来自持有该任务有效租约的 "
"attempt，而且它所在的主机仍处于注册状态；其他 worker 令牌会得到 `409 lease_lost`，什么都不会改变。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2296
msgid ""
"**Retention.** The newest snapshot of an installation supersedes older "
"ones. Changing an installation — its install script, or a setup-time "
"variable or Secret, a global one included — supersedes the snapshots of "
"the earlier one, and a build that finishes after the change is superseded"
" on receipt; a snapshot built for a task's own install script is checked "
"against that script. Maintenance also compares each owner's ready "
"snapshots with their current configuration, 20 owners per 30-second pass,"
" so a snapshot that went stale without a publish to notice it (one "
"already stale before these checks, say) is superseded too. Superseded "
"snapshots are no longer handed out and are deleted after 24 hours. A "
"snapshot is not handed out after 25 days, and is deleted after 7 days "
"unused, when its environment is archived or deleted by the owner, and "
"beyond 20 GiB of ready snapshots per owner (least recently used first)."
msgstr ""
"**保留多久。** 同一个安装，最新的快照会取代旧的快照。改动一个安装，比如改了安装脚本，或者改了某个 setup 阶段的变量或 "
"Secret（包括全局的），会让之前那个安装的快照全部作废；如果某次构建在改动之后才完成，它的回执一到就会被作废；为任务自己的安装脚本构建的快照，会对照那个脚本检查。维护任务还会把每个所有者就绪的快照和当前的配置做对比，每"
" 30 秒一轮、每轮 20 "
"个所有者，所以没有经过发布、因而没被发现已经过时的快照（比如在这些检查上线之前就已经过时的），也会被取代。被取代的快照不再分发，24 "
"小时后删除。快照满 25 天后不再分发；满足以下任一条件时会被删除：连续 7 天没人用；所属环境被所有者归档或删除；某个所有者就绪的快照总量超过 "
"20 GiB（从最久没用的开始删）。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2309
msgid ""
"**Deletion.** Hosts poll `/v1/agent/worker/environment-"
"snapshots/deletions` every 10 minutes and delete the object versions it "
"names, least recently tried first, so objects the bucket refuses to "
"delete never hold back the rest. Each host also lists its own "
"`freeinference-environment/*` images, asks `/v1/agent/worker/environment-"
"snapshots/retired` which belong to retired snapshots, and drops those. "
"Deleting objects needs `s3:DeleteObject` and `s3:DeleteObjectVersion` on "
"`cloud-agent/sandbox/env/*`, which nothing else requires. Without them "
"the delete is logged as `environment_snapshot_delete_failed` and retried;"
" add a bucket lifecycle rule on the `cloud-agent/sandbox/env/` prefix "
"that expires current versions 30 days after creation and noncurrent "
"versions after 1 day as the backstop, which is later than the 25-day "
"limit on use."
msgstr ""
"**怎么删除。** 主机每 10 分钟轮询一次 `/v1/agent/worker/environment-"
"snapshots/deletions`，删除它列出的对象版本，最久没尝试过的优先，这样桶拒绝删除的对象，永远不会拖住其他对象。每台主机还会列出自己本地的"
" `freeinference-environment/*` 镜像，问一下 `/v1/agent/worker/environment-"
"snapshots/retired` 哪些属于已作废的快照，然后删掉它们。删除对象需要对 `cloud-agent/sandbox/env/*` "
"有 `s3:DeleteObject` 和 `s3:DeleteObjectVersion` "
"权限，其他功能都用不到这两项。没有这些权限时，删除会记为 `environment_snapshot_delete_failed` "
"并重试；作为兜底，请在 `cloud-agent/sandbox/env/` 前缀上加一条桶生命周期规则：当前版本在创建 30 "
"天后过期，非当前版本 1 天后过期。30 天比 25 天的使用期限更晚。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2320
msgid ""
"**Preparation records.** Installation writes a root-only marker, "
"`/var/lib/freeinference-broker/environment-setup-v1.json`, into the "
"container. A container this host has no record of (created from a "
"snapshot, or restored from a checkpoint) counts its installation as done "
"when the marker's fingerprint matches, so a restore no longer reruns the "
"install script. A snapshot's container then runs the environment's "
"optional update script."
msgstr ""
"**安装记录。** 安装时会往容器里写一个只有 root 能访问的标记文件 `/var/lib/freeinference-broker"
"/environment-"
"setup-v1.json`。对于本机没有记录的容器（从快照创建的，或者从检查点恢复的），只要标记里的指纹对得上，就认为安装已经完成，所以恢复时不会再重跑安装脚本。从快照创建的容器，接下来会运行这个环境可选的更新脚本。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2326
msgid ""
"**Team environments.** A team environment's snapshot serves every active "
"member, whoever's task or test queued it, and every member's use keeps it"
" alive. It counts toward the 20 GiB of the member who queued it. Only the"
" team's owner and admins can delete or rebuild it. Their change to its "
"install script or install-time values retires every member's snapshot of "
"it; a member's own global variables never do, since a team environment "
"installs without them."
msgstr ""
"**团队环境。** "
"一个团队环境的快照，供每一位活跃成员使用，不管当初是谁的任务或测试排队构建了它；任何成员用到它，都会让它继续保留。它的大小计入当初排队构建它的那位成员的"
" 20 "
"GiB。只有团队的所有者和管理员能删除或重建它。他们改了安装脚本或安装阶段的值，就会让所有成员手里这个环境的快照全部作废；成员自己的全局变量则不会，因为团队环境安装时根本不用它们。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2334
msgid "Launch failures and queue order"
msgstr "启动失败与队列顺序"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2336
msgid ""
"If a turn process cannot start or exits before taking delivery, the host "
"returns it through `POST /v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/release`. That "
"spends no attempt and avoids waiting for an unowned lease. Release is "
"refused once the CLI has admitted the turn: replay could execute the "
"prompt twice. Lease expiry then follows the retained-session rules and "
"can end the conversation. Consecutive launch failures pause claims, "
"trigger backoff, and are reported in the heartbeat so the Servers page "
"can explain unused capacity."
msgstr ""
"如果一个轮次的进程启动不了，或者在接手之前就退出了，主机会通过 `POST "
"/v1/agent/worker/jobs/<job>/release` 把它退回。这样不消耗 "
"attempt，也不用干等一个没人持有的租约过期。一旦 CLI "
"已经接下了这个轮次，就不能再退回了，因为重放可能会把同一条提示词执行两次。这之后如果租约过期，就按保留会话的规则处理，可能会让对话结束。连续启动失败时，主机会暂停认领、逐步拉长重试间隔，并在心跳里上报，这样"
" Servers 页面就能解释为什么有容量没用上。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2344
msgid ""
"Run one runner container per host. `AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` provides the "
"initial limit until an administrator overrides it; the deployment no "
"longer reads a replica count. Scaling the service would enroll the same "
"host twice. Deployment checks start a turn process with empty stdin and "
"require preflight followed by a clean refusal to run, exercising launch "
"before any prompt is admitted."
msgstr ""
"每台主机只跑一个 runner 容器。在管理员另行设置之前，`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` "
"提供初始的并发上限；部署已经不再读取副本数。把这个服务扩成多个副本，会让同一台主机注册两次。部署检查会用空的 stdin "
"启动一个轮次进程，要求它先完成预检，再干脆地拒绝运行，这样在任何提示词被接下之前，就把启动这条路实际走了一遍。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2350
msgid ""
"Queue order is global FIFO. Per-user fairness and concurrency quotas "
"remain deferred, so a batch from one user can occupy every slot."
msgstr "队列顺序是全局的先进先出。按用户的公平调度和并发配额目前还没做，所以一个用户的一批任务，可能占满所有槽位。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2353
msgid "One sandbox-group inactivity clock (and separate safety watchdogs)"
msgstr "沙箱组唯一的空闲计时（以及几个独立的安全看门狗）"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2355
msgid ""
"`AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S` defaults to **1800 seconds (30 minutes)** and"
" is the group's sole inactivity timeout. After the latest activity across"
" every member has durably settled and no member or sandbox manager "
"operation is active, the Shared Session Supervisor stops the container "
"and removes its bridge. It never issues `docker rm`. A later acquire "
"reinstalls host rules, recreates the bridge, and starts and inspects the "
"same labelled container. Supervisor shutdown leaves chat containers "
"untouched."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S` 默认 **1800 秒（30 "
"分钟）**，是沙箱组唯一的空闲超时。当所有成员最近的活动都已持久地结束，并且没有任何成员或 sandbox manager "
"的操作还在进行时，Shared Session Supervisor 会停掉容器，并删除它的网桥。它绝不会执行 `docker "
"rm`。之后再次获取时，会重新安装主机防火墙规则、重建网桥，然后启动并检查同一个带标签的容器。supervisor 自己关闭时，不会去动对话容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2363
msgid ""
"At sandbox manager startup, reconciliation stops running orphans before "
"readmission. It never adopts resident processes on the strength of an "
"unproven in-memory lease or infers an active turn from an empty lease "
"table. Docker observations travel in the enrolled heartbeat. A group the "
"host listing cannot reconcile, because its container was lost or "
"relabelled or another call changed it while its archive marker was read, "
"is logged as `shared_sandbox_reconcile_group_failed` and reported as it "
"stands; it never costs the host's other groups their observations. The "
"control plane checks the durable attempt fence and idle deadline before "
"returning a generation-scoped stop command; the next heartbeat records "
"Docker's STOPPED state."
msgstr ""
"sandbox manager "
"启动时，调和会先停掉正在运行的孤儿容器，再重新开放准入。它绝不会只凭内存里一个没法证明的租约，就接管常驻进程，也不会因为租约表是空的，就断定有一个活跃的轮次。Docker"
" "
"的观察结果通过已注册的心跳上报。如果列出主机上的沙箱时，某个沙箱组没法调和，比如它的容器丢了、标签被改了，或者在读取它的归档标记时有别的调用改动了它，就会记一条"
" "
"`shared_sandbox_reconcile_group_failed`，并按它当前的样子上报；这绝不会连累主机上其他沙箱组的观察结果。控制平面在下发一个针对特定代次的停止命令之前，会先检查持久化的"
" attempt 栅栏和空闲截止时间；下一次心跳会记下 Docker 报告的 STOPPED 状态。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2374
msgid ""
"For a proven activation, the heartbeat also reports active turn, "
"terminal, file, or Git operations and the remaining host-monotonic idle "
"delay. A terminal close carries its last activity time: manual close "
"counts as fresh activity; reaping an already-idle PTY continues the "
"original group window without adding a second timeout. A reconstructed "
"generation-zero RUNNING container with no active attempt or deadline "
"receives one fresh 30-minute recovery window. The database accepts it "
"only once, preventing later heartbeats from extending it or stopping an "
"active turn."
msgstr ""
"对于一次已证实的激活，心跳还会上报正在进行的轮次、终端、文件或 Git "
"操作，以及按主机单调时钟算出的剩余空闲时间。关闭终端时，会带上它最后一次活动的时间：手动关闭算作一次新的活动；回收一个本来就已经空闲的 "
"PTY，则沿用原来的组计时窗口，不会再加一段超时。如果重建出一个代次为零、处于 RUNNING、却没有活跃 attempt "
"也没有截止时间的容器，会给它一个新的 30 分钟恢复窗口。数据库只接受这一次，防止之后的心跳不断延长它，或者停掉一个正在进行的轮次。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2383
msgid "Lost attempt leases"
msgstr "attempt 租约丢失"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2385
msgid ""
"Before a prompt reaches Agent CLI stdin, the worker persists its `job_id`"
" as the sandbox's admission receipt. If that retained activation's "
"attempt lease expires, the system stops it, marks the context LOST, and "
"fails the job; it does not automatically retry even when the crash may "
"have happened just before stdin. Any later messages already waiting "
"behind that turn are failed in the same database transaction, and a new "
"follow-up receives `sandbox_context_lost` instead of becoming a "
"permanently unclaimable queued job. That conservative choice prevents "
"duplicate prompt/tool execution."
msgstr ""
"在提示词送进 Agent CLI 的 stdin 之前，worker 会先把它的 `job_id` 持久化，作为沙箱的准入回执。如果这次保留激活的"
" attempt 租约过期了，系统会停掉它，把上下文标为 LOST，并让任务失败；即使崩溃可能恰好发生在写入 stdin "
"之前，也不会自动重试。已经排在这一轮后面等待的消息，会在同一个数据库事务里一起失败；之后再发的后续消息会收到 "
"`sandbox_context_lost`，而不是变成一个永远没人能认领的排队任务。这个保守的做法，是为了防止提示词或工具被重复执行。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2394
msgid ""
"On the host, the reaper's close of that member's residency also ends the "
"activation that ran on it, as an abandon would, so a Fork sibling's group"
" can still go idle and its publication snapshot is not refused as an "
"active mutation. A turn that was running when the runner died was already"
" aborted when the runner's turn stream to the sandbox manager closed. A "
"runner that hung instead still holds that stream: the close interrupts "
"its turn, and the activation ends once the stream has closed the turn. A "
"stream its runner no longer reads may never get that far, so the sandbox "
"manager's sweep closes a turn still open 60 seconds after the loss. The "
"reaper waits for the host's sandbox manager at most 5 seconds per member "
"for its close of a residency, the members one pass reaps side by side, "
"and revokes each member's grant either way: the host's next heartbeat is "
"told the generation is lost and closes the process itself, so a host that"
" no longer answers, usually the reason the lease expired, does not hold "
"up the pass for every other host."
msgstr ""
"在主机上，reaper 关闭这个成员的 residency 时，也会结束在上面运行的那次激活，效果和放弃一样，所以 Fork "
"兄弟对话的沙箱组仍然可以进入空闲，它的发布快照也不会因为有活跃的修改而被拒绝。runner 挂掉时正在跑的轮次，在 runner 到 "
"sandbox manager 的轮次流关闭时就已经中止了。如果 runner "
"是卡住了而不是挂了，它仍然占着那条流：关闭会打断它的轮次，等流把这一轮关掉，激活才结束。runner 已经不再读取的流可能永远走不到这一步，所以 "
"sandbox manager 的巡检会在丢失 60 秒后，关掉仍然开着的轮次。reaper 关闭 residency 时，每个成员最多等主机的 "
"sandbox manager 5 "
"秒，同一轮回收的成员并行处理；无论结果如何，都会吊销每个成员的授权：主机的下一次心跳会被告知这一代已经丢失，由它自己关掉进程。这样，一台不再响应的主机（这通常正是租约过期的原因）就不会拖住这一轮里其他所有主机的处理。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2409
msgid "Safety watchdogs"
msgstr "安全看门狗"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2411
msgid ""
"These guards serve separate purposes; they do not create extra idle "
"states or deactivate a healthy group:"
msgstr "下面这些保护各有各的用途；它们不会制造额外的空闲状态，也不会停掉一个正常的沙箱组："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2414
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S` defaults to 3600 seconds. It is a hard watchdog for one"
" hung agent turn. A turn that reaches it is cancelled/fenced; it is never"
" interpreted as an ordinary settled-idle transition;"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S` 默认 3600 秒。它是针对单个卡死的 agent "
"轮次的硬性看门狗。到达这个时限的轮次会被取消并隔离；绝不会被当成一次普通的\"已结束、转为空闲\"；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2417
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TERMINAL_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS` (30 minutes) closes a stale PTY whose "
"client and process have stopped producing activity. For retained chats "
"the effective PTY idle limit is the earlier of this guard and the chat "
"clock; releasing it preserves the last activity timestamp and adds no "
"second wait;"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_TERMINAL_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS`（30 分钟）会关掉一个客户端和进程都已经没有动静的过时 "
"PTY。对于保留对话，PTY 实际的空闲上限，取这项保护和对话计时里先到期的那个；释放时会保留最后一次活动的时间，不会再多等一轮；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2421
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TERMINAL_HARD_TTL_SECONDS` (8 hours) bounds one PTY even if it "
"stays noisy forever. It is a resource/security guard, not sandbox "
"deactivation;"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_TERMINAL_HARD_TTL_SECONDS`（8 小时）限制单个 PTY "
"的最长寿命，哪怕它一直有输出也一样。它是资源和安全上的保护，不是让沙箱停用；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2423
msgid ""
"`AGENT_RESIDENCY_TTL_S` defaults to 1800 seconds and fences each member's"
" live-process ownership plus renewable inference grant. Losing that lease"
" demotes/restarts the member, and ends with LOST context an unfinished "
"activation that had taken on its process, once any turn it was running "
"has closed; it does not itself stop a healthy chat group or create "
"another inactivity clock;"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_RESIDENCY_TTL_S` 默认 1800 "
"秒，给每个成员对常驻进程的归属，以及可续期的推理授权加上栅栏。这个租约丢了，成员会被降级或重启；已经接手这个进程、但还没结束的激活，会在它正在跑的轮次关闭之后，以"
" LOST 上下文结束。它本身不会停掉一个正常的对话沙箱组，也不会构成另一套空闲计时；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2429
msgid ""
"no TTL removes chat data. A retained sandbox is removed only by an "
"administrator's deletion or once its owner permanently deletes every chat"
" using it (see [sandbox inventory](#sandbox-inventory-resource-usage-and-"
"controls)); operators monitor Docker storage separately."
msgstr ""
"没有任何 TTL 会删除对话数据。保留沙箱只会在两种情况下被删除：管理员手动删除；或者所有者永久删除了用到它的所有对话（见[沙箱清单"
"](#sandbox-inventory-resource-usage-and-controls)）。Docker "
"存储的用量，需要运维人员另外监控。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2434
msgid ""
"A bounded workspace command's timeout or output overflow kills its own "
"verified process group and preserves the sandbox's other resident "
"sessions and terminals. Host output readers use fixed-size chunks, byte-"
"bounded diagnostic tails, and bounded queues; oversized native CLI "
"records stop the affected member. Resource checkpoints continue to reach "
"the control plane while CLI output is silent. See [Host execution limits"
"](host-execution-limits.md) for the limits and boundaries."
msgstr ""
"有时间和输出上限的工作区命令，如果超时或输出超限，只会杀掉它自己那个经过核实的进程组，沙箱里其他的常驻会话和终端都不受影响。主机读取输出时，使用固定大小的块、按字节限制的诊断日志尾部，以及有上限的队列；原生"
" CLI 的单条记录过大时，会停掉对应的成员。即使 CLI 一直没有输出，资源检查点也会照常送到控制平面。具体的限制和边界，见[主机执行限制"
"](host-execution-limits.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2441
msgid "Resume, Fork, and publication"
msgstr "Resume、Fork 与发布"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2443
msgid ""
"There is no retained/shared feature flag or runtime allowlist switch. "
"Claude Code, Codex, Pi, OpenCode, and Kilo are claimable only after exact"
" image/runtime/helper attestation. Compatible follow-ups send only the "
"new prompt to the same resident process; recovery resumes the pinned "
"native session in a replacement process. Fork from any successfully "
"settled native turn with a persisted native ordinal, matching image pin, "
"and capable owner host is immediate inside the same container/workspace. "
"The UI offers it only on the final assistant/tool boundary of that turn. "
"Edit & rewind resolves the nearest earlier such boundary for the selected"
" user prompt and puts the replacement text in the child composer without "
"sending it. The frontend treats `NEW`, `LIVE`, `RESTORED`, and `LOST` as "
"context truth; hot/warm/cold/replay remains diagnostic telemetry and "
"never chooses another executor. Current retained runners never emit "
"`replay`; the API accepts it only so an attempt admitted by the previous "
"generation can finish during a parallel rollout, and historical rows "
"remain readable in the UI."
msgstr ""
"没有 retained/shared 的功能开关，也没有运行时白名单的开关。Claude Code、Codex、Pi、OpenCode 和 "
"Kilo，都要通过镜像、运行时和辅助程序的确切证明之后，才能被认领。兼容的后续消息，只会把新的提示词发给同一个常驻进程；恢复时，则在一个新进程里接上固定版本的原生会话。只要某个原生轮次已经成功结束、有持久化的原生序号、镜像的固定版本一致，并且所属主机支持，从它发起"
" Fork 就会在同一个容器和工作区里立即完成。界面只在这一轮最后一个 assistant 或工具边界上提供 Fork。Edit & rewind"
" 会为所选的用户提示词，找到它之前最近的那个这样的边界，并把替换后的文字放进子对话的输入框里，但不会发送。前端把 "
"`NEW`、`LIVE`、`RESTORED` 和 `LOST` 当作上下文的真实状态；hot/warm/cold/replay "
"只是诊断用的遥测，永远不会决定换用另一个执行器。当前的保留 runner 绝不会产生 `replay`；API "
"之所以还接受它，只是为了让上一代版本已经接下的 attempt，在两边并行上线期间能够完成；历史记录在界面上仍然可以查看。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2459
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A settled turn publishes nothing. The platform publishes a workspace only"
" when its owner asks (`POST /v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/publish`, the "
"conversation's Create PR / Update PR button): the request advances the "
"group's epoch and opens a snapshot holding every turn settled since the "
"last one, and capture, the secret scan, the push, the draft PR and the "
"base import follow as before. A request while a turn runs in the "
"workspace is refused (`turn_running`); one while a publication is on its "
"way returns that publication. Until the owner asks, a settled workspace "
"holds nothing back: it stops when idle and its chat can be deleted. Its "
"unpublished turns live in the retained sandbox, and in its checkpoint "
"once it stops cleanly. See the [design](../agents/specs/2026-10-15"
"-manual-publication-design.zh-CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"一个轮次结束时，什么都不会发布。只有所有者主动要求时（`POST "
"/v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/publish`，也就是对话里的 Create PR / Update PR "
"按钮），平台才会发布工作区：这个请求会推进沙箱组的 epoch，并打开一个快照，包含上一次发布以来结束的所有轮次；之后的捕获、secret "
"扫描、推送、草稿 PR 和 base "
"导入，都和以前一样。工作区里还有轮次在跑时发起请求，会被拒绝（`turn_running`）；如果已经有一次发布在进行，就直接返回那一次发布。在所有者要求之前，一个已结束的工作区不会卡住任何东西：空闲时它会停掉，它的对话也可以删除。还没发布的轮次留在保留沙箱里；沙箱正常停止后，也会保存在它的检查点里。见[设计](../agents/specs/2026-10-15"
"-manual-publication-design.zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2471
msgid ""
"After a publication request, the snapshot and draft-PR fields change "
"asynchronously. The detail view and recent-task list poll only while that"
" publication state is pending/capturing/captured/publishing, and stop at "
"published/failed; other terminal jobs do not acquire a background polling"
" loop."
msgstr ""
"发出发布请求之后，快照和草稿 PR 相关的字段会异步更新。详情页和最近任务列表只在发布状态为 "
"pending/capturing/captured/publishing 时轮询，到 published/failed "
"就停止；其他已经结束的任务，不会因此在后台一直轮询。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2477
msgid ""
"A snapshot whose patch the publisher refuses, whose capture the host "
"refuses, or whose five publication retries run out stays `failed` with "
"its reason, and its group is marked `dirty`. It is not retried. The "
"owner's next request opens the group's next snapshot, which supersedes "
"it: every snapshot is the whole diff from the last published commit, so "
"it carries the failed changes too, and is refused in turn if it still "
"holds what was refused. Snapshots still publish in epoch order; only a "
"failed one stops holding the later ones back. If the failed attempt had "
"already pushed its commit to the `agent/<thread>` branch (the draft-PR "
"step failed after the push, or the push landed after it timed out), that "
"commit is the group's own: the publisher records it as the snapshot's "
"`pushed_commit_sha` before pushing it, and does not push a commit it "
"could not record. The later snapshot builds on it: the branch fast-"
"forwards to the later snapshot's tree and the draft PR is opened then. "
"Any other commit on the branch is still refused as a moved branch until "
"that branch is deleted; the platform never force-pushes. A GitHub rate "
"limit, answered with a 403 or a 429, is retried after the wait GitHub "
"names (`Retry-After`, or the reset time of an exhausted limit), up to an "
"hour, and so is a published base's import whose credential hit one. A "
"draft-PR refusal that names only its head branch (`head invalid`), which "
"GitHub can answer until it has seen the branch just pushed, is retried "
"within the same five-attempt budget; an invalid base branch is refused "
"for good."
msgstr ""
"如果快照的补丁被发布器拒绝、捕获被主机拒绝，或者五次发布重试都用完了，它会停在 `failed` 并记下原因，它的沙箱组被标为 "
"`dirty`。它不会再被重试。所有者下一次发起请求时，会打开这个组的下一个快照，取代失败的那个：每个快照都是相对上一次已发布 commit "
"的完整 diff，所以失败的那些改动也包含在内；如果它还带着之前被拒的内容，也会同样被拒。快照仍然按 epoch "
"顺序发布；只是失败的快照不会再挡住后面的快照。如果失败的那次已经把 commit 推到了 `agent/<thread>` 分支上（推送成功后草稿"
" PR 那步失败了，或者推送超时后才实际落地），这个 commit 就算是这个组自己的：发布器在推送之前，会把它记为快照的 "
"`pushed_commit_sha`，记不下来的 commit 一律不推。后面的快照会接着它往下做：分支快进到后一个快照的树，那时再开草稿 "
"PR。分支上如果有别的 commit，仍会被当作\"分支被人动过\"而拒绝，直到那个分支被删掉；平台从不 force-push。GitHub 以 "
"403 或 429 返回的速率限制，会按 GitHub 给出的等待时间（`Retry-"
"After`，或者额度耗尽时的重置时间）重试，最多等一小时；已发布 base 的导入如果因为凭据撞上速率限制，也一样处理。如果草稿 PR "
"被拒的原因只是 head 分支（`head invalid`），这是 GitHub "
"还没看到刚推上去的分支时可能给出的回答，会在同样五次尝试的额度内重试；base 分支无效则直接永久拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2499
msgid ""
"The base import adds a published commit's objects to the workspace and "
"writes no ref, HEAD or index, so Git's own housekeeping prunes them once "
"their pack is old enough (two weeks for a default `git gc`). A capture "
"that then finds the published base missing is not failed: the sandbox "
"manager refuses it with a 409 of its own, the group returns to "
"`importing` for the same published base, the publisher fetches that "
"commit from GitHub again and imports it, and the capture runs once the "
"import completes. That bundle is cut from the commit the workspace "
"started from, which its own history keeps, because Git prunes the "
"published commits together. A missing base that no snapshot published has"
" nothing to fetch, and its capture fails as before. A publication waiting"
" on a base import that keeps failing (GitHub no longer serves the commit,"
" access was withdrawn, or the workspace cannot take the bundle) fails "
"after an hour and leaves its group `dirty`; the owner's next request "
"captures, and imports, again."
msgstr ""
"base 导入会把一个已发布 commit 的对象加进工作区，但不写任何 ref、HEAD 或 index，所以等这些 pack "
"足够旧之后（默认的 `git gc` 是两周），Git 自己的清理会把它们删掉。之后某次捕获如果发现已发布的 base "
"不见了，并不会失败：sandbox manager 会用自己的 409 拒绝，沙箱组针对同一个已发布 base 回到 "
"`importing`，发布器再从 GitHub 把那个 commit 拉一遍并导入，导入完成后再做捕获。这个 bundle "
"是从工作区最初起步的那个 commit 切出来的，因为工作区自己的历史里一直保留着它，而 Git 会把已发布的那些 commit "
"一起清掉。如果缺的那个 base 从来没有被任何快照发布过，就无处可拉，它的捕获会像以前一样失败。如果一次发布一直在等一个反复失败的 base "
"导入（GitHub 不再提供那个 commit、访问权限被收回，或者工作区收不下这个 bundle），一小时后会失败，沙箱组保持 "
"`dirty`；所有者下一次发起请求时，会重新捕获、重新导入。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2514
msgid ""
"An import completes only for the generation and container it was sent to."
" If the group's host is removed and another host restores the group while"
" an import is still out, the old host's late answer changes nothing, and "
"the import is sent again to the restored container."
msgstr "导入只对它发往的那一代和那个容器生效。如果导入还没完成，这个组的主机就被移除了，另一台主机又恢复了这个组，那么旧主机迟到的答复不会改变任何东西，导入会重新发给恢复后的容器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2519
msgid ""
"Admission checks free space only through the [storage reserve](#how-full-"
"is-the-sandbox-storage); disk-pressure alerting and a non-mutating pre-"
"prompt context fingerprint remain deferred. Local functional checks do "
"not establish production Kata, live-provider, or operational acceptance."
msgstr ""
"准入时只通过[存储预留](#how-full-is-the-sandbox-"
"storage)检查剩余空间；磁盘紧张告警，以及一个不修改状态的、提示词发出前的上下文指纹，都还没做。本地的功能检查，不能证明生产环境的 "
"Kata、真实服务商或运维层面的验收都没问题。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2525
msgid "Rolling deployment order"
msgstr "滚动部署顺序"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2527
msgid ""
"Downstream deployment automation coordinates the host and control-plane "
"scripts. This repository publishes neutral artifacts; it does not contain"
" a named environment's deployment Actions jobs. The two deployment tracks"
" can run in parallel under the exact-SHA readiness fence described here. "
"See [the release contract](../../deploy/release/README.md) for artifact "
"deployments."
msgstr ""
"主机脚本和控制平面脚本，由下游的部署自动化来协调。本仓库发布的是不绑定任何部署的产物，不包含任何具体环境的部署 Actions "
"任务。在这里说的按确切 SHA "
"的就绪栅栏之下，两条部署线可以同时进行。产物部署见[发布契约](../../deploy/release/README.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2533
msgid "Host and control-plane readiness"
msgstr "主机和控制平面何时就绪"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2535
msgid ""
"The host prepares the replacement sandbox/runner artifacts and proves "
"Kata before invalidating its ready marker. It resolves the old runner's "
"exact Compose container IDs, then asks Docker Engine for an unbounded "
"graceful stop. The runner stops claiming and waits for every admitted "
"turn. Graceful shutdown does not signal its turn children: each child "
"finishes its one turn and exits naturally, including a child whose "
"acceptance handover is still uncertain. The sandbox manager and tunnels "
"remain available until those turns settle. Only then does activation "
"replace the sandbox manager and runner. After the isolation, tunnel, "
"runtime and retained Docker-root checks pass, it records `.deployed-sha` "
"and only then publishes an exact `shared-sandbox-deployment:<sha>` "
"capability. In parallel, the control-plane deployment prepares its "
"artifacts and runs migrations. Before `compose up` can replace a running "
"API, the deployment waits for a heartbeat newer than the start of its "
"readiness check and reverse-probes every sandbox manager eligible for "
"new-chat placement. The claim route enforces that same exact deployment "
"capability. A pending runner registers and heartbeats its base protocol "
"so the host checks can inspect them, but does not poll; this also "
"prevents the previous API from assigning work before it knows the new "
"claim field. A runner with a pending/failed marker therefore cannot take "
"work even during a cold-start API bootstrap. When placement has moved "
"between hosts, the check also probes every online host that still owns a "
"retained group; changing the pin must not make old chats disappear from "
"rollout safety. `SHARED_READY_TIMEOUT` controls that wait and defaults to"
" 900 seconds."
msgstr ""
"主机会先准备好替换用的沙箱和 runner 产物，证明 Kata 可用，然后才让自己的就绪标记失效。它找出旧 runner 确切的 Compose"
" 容器 ID，然后请 Docker Engine 做一次不限时的优雅停止。runner "
"停止认领，等所有已接下的轮次跑完。优雅关闭不会给轮次子进程发信号：每个子进程都会跑完自己那一轮后自然退出，交接是否被接受还不确定的子进程也一样。在这些轮次结束之前，sandbox"
" manager 和隧道都保持可用。只有到这时，激活才会替换 sandbox manager 和 runner。隔离、隧道、运行时和保留 "
"Docker 目录的检查都通过后，它写入 `.deployed-sha`，然后才发布确切的 `shared-sandbox-"
"deployment:<sha>` 能力。与此同时，控制平面那边准备好产物，执行迁移。在 `compose up` 替换正在运行的 API "
"之前，部署会等一次比就绪检查开始时间更新的心跳，并对每个可以放置新对话的 sandbox manager "
"做反向探测。认领接口要求的也是同样确切的部署能力。处于待定状态的 runner "
"会注册，并以基础协议发送心跳，好让主机检查能看到它们，但它不会去轮询任务；这也防止了旧 API "
"在还不认识新认领字段时就分配工作。所以，标记为待定或失败的 runner，即使在 API "
"冷启动的初始化阶段，也拿不到任何工作。如果放置固定在主机之间换过，检查还会探测每一台仍然持有保留沙箱组的在线主机；改了放置固定，不能让旧对话从上线安全检查里消失。`SHARED_READY_TIMEOUT`"
" 控制这次等待，默认 900 秒。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2558
msgid ""
"A Host of a compute allocation the control plane manages, not just "
"observes, is not waited for. Only the new control plane rolls it forward "
"(see [Compute resources](operations-compute.md)), so requiring the target"
" first would time out every rollout while such a Host is online. The "
"check treats it like a retained owner instead: if it owns a retained "
"group it must send a fresh compatible heartbeat and answer its sandbox "
"manager. The claim route still keeps it from starting new chats until it "
"reports the target commit. A pin to a managed Host therefore needs the "
"deployment's draining host to prove the target."
msgstr ""
"由控制平面托管（而不只是观察）的计算资源分配里的 Host，部署时不会等它。因为只有新版控制平面起来之后，才会把它升级上去（见[计算资源"
"](operations-compute.md)）；如果要求它先达到目标版本，只要有这样的 Host "
"在线，每次上线都会超时。所以检查会把它当作保留沙箱组的持有者来对待：如果它持有保留的沙箱组，就必须发来一次新鲜、兼容的心跳，并让 sandbox "
"manager 能正常响应。在它报告目标 commit 之前，认领接口仍然不让它开始新的对话。因此，如果把放置固定到一台托管的 Host "
"上，就需要由部署中被排空的那台主机来证明目标版本。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2567
msgid ""
"The deploy user writes `.shared-live-ready` in the deployment checkout, "
"separate from the container-owned enrollment directory. Runners mount "
"only that file read-only at `/run/cloud-agent/shared-live-ready`. The "
"host script preserves its inode when changing `pending:<sha>` to `<sha>`,"
" so existing file mounts see the transition; an empty or partial write "
"cannot advertise an exact target SHA. No credential ownership or "
"permission changes are needed for a rollout."
msgstr ""
"部署用户在部署目录里写入 `.shared-live-ready`，它和容器所属的注册目录是分开的。runner 只把这一个文件以只读方式挂载到 "
"`/run/cloud-agent/shared-live-ready`。主机脚本把内容从 `pending:<sha>` 改成 `<sha>` "
"时，会保留文件的 inode，所以已有的文件挂载能看到这次变化；写入为空或写了一半，都无法声明一个确切的目标 "
"SHA。一次上线不需要改动任何凭据的属主或权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2574
msgid "Rollback compatibility"
msgstr "回滚的兼容性"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2576
msgid ""
"The deployment orchestrator runs separately from the target checkout. In "
"a GitHub Actions deployment, it comes from the workflow commit. An online"
" rollback cannot execute a pre-fence target's old scripts; commits "
"without the current `deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL`, or with an incompatible "
"protocol value, are refused before changing Docker state. The current "
"protocol, `shared-live-exact-sha-v4`, marks the one sandbox network: a v3"
" deployer cannot install it, and no deployment rolls back across it (a "
"host that ran the previous network needs the [one-time cleanup](#one-"
"time-cleanup-when-upgrading-to-the-one-network)). It also excludes "
"ancestors that predate the rewritten schema baseline "
"(`0001_schema_baseline`, 2026-09-10): their Alembic chain is one the "
"database no longer records, so they are not schema-compatible rollback "
"targets. Database changes are expand-first. Never downgrade columns "
"underneath a still-running new API; roll code back to a schema-compatible"
" commit first and treat any later contract migration as a separate "
"reviewed operation."
msgstr ""
"部署编排器和目标代码是分开运行的。在 GitHub Actions 部署里，编排器来自工作流所在的那个 "
"commit。在线回滚没法执行栅栏机制出现之前那些旧版本的脚本；没有当前 `deploy/DEPLOY_PROTOCOL` 的 "
"commit，或者协议值不兼容的 commit，会在改动 Docker 状态之前就被拒绝。当前协议 `shared-live-exact-"
"sha-v4` 对应的是单一沙箱网络：v3 的部署脚本装不了它，任何部署也不会跨过它回滚（跑过旧网络的主机，需要做一次[一次性清理](#one-"
"time-cleanup-when-upgrading-to-the-one-network)）。它同样排除了早于重写后 schema "
"baseline（`0001_schema_baseline`，2026-09-10）的那些 commit：它们的 Alembic "
"迁移链已经不是数据库里记录的那一条了，所以不是 schema 兼容的回滚目标。数据库改动一律先扩展。绝不要在一个还在运行的新 API "
"底下把列降级回去；先把代码回滚到一个 schema 兼容的 commit，之后任何收缩性的迁移，都作为一次单独评审的操作来做。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2592
msgid ""
"For downstream Actions triggered by `workflow_run`, the workflow "
"definition comes from that repository's default branch. Synchronize "
"orchestrator changes there before relying on a new rollback fence, and do"
" not dispatch an older default-branch workflow against an environment "
"during that rollout window."
msgstr ""
"如果下游的 Actions 是由 `workflow_run` "
"触发的，工作流的定义来自那个仓库的默认分支。要依赖新的回滚栅栏，先把编排器的改动同步到默认分支；在这次上线期间，不要对某个环境触发一个更旧的默认分支工作流。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2597
msgid ""
"Migration `0049_host_drain_fence` introduced durable drain ownership and "
"its V1 recipe marker. Additive migration `0051_host_drain_fence_epoch` "
"establishes the current permanent compatibility floor. Before activating "
"the V2 control plane, the deployment orchestrator must reject every "
"candidate whose control-plane recipe lacks `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2`;"
" after activation, do not downgrade the application or schema below that "
"release. The recipe retains `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V1` only so an "
"older orchestrator can perform the bridge upgrade. V1 alone is not a "
"valid rollback target once V2 has run."
msgstr ""
"迁移 `0049_host_drain_fence` 引入了持久化的排空归属，以及它的 V1 recipe 标记。增量迁移 "
"`0051_host_drain_fence_epoch` 确立了当前永久的兼容底线。激活 V2 控制平面之前，部署编排器必须拒绝每一个控制平面 "
"recipe 里没有 `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` 的候选版本；激活之后，应用和 schema "
"都不要再降到那个版本以下。recipe 里保留 "
"`AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V1`，只是为了让旧版编排器能完成过渡升级。一旦 V2 跑过，只支持 V1 "
"的版本就不再是有效的回滚目标。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2606
msgid ""
"Every host now has a non-null `drain_fence_epoch`. The API returns its "
"canonical UUID spelling and requires the same value, together with the "
"expected owner token, when acquiring or transferring a fence. A "
"successful state change rotates the epoch. An exact requested-token retry"
" is checked first, so a lost success response remains idempotent even "
"though that success changed the epoch; a different token carrying the old"
" epoch is stale."
msgstr ""
"现在每台主机都有一个非空的 `drain_fence_epoch`。API 返回它规范的 UUID "
"写法；获取或转移栅栏时，要求带上同样的值，以及预期的所有者令牌。状态改动成功时会轮换 "
"epoch。完全相同的请求令牌重试会先被检查，所以即使那次成功已经改了 epoch，成功响应丢失后的重试仍然是幂等的；而一个不同的令牌带着旧的 "
"epoch，就算过时。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2613
msgid ""
"The database enforces the generation outside the API as well. Its `BEFORE"
" UPDATE` trigger rotates the epoch when `status`, `credential_hash`, "
"`drain_fence_token`, `drain_fence_status_before`, `drain_fence_active`, "
"or `compute_node_id` changes, and ignores an attempt to assign the epoch "
"directly. Its `BEFORE DELETE` guard rejects deletion while a drain fence "
"is active. This means an operator, reaper, old writer, or placement "
"change invalidates every previous snapshot rather than recreating a "
"token-only ABA state. An older V1 control plane does not compare the "
"epoch and is therefore not operationally compatible, even though its "
"writes still cause rotation."
msgstr ""
"在 API 之外，数据库自己也会强制执行代次。它的 `BEFORE UPDATE` 触发器在 "
"`status`、`credential_hash`、`drain_fence_token`、`drain_fence_status_before`、`drain_fence_active`"
" 或 `compute_node_id` 变化时轮换 epoch，并且忽略任何直接给 epoch 赋值的尝试。它的 `BEFORE DELETE`"
" "
"检查会在排空栅栏生效期间拒绝删除。这样，无论是运维人员、reaper、旧版写入方，还是放置的变化，都会让之前所有的快照失效，而不会重新造出一个只看令牌的"
" ABA 状态。旧版 V1 控制平面不比较 epoch，所以在运维上并不兼容，尽管它的写入照样会触发轮换。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2623
msgid "Inspect fence state before rollback or recovery:"
msgstr "回滚或恢复之前，先检查栅栏的状态："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2632
msgid ""
"The compatibility floor remains even when this query is empty: the "
"current control plane may create a receipt on its next automated "
"deployment. If an active fence is abandoned, redeploy the V2 fence-"
"capable release and use its token-conditional release (or the audited "
"force override). If that is impossible, stop the control plane and every "
"deployment workflow, begin a transaction, lock exactly one host row, and "
"verify the expected token, epoch, and `slots_used = 0`. Only then may an "
"operator clear that one active fence:"
msgstr ""
"即使这个查询结果为空，兼容底线依然存在：当前的控制平面可能在下一次自动部署时创建回执。如果某个生效中的栅栏没人管了，就重新部署支持 V2 "
"栅栏的版本，用它按令牌条件执行的释放（或者经过审计的强制覆盖）。如果做不到，就停掉控制平面和每一个部署工作流，开一个事务，锁定恰好一行主机记录，核实预期的令牌、epoch"
" 和 `slots_used = 0`。只有这样，运维人员才能清除这一个生效中的栅栏："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2663
msgid ""
"Require exactly one returned row. The returned epoch is the newly rotated"
" value; do not try to assign it yourself. To clear only an inactive "
"receipt, use the same exact host, token, and epoch predicates with `NOT "
"drain_fence_active`; change status only when the separately verified "
"recovery requires it. Never bulk-clear fence fields. If the owner, token,"
" or epoch is uncertain, leave the host draining and restore the V2 fence-"
"capable control plane."
msgstr ""
"要求恰好返回一行。返回的 epoch 是新轮换出来的值，不要自己去给它赋值。如果只想清掉一张未生效的回执，就用同样精确匹配主机、令牌和 epoch"
" 的条件，再加上 `NOT "
"drain_fence_active`；只有在单独核实过的恢复确实需要时，才改状态。绝不要批量清除栅栏字段。如果所有者、令牌或 epoch "
"有任何不确定，就让主机保持排空，并恢复支持 V2 栅栏的控制平面。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2670
msgid "Cold starts and failed deployments"
msgstr "冷启动与部署失败"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2672
msgid ""
"This fence is unconditional because retained/shared-live is the only "
"executor. It cannot enable a legacy path and it cannot be bypassed by "
"stale `AGENT_RESTARTABLE_*` or `AGENT_SHARED_LIVE_*` values. On failure, "
"the existing control plane remains running and the deploy stops for "
"operator repair. If either the API or MCP relay is missing, the host "
"cannot complete all readiness probes (a true cold start has neither). "
"After migration, the control script independently bootstraps only the "
"missing service or services. A failed gate stops only those started by "
"that invocation, leaving a pre-existing peer running for diagnosis. Web "
"does not start until the same exact-SHA fence succeeds. Once it does, the"
" bootstrap peers belong to the desired target stack: a later final "
"API/web probe failure leaves that stack running for diagnosis but does "
"not write `.deployed-sha`."
msgstr ""
"这个栅栏是无条件启用的，因为 retained/shared-live 是唯一的执行器。它没法打开任何旧路径，过时的 "
"`AGENT_RESTARTABLE_*` 或 `AGENT_SHARED_LIVE_*` "
"值也绕不过它。失败时，现有的控制平面继续运行，部署停下来等运维人员修复。只要 API 和 MCP "
"中继缺了任何一个，主机就没法完成全部就绪探测（真正的冷启动两个都没有）。迁移之后，控制脚本只会单独启动缺失的那个或那几个服务。检查没通过时，只会停掉这次调用自己启动的服务，原本就在的对端会继续运行，方便诊断。在同一道按确切"
" SHA 的栅栏通过之前，Web 不会启动。一旦通过，这些初始化时启动的服务就归入期望的目标版本：之后如果最终的 API 或 Web "
"探测失败，这套服务会继续运行以便诊断，但不会写入 `.deployed-sha`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2685
msgid "Preserving an old-chain database"
msgstr "保留旧迁移链的数据库"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2687
msgid ""
"An old Alembic revision cannot be upgraded by the rewritten graph. If the"
" history must survive, use `scripts/convert_legacy_database_copy.py` on a"
" **separately restored copy**, not the selected-state rebuild below. The "
"converter currently supports exactly `0025_retained_followup_gate`; other"
" old revisions need their own audited conversion. It keeps all original "
"rows and columns in `legacy_archive`, creates the real baseline with "
"constraints enabled, copies the supported live state, and applies the "
"repository's additive migrations in one transaction. It refuses active "
"jobs, other clients and an already-converted copy."
msgstr ""
"旧的 Alembic 修订，没法用重写后的迁移图升级。如果必须保留历史，就在一个**单独恢复出来的副本**上运行 "
"`scripts/convert_legacy_database_copy.py`，而不是用下面那种只保留部分状态的重建。转换脚本目前只支持 "
"`0025_retained_followup_gate` 这一个版本；其他旧修订需要各自经过审计的转换。它会把所有原始的行和列保留在 "
"`legacy_archive` 里，在约束开启的情况下建好真正的 "
"baseline，复制受支持的在线状态，并在一个事务里执行仓库里的增量迁移。如果有活跃的任务、有其他客户端连着，或者副本已经转换过，它都会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2696
msgid ""
"Drain before the final snapshot and stop all Agent database writers. Keep"
" a full custom-format PostgreSQL dump, its checksum, the current "
"code/images and Agent configuration. Rehearse restoring the dump in an "
"isolated PostgreSQL instance with no applications attached; do not use "
"the live database as the conversion destination."
msgstr ""
"在拍最终快照之前先排空，并停掉所有写 Agent 数据库的进程。保留一份完整的、自定义格式的 PostgreSQL "
"转储、它的校验和、当前的代码和镜像，以及 Agent 的配置。在一个没有连接任何应用的隔离 PostgreSQL "
"实例上，演练一遍恢复这份转储；不要把线上数据库当作转换的目标。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2701
msgid ""
"Name the restored database `agent_legacy_copy_<unique_name>`. Set "
"`LEGACY_COPY_DATABASE_URL` privately to that copy; the tool deliberately "
"never falls back to `AGENT_DATABASE_URL`. Use the intended target release"
" checkout and its Python dependencies. Audit first, then convert, using "
"new report paths:"
msgstr ""
"把恢复出来的数据库命名为 `agent_legacy_copy_<unique_name>`。私下把 "
"`LEGACY_COPY_DATABASE_URL` 指向这个副本；脚本有意绝不会退而使用 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`。使用目标版本的代码目录和它的 Python 依赖。先审计，再转换，并使用新的报告路径："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2713
msgid ""
"Reports contain counts/hashes, not user rows or credentials. Retain them "
"privately with the backup. A failed transaction leaves the original "
"schema intact. A report I/O error requires inspecting the copy before "
"retrying."
msgstr ""
"报告里只有计数和哈希，没有用户数据，也没有凭据。把它们和备份一起私密保存。事务失败时，原来的 schema 保持不动。如果写报告时出了 I/O "
"错误，要先检查副本再重试。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2716
msgid ""
"Verify all archived rows, retained public data and sequence high-water "
"marks. Exercise the target version's storage queries and a fresh write on"
" the copy. Retired `replay` telemetry survives in the archive; its public"
" continuity field becomes NULL, since it is not a native resume mode. "
"Retired artifact tables remain available for operator recovery in the "
"archive, not in the current API."
msgstr ""
"核对所有归档的行、保留下来的公开数据，以及序列的高水位。在副本上跑一遍目标版本的存储查询，再做一次全新的写入。已退役的 `replay` "
"遥测会保留在归档里；它在公开数据中的连续性字段会变成 NULL，因为它不是一种原生恢复模式。已退役的产物表留在归档里，供运维人员恢复用，当前的 "
"API 里不再提供。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2721
msgid ""
"Establish the original Gateway issuer independently, then explicitly "
"adopt that issuer on the converted copy using the procedure in [minimal-"
"identity.md](minimal-identity.md). Conversion does not bind a namespace "
"or make the copy ready for traffic. Preserve the existing host "
"credential, owner identities and retained filesystem paths."
msgstr ""
"先独立确认原网关的签发方，然后按 [minimal-identity.md](minimal-identity.md) "
"里的流程，在转换后的副本上明确认定这个签发方。转换本身不会绑定命名空间，也不会让副本就能承接流量。现有的主机凭据、所有者身份，以及保留文件系统的路径，都要保留。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2726
msgid ""
"For cutover, repeat the proven procedure from a fresh, quiescent "
"snapshot. Point only Agent at the converted database after verification. "
"Keep ingress closed while validating both roles. Before new writes, "
"recovery can restore the preserved source configuration/database. After "
"new writes, do not point old code at the new schema or discard the new "
"database: recovery must retain and reconcile the new data. Prefer a "
"tested compatible artifact recovery."
msgstr ""
"正式切换时，从一份全新的、静止状态下的快照，把验证过的流程再做一遍。核实无误后，只让 Agent "
"指向转换后的数据库。在两个角色都验证完之前，入口保持关闭。在有新数据写入之前，恢复时可以还原保留下来的源配置和数据库。一旦有了新的写入，就不要再让旧代码指向新的"
" schema，也不要丢掉新数据库：恢复时必须保留并调和这些新数据。优先采用测试过的、兼容的产物恢复。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2733
msgid ""
"The complete conversion contract is [the legacy database copy "
"plan](../agents/specs/2026-09-18-legacy-database-copy.md)."
msgstr "完整的转换约定，见[旧数据库副本计划](../agents/specs/2026-09-18-legacy-database-copy.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2736
msgid "Rebuilding the agent database"
msgstr "重建 Agent 数据库"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2738
msgid ""
"This procedure preserves selected state from a deployment using the "
"**retired Alembic chain** and intentionally discards task history. It was"
" rehearsed on 2026-09-10. Use [copy conversion](#preserving-an-old-chain-"
"database) when history must survive. This table selection predates later "
"credential and configuration additions; do not use it as a generic reset "
"procedure for a current database."
msgstr ""
"这个流程从使用**已退役 Alembic 迁移链**的部署里，保留选定的状态，并有意丢弃任务历史。它在 2026-09-10 "
"演练过。如果必须保留历史，请用[副本转换](#preserving-an-old-chain-"
"database)。这里选择保留哪些表，是在后来新增凭据和配置之前定的；不要把它当作针对当前数据库的通用重置流程。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2744
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The schema baseline was rewritten on 2026-09-10 (`0001_schema_baseline`),"
" and a database stamped with any revision of the old chain fails `alembic"
" upgrade head` with \"can't locate revision\". Such a database is "
"converted on a copy as above, or rebuilt only when discarding task "
"history is intentional. The selected-state rebuild below is **not** "
"\"drop the database and deploy\": the runner keeps its host credential in"
" a file and never re-enrols while that file exists, so an empty "
"`agent_runner_hosts` turns every heartbeat into a 401, the runner logs "
"`agent_host_credential_rejected` and stops claiming, and the control-"
"plane deploy waits for a fresh heartbeat that never comes. The compose-"
"effective location is `${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT:-/var/lib/hybridinference"
"/agent-host}/credential` (set in `deploy/host/docker-"
"compose.sandbox.yml`); the code default "
"`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE=/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-host-"
"credential` (`enrollment.py`) applies only to a runner started outside "
"that compose file, and `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` becomes mandatory once "
"`SIBLING_COMPOSE_PROJECTS` is set. The host's registration must survive "
"the rebuild. So must the users' source control and MCP connections, which"
" are credentials nobody can re-mint from the database side, and the "
"identity-namespace binding, which says which Gateway minted the "
"`user_id`s those rows are keyed by: `deploy.sh` runs `python -m "
"cloud_agent.identity_namespace --check` before either listener starts, "
"and that check refuses to start an API over owner data with no issuer to "
"attribute it to."
msgstr ""
"schema baseline 在 2026-09-10 "
"重写过（`0001_schema_baseline`）。凡是标记着旧迁移链里任何一个修订的数据库，执行 `alembic upgrade "
"head` 都会报 \"can't locate revision\" "
"失败。这样的数据库，要么像上面那样在副本上转换，要么只在有意丢弃任务历史时才重建。下面这种只保留部分状态的重建，**并不是**\"删库再部署\"那么简单：runner"
" 把主机凭据存在一个文件里，只要这个文件还在，就绝不会重新注册；所以 `agent_runner_hosts` 一旦清空，每次心跳都会变成 "
"401，runner 记一条 `agent_host_credential_rejected` "
"并停止认领，而控制平面的部署会一直等一次永远不会来的新心跳。在 compose 里实际生效的位置是 "
"`${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT:-/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-"
"host}/credential`（在 `deploy/host/docker-compose.sandbox.yml` 里设置）；代码默认的 "
"`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE=/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-host-"
"credential`（`enrollment.py`）只适用于在那个 compose 文件之外启动的 runner；并且一旦设了 "
"`SIBLING_COMPOSE_PROJECTS`，`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` "
"就变成必填。主机的注册信息必须在重建后保留下来。同样必须保留的，还有用户的代码托管连接和 MCP "
"连接，因为这些凭据在数据库这边没人能重新签发；以及身份命名空间的绑定，它说明了这些记录用的 `user_id` "
"是哪个网关签发的：`deploy.sh` 会在两个监听器启动之前运行 `python -m "
"cloud_agent.identity_namespace --check`，如果所有者数据找不到可以归属的签发方，这项检查就会拒绝启动 "
"API。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2768
msgid ""
"Rehearsed on a copy of the old schema (2026-09-10), including the ways "
"the naive version fails: a positional insert lands values in the wrong "
"columns because the rewritten baseline orders some differently, a host "
"row restored with its old `slots_used` never claims again because the "
"attempts that held those slots are gone, a restore that leaves the "
"identity binding behind stops the API at startup, and a restored "
"`draining` host never claims again because nothing undoes the drain. "
"Every `docker compose` below is the invocation `deploy/control-"
"plane/deploy.sh` makes — project, env file, compose file — and it runs in"
" the deploy root with the target commit checked out. The examples use the"
" control-plane deploy script's default project, `cloudagent`; substitute "
"your own."
msgstr ""
"这个流程已经在旧 schema 的副本上演练过（2026-09-10），也包括想当然的做法会怎么失败：按位置插入，会把值插进错误的列，因为重写后的"
" baseline 里有些列的顺序变了；主机记录如果带着旧的 `slots_used` 恢复，就再也不会认领，因为占着这些槽位的 attempt "
"已经不存在了；恢复时如果漏了身份绑定，API 在启动时就会停下；恢复后处于 `draining` "
"的主机再也不会认领，因为没有任何东西会撤销这次排空。下面每一条 `docker compose` 命令，都和 `deploy/control-"
"plane/deploy.sh` 的调用方式一样（项目名、环境文件、compose 文件），并在已经检出目标 commit "
"的部署根目录里运行。示例使用控制平面部署脚本的默认项目名 `cloudagent`，请换成你自己的。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2780
msgid ""
"Record which hosts are taking work, then let them finish. The drain below"
" is this rebuild's own and has to be undone in step 5, but only for the "
"hosts it is applied to: a host that was already `draining`, `offline` or "
"`disabled` before the rebuild must stay that way, and the heartbeat will "
"not put one back online. So write the undo before making the change, then"
" drain from the admin page (or `POST /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts/<host>/drain`), wait until the host holds no running attempts, and "
"only then stop the services that hold database connections, leaving "
"Postgres up:"
msgstr ""
"记下哪些主机正在接任务，然后让它们把手上的跑完。下面的排空是这次重建自己加的，必须在第 5 步撤销，但只针对被它排空的那些主机：重建之前就已经是 "
"`draining`、`offline` 或 `disabled` "
"的主机，必须保持原样，而心跳也不会把它们重新设为在线。所以先把撤销语句写好，再做改动；然后从管理页面（或者 `POST /admin/agent"
"/runner-hosts/<host>/drain`）排空，等主机上没有正在运行的 "
"attempt，再停掉所有持有数据库连接的服务，Postgres 保持运行："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2801
msgid ""
"Take the forensic dump of everything, then the data-only dump of the "
"state that survives — the host registrations, the three user connection "
"tables, and the identity-namespace binding those `user_id`s belong to — "
"then the placement policy as one statement. `--column-inserts` is load-"
"bearing (see above), and `format('%L')` is what keeps an unpinned "
"`active_host` a SQL `NULL` rather than an empty string the new foreign "
"key would refuse:"
msgstr ""
"先把所有东西做一份取证用的转储，再把需要保留的状态做一份只含数据的转储，包括：主机注册信息、三张用户连接表，以及这些 `user_id` "
"所属的身份命名空间绑定；然后把放置策略导出成一条语句。`--column-inserts` 至关重要（原因见上文）；`format('%L')` "
"则能让没有固定的 `active_host` 保持为 SQL 的 `NULL`，而不是变成一个会被新外键拒绝的空字符串："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2820
msgid ""
"Build the target's `migrate` image **before** touching the database. The "
"migrations are copied into the image at build time, not mounted from the "
"checkout, so a stale image would rebuild the old chain into the empty "
"database:"
msgstr ""
"动数据库**之前**，先构建目标版本的 `migrate` "
"镜像。迁移文件是在构建时复制进镜像的，而不是从代码目录挂载进去，所以如果用的是过时的镜像，就会在空数据库里重建出旧的迁移链："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2831
msgid ""
"Recreate the database, apply the baseline, and check what it is stamped "
"with:"
msgstr "重建数据库，执行 baseline，然后检查它被标记成了哪个版本："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2843
msgid ""
"The version must be the head of the rewritten chain "
"(`0001_schema_baseline` or a later revision on it); an `00xx_…` from the "
"old chain means step 3 ran the wrong image."
msgstr ""
"版本必须是重写后迁移链的 head（`0001_schema_baseline` 或者它之后的某个修订）；如果显示的是旧迁移链里的某个 "
"`00xx_…`，说明第 3 步用错了镜像。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2847
msgid ""
"Restore the surviving state, reset the counter that described attempts "
"that no longer exist, undo this rebuild's drain, restore the policy, and "
"read back the identity binding:"
msgstr "恢复要保留的状态，把那个描述着已经不存在的 attempt 的计数器清零，撤销这次重建加的排空，恢复放置策略，并读回身份绑定确认："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2860
msgid ""
"`slots_used` counts running attempts on the host, and the rebuild kept "
"none; a restored non-zero value would park every new task at \"queued\" "
"once it reached `slots_total`, with a runner that authenticates and "
"heartbeats normally."
msgstr ""
"`slots_used` 统计的是主机上正在运行的 attempt，而这次重建一个都没保留；如果恢复成一个非零值，新任务一到 "
"`slots_total` 就会全部停在 \"queued\"，而 runner 的认证和心跳看起来却一切正常。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2865
msgid ""
"The drain needs the same treatment for the same reason. `draining` is "
"written to the row and the heartbeat deliberately never clears it, so the"
" restored host authenticates, heartbeats, and still claims nothing; step "
"6 then fails readiness with `pinned host ... is not shared-live ready: "
"... status is draining`. Replaying step 1's generated statements puts "
"back exactly the hosts that were online, and leaves a host that was "
"already drained or disabled alone."
msgstr ""
"排空也要做同样的处理，原因一样。`draining` "
"是写在记录上的，而心跳有意从不清除它，所以恢复后的主机能认证、能发心跳，却仍然什么都不认领；接着第 6 步的就绪检查会报 `pinned host"
" ... is not shared-live ready: ... status is draining` 失败。重放第 1 "
"步生成的那些语句，能准确地恢复原本在线的主机，原本就已排空或禁用的主机则保持不动。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2873
msgid ""
"The last statement must print the issuer the old database was bound to. "
"If it prints nothing, the old database had no binding: verify the "
"original Gateway issuer before the rebuild, then adopt it with `python -m"
" cloud_agent.identity_namespace --adopt-existing --issuer <original-"
"issuer>`. Do not adopt the currently configured issuer without that "
"check, and do not drop the check — it is what stops the rebuild from "
"silently handing one Gateway's `user_id`s to another."
msgstr ""
"最后一条语句必须打印出旧数据库绑定的签发方。如果什么都没打印，说明旧数据库没有绑定：先在重建前核实原网关的签发方，然后用 `python -m "
"cloud_agent.identity_namespace --adopt-existing --issuer <original-"
"issuer>` 认定它。没做这项核实，就不要认定当前配置的签发方；也不要去掉这项检查，正是它防止重建悄悄地把一个网关的 `user_id` "
"交给另一个网关。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2881
msgid ""
"Deploy the target commit as usual. `migrate` finds the database at head, "
"the control plane starts, and the runner's next heartbeat authenticates "
"against the restored `credential_hash`; readiness then sees a fresh "
"heartbeat and the deploy completes. If the host stack was restarted "
"meanwhile and died on `agent_host_credential_rejected`, restart it after "
"step 5 — the credential it holds is valid again."
msgstr ""
"像平常一样部署目标 commit。`migrate` 发现数据库已经在 head，控制平面启动，runner 的下一次心跳会用恢复回来的 "
"`credential_hash` 通过认证；接着就绪检查看到一次新鲜的心跳，部署完成。如果主机服务在此期间重启过，并因 "
"`agent_host_credential_rejected` 退出了，就在第 5 步之后重启它，它手里的凭据又有效了。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2888
msgid ""
"Prove it end to end before calling it done: create a task and confirm it "
"is claimed (`SELECT state FROM agent_jobs` reaches `running`), then a "
"follow-up, a cancel, a fork, a publish, and a restart of the host stack "
"with a follow-up into the retained chat afterwards."
msgstr ""
"宣布完成之前，端到端地验证一遍：创建一个任务，确认它被认领（`SELECT state FROM agent_jobs` 变成 "
"`running`），然后依次做一次后续消息、一次取消、一次 fork、一次发布，再重启一次主机服务，之后往保留对话里再发一条后续消息。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2893
msgid ""
"If the host registration cannot be restored, the fallback is a controlled"
" re-enrolment: remove the credential file on the host (the path named "
"above), mint an enrolment token from the admin surface, set "
"`AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` for one start, and confirm the first heartbeat "
"before enabling retained chats."
msgstr ""
"如果主机注册信息恢复不了，退一步的办法是做一次受控的重新注册：删掉主机上的凭据文件（就是上面说的那个路径），从管理界面签发一个注册令牌，在一次启动时设置"
" `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN`，在启用保留对话之前，先确认第一次心跳已经到达。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2899
msgid ""
"Conversation history is not carried over by design; the forensic dump is "
"read with a throwaway `postgres:16-alpine` when needed and never imported"
" back."
msgstr "对话历史是有意不带过去的；需要时，用一个临时的 `postgres:16-alpine` 读取取证转储，绝不把它导回去。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2902
msgid "Applying migrations that are not backwards-compatible"
msgstr "执行不向后兼容的迁移"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2904
msgid ""
"`deploy.sh` migrates before replacing the API. Each migration must "
"therefore remain compatible with the running version until replacement. "
"The transitions listed below require a maintenance window when upgrading "
"from their older API versions. This list describes those schema "
"transitions; it does not mean every later additive migration requires "
"downtime. Review compatibility against the actual source and target "
"versions before choosing a rolling deploy."
msgstr ""
"`deploy.sh` 会先执行迁移，再替换 API。所以在替换完成之前，每个迁移都必须和正在运行的版本兼容。下面列出的这些转换，从较旧的 API"
" 版本升级时，需要一个停机维护窗口。这份列表说的只是这几个 schema "
"转换，并不意味着之后每个增量迁移都要停机。选择滚动部署之前，请针对实际的源版本和目标版本核对兼容性。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2911
msgid ""
"`0002_request_keys_and_actors` drops the default on "
"`agent_admin_audit_log.actor_id`. The API that predates it inserts audit "
"rows without the column, and `log_admin_action` swallows the failure by "
"design, so the window would silently lose administrator audit rows rather"
" than fail."
msgstr ""
"`0002_request_keys_and_actors` 去掉了 `agent_admin_audit_log.actor_id` "
"的默认值。在它之前的 API 插入审计记录时不带这一列，而 `log_admin_action` "
"按设计会吞掉这种失败，所以在这个窗口里，管理员的审计记录会悄悄丢失，而不是报错。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2915
msgid ""
"`0003_thread_level_config` drops `agent_jobs.repo`, `setup_script`, "
"`execution_profile` and `mcp_servers`, which the older API selects on "
"every job read."
msgstr ""
"`0003_thread_level_config` 删掉了 "
"`agent_jobs.repo`、`setup_script`、`execution_profile` 和 `mcp_servers`，而旧 "
"API 每次读取任务都会查这几列。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2918
msgid ""
"`0004_residency_on_membership` drops `agent_thread_residencies`, which "
"the older API writes on every residency heartbeat."
msgstr ""
"`0004_residency_on_membership` 删掉了 `agent_thread_residencies`，而旧 API 每次 "
"residency 心跳都会写它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2920
msgid ""
"`0005_queued_follow_ups` converts `waiting` jobs to `queued` and removes "
"`waiting` from the job-state constraint. The new scheduler leaves queued "
"turns unclaimed until all earlier turns in the same chat are terminal. An"
" older API can still insert `waiting` and claim queued turns without "
"checking their predecessors, so it must be stopped before this migration."
" Downgrades also require stopped writers; the downgrade restores "
"dependent queued turns to `waiting`. If a terminal intermediate turn "
"hides an unfinished ancestor, it refuses the downgrade until those queued"
" follow-ups are drained or cancelled because the older scheduler cannot "
"preserve their execution order."
msgstr ""
"`0005_queued_follow_ups` 把 `waiting` 状态的任务改成 `queued`，并从任务状态的约束里去掉了 "
"`waiting`。新的调度器会让排队的轮次一直不被认领，直到同一个对话里所有更早的轮次都进入终态。旧 API 仍可能插入 "
"`waiting`，并且不检查前面的轮次就认领排队的轮次，所以执行这次迁移之前必须先停掉它。降级同样需要停掉所有写入方；降级会把有依赖关系的排队轮次恢复成"
" "
"`waiting`。如果某个已经进入终态的中间轮次，挡住了一个还没完成的更早轮次，降级会被拒绝，直到这些排队的后续消息被跑完或取消，因为旧的调度器保证不了它们的执行顺序。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2930
msgid ""
"`0008_generic_mcp_connections` empties and write-constrains the legacy "
"`agent_threads.mcp_servers` column and turns `agent_mcp_connections` into"
" a self-describing connection: transport, execution location, endpoint or"
" launch spec and auth profile, with the provider name kept as an optional"
" `template`. The legacy name list is mapped onto "
"`agent_mcp_thread_bindings` where the owner has exactly one connection "
"for that provider, and recorded in `agent_mcp_legacy_bindings` where they"
" do not — an ambiguous mapping would let a connection created later "
"inherit a session authorized against a different one. It follows "
"`0007_attempt_turn_resources`, so the chain stays linear; "
"`0009_mcp_refresh_lease` follows it with the lease that fences a "
"credential refresh between workers. `0010_mcp_policy_revisions` adds the "
"permission revision allocator, so saving or reattaching a connection "
"cannot reuse an old approval's policy version. `0011_mcp_rolling_compat` "
"restores inert compatibility columns on databases upgraded by the "
"original `0008`, which dropped/renamed them. Apply through head before "
"starting the updated control plane and MCP relay."
msgstr ""
"`0008_generic_mcp_connections` 清空旧的 `agent_threads.mcp_servers` "
"列并限制写入，同时把 `agent_mcp_connections` "
"改造成一种自描述的连接：传输方式、执行位置、端点或启动参数，以及认证配置，服务商名字则作为可选的 `template` "
"保留。旧的名字列表，在所有者对这个服务商恰好只有一个连接时，映射到 `agent_mcp_thread_bindings`；否则记到 "
"`agent_mcp_legacy_bindings` 里，因为有歧义的映射，可能让之后新建的连接继承一个原本针对另一个连接授权的会话。它排在 "
"`0007_attempt_turn_resources` 之后，保持迁移链是一条直线；紧跟着的 `0009_mcp_refresh_lease`"
" 加了一个租约，防止多个 worker 同时刷新同一个凭据。`0010_mcp_policy_revisions` "
"加了权限修订号的分配器，这样保存或重新挂接一个连接时，就不会复用某次旧批准的策略版本。`0011_mcp_rolling_compat` "
"会在经过最初那个 `0008`（它删除或改名了这些列）升级的数据库上，把那几个不起作用的兼容列补回来。启动新版控制平面和 MCP "
"中继之前，先把迁移执行到 head。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2946
msgid ""
"`0058_mcp_connector_invariant` repairs the singular connector route for "
"MCP connections and adds a unique constraint on each connection's "
"authorization mapping. Treat this revision as a stopped-writer boundary. "
"Older binaries can recreate a missing mapping, leave a stale mapping "
"after disconnect, or retain connector authority after changing a "
"connection away from `user-connector`. Do not use a mixed-version rolling"
" deploy for this revision. Instead:"
msgstr ""
"`0058_mcp_connector_invariant` 修复了 MCP 连接的 connector "
"路由必须唯一这一点，并给每个连接的授权映射加了唯一约束。请把这个修订当作一道\"必须先停掉所有写入\"的边界。旧版二进制可能会重新创建缺失的映射，在断开连接后留下过时的映射，或者在把连接从"
" `user-connector` 改成别的类型之后，仍然保留 connector 的权限。不要对这个修订做新旧版本混跑的滚动部署，而应该："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2954
msgid "stop every control-plane, MCP relay and web-tier database writer;"
msgstr "停掉所有控制平面、MCP 中继和 Web 层里写数据库的进程；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2955
msgid ""
"run `alembic upgrade 0058_mcp_connector_invariant` (or upgrade through "
"`0058` to the intended later revision);"
msgstr ""
"运行 `alembic upgrade 0058_mcp_connector_invariant`（或者经过 `0058` "
"一直升级到预期的更新修订）；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2957
msgid ""
"deploy the invariant-aware control-plane, MCP relay and web-tier release;"
" and"
msgstr "部署能正确维护这一约束的控制平面、MCP 中继和 Web 层新版本；然后"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2959
msgid "resume writers only after every old binary has been replaced."
msgstr "等所有旧的二进制都替换完之后，再恢复写入。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2961
msgid ""
"The runner holds no database connection — its heartbeats are HTTP calls "
"to the control plane — so stopping the control plane, the MCP relay and "
"the web tier leaves the database with no writer."
msgstr ""
"runner 不持有任何数据库连接，它的心跳都是发给控制平面的 HTTP 请求，所以停掉控制平面、MCP 中继和 Web "
"层之后，数据库就没有任何写入方了。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2965
msgid ""
"Drain the hosts, keep the generated `cloudagent-undrain-*.sql`, and wait "
"for two counts to reach zero. Neither can be settled once the writers "
"stop, so both are waited out here, as in step 1 of the rebuild above:"
msgstr ""
"排空主机，保留生成的 `cloudagent-"
"undrain-*.sql`，然后等两个计数都降到零。这两样一旦停掉写入方就再也结束不了，所以和上面重建流程的第 1 "
"步一样，要在这里先等它们结束："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2975
msgid ""
"A fork still `preparing` or `materialized` is one its coordinator has not"
" finished. `0004` refuses to run over it rather than tombstone a fork the"
" reaper might still finalize, and the reaper runs inside the API — so it "
"has to settle before anything is stopped. A stale `preparing` operation "
"is failed after the stall window (15 minutes by default)."
msgstr ""
"还处于 `preparing` 或 `materialized` 的 fork，是协调器还没处理完的 fork。`0004` "
"不会在它上面执行，而不是冒险给一个 reaper 可能还会完成的 fork 打上删除标记；而 reaper 跑在 API "
"里面，所以必须在停掉任何东西之前，先让它处理完。停滞太久的 `preparing` 操作，会在停滞窗口（默认 15 分钟）之后判为失败。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:2981
msgid "Stop the writers:"
msgstr "停掉写入方："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2987
msgid ""
"Build and run the target's `migrate` image with nothing writing. As in "
"step 3 of the rebuild above, this runs in the deploy root with the target"
" commit checked out, and the image is built before the database is "
"touched:"
msgstr ""
"在没有任何写入的情况下，构建并运行目标版本的 `migrate` 镜像。和上面重建流程的第 3 步一样，在已检出目标 commit "
"的部署根目录里运行，并且先构建镜像，再动数据库："

#: ../developer/operations.md:2998
msgid ""
"Undrain the hosts recorded in step 1, then deploy the target commit as "
"usual. Its migration is a no-op, and readiness can now see a host that is"
" allowed to claim:"
msgstr "撤销第 1 步记下的那些主机的排空，然后像平常一样部署目标 commit。它的迁移什么都不用做，就绪检查这时也能看到一台允许认领的主机了："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3007
msgid "Run the acceptance sweep in step 7 of the rebuild above."
msgstr "按上面重建流程的第 7 步做一遍验收检查。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3009
msgid "Retained Docker storage on a host"
msgstr "主机上的保留 Docker 存储"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3011
msgid ""
"Retained chat state is the Docker container writable layer. On a daemon "
"that uses the containerd image store, the images live beside it under "
"containerd. Durable same-host operation puts both stores on a mounted "
"data disk and leaves the daemon paths at their defaults. `docker info` "
"must keep reporting `DockerRootDir=/var/lib/docker`, and "
"`AGENT_RETAINED_DOCKER_DATA_ROOT` stays `/var/lib/docker`. A custom "
"`data-root`, `graph`, or containerd `root` is rejected before the host "
"starts."
msgstr ""
"保留的对话状态，就是 Docker 容器的可写层。如果守护进程用的是 containerd 镜像存储，镜像就放在旁边的 containerd "
"里。要在同一台主机上持久保存，就把这两个存储都放到一块挂载好的数据盘上，守护进程的路径保持默认。`docker info` 必须一直显示 "
"`DockerRootDir=/var/lib/docker`，`AGENT_RETAINED_DOCKER_DATA_ROOT` 也保持 "
"`/var/lib/docker`。自定义的 `data-root`、`graph` 或 containerd 的 "
"`root`，在主机启动之前就会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3019
msgid ""
"Automatic SSH bootstrap does this from the server's sandbox storage path."
" See [Sandbox storage path](operations-compute.md#sandbox-storage-path). "
"It refuses to move a nonempty store that is not already this bind."
msgstr ""
"自动 SSH 初始化会根据服务器的沙箱存储路径完成这些设置，见[沙箱存储路径](operations-compute.md#sandbox-"
"storage-path)。如果一个非空的存储还不是这种绑定方式，它会拒绝去搬动它。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3023
msgid ""
"A manual host uses the same layout. `<disk>` is an existing writable "
"mount, for example `/scratch/hybridInference-cloud-agent/sandbox`:"
msgstr ""
"手动安装的主机也用同样的布局。`<disk>` 是一个已有的可写挂载点，例如 `/scratch/hybridInference-cloud-"
"agent/sandbox`："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3031
msgid "Persist the binds in `/etc/fstab`:"
msgstr "把这些绑定写进 `/etc/fstab`，开机后自动生效："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3038
msgid ""
"Give each daemon a drop-in, `/etc/systemd/system/docker.service.d/cloud-"
"agent-storage.conf` and `/etc/systemd/system/containerd.service.d/cloud-"
"agent-storage.conf`:"
msgstr ""
"给每个守护进程加一个 drop-in，分别是 `/etc/systemd/system/docker.service.d/cloud-agent-"
"storage.conf` 和 `/etc/systemd/system/containerd.service.d/cloud-agent-"
"storage.conf`："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3046
msgid ""
"The containerd file names `/var/lib/containerd` instead of "
"`/var/lib/docker`. Run `systemctl daemon-reload`. A missing disk then "
"keeps that daemon stopped instead of opening an empty store at the bare "
"path."
msgstr ""
"containerd 那个文件里写的是 `/var/lib/containerd`，而不是 `/var/lib/docker`。然后运行 "
"`systemctl daemon-reload`。这样一来，如果磁盘没挂上，对应的守护进程就会保持停止，而不是在原来的空路径上打开一个空存储。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3050
msgid ""
"To move a store that already has data, copy it while the daemons are "
"running, stop Docker and containerd, and copy again with `--delete` until"
" that copy exits 0. Move the old directories aside, create empty mount "
"points, bind-mount, then start the daemons. Do not point `daemon.json` at"
" the new path. Containers with `restart=no` stay stopped across that "
"restart and must be started by hand. Delete the copies left aside only "
"after a reboot has come back on these binds and the host is serving."
msgstr ""
"要搬一个已经有数据的存储：先在守护进程运行时复制一遍；然后停掉 Docker 和 containerd，再带 `--delete` "
"复制一遍，直到这次复制以 0 退出。把旧目录挪到一边，建好空的挂载点，做绑定挂载，再启动守护进程。不要把 `daemon.json` "
"指向新路径。设置了 `restart=no` "
"的容器，这次重启后会一直停着，需要手动启动。挪到一边的旧副本，要等机器重启一次、这些绑定都正常恢复、主机也已经在正常服务之后，再删掉。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3058
msgid ""
"The sandbox manager compares `AGENT_RETAINED_DOCKER_DATA_ROOT` with the "
"daemon-reported `DockerRootDir` and refuses a mismatch. It deliberately "
"cannot prove `findmnt` itself: giving the sandbox manager a host-root "
"mount just to inspect storage would violate the Docker-only boundary. The"
" mount check belongs in host provisioning, as the `RequiresMountsFor=` "
"drop-ins above."
msgstr ""
"sandbox manager 会拿 `AGENT_RETAINED_DOCKER_DATA_ROOT` 和守护进程报告的 "
"`DockerRootDir` 对比，不一致就拒绝。它有意没法自己用 `findmnt` 去确认挂载：如果仅仅为了检查存储，就给 sandbox "
"manager 挂一个主机根目录，就破坏了\"只通过 Docker 操作\"的边界。挂载检查应该在主机开通时完成，也就是上面那些 "
"`RequiresMountsFor=` drop-in。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3064
msgid ""
"Do not bind `<disk>`, `/var/lib/docker`, `/var/lib/containerd`, "
"`/workspace`, or `/agent-state` into the sandbox manager or sandbox. Do "
"not use generic `docker system prune`, container TTL cleanup, `docker "
"rm`, or image garbage collection against `org.freeinference.chat-"
"sandbox=true` objects. Inspect and operate them through Docker (`docker "
"inspect`, `docker exec`, `docker cp`, and the sandbox manager RPC), not "
"by walking overlay directories. Back up or move both graphs only with "
"Docker and containerd stopped, preserving ownership, hard links, extended"
" attributes and sparse files."
msgstr ""
"不要把 `<disk>`、`/var/lib/docker`、`/var/lib/containerd`、`/workspace` 或 "
"`/agent-state` 绑定进 sandbox manager 或沙箱。不要对带 `org.freeinference.chat-"
"sandbox=true` 标签的对象使用通用的 `docker system prune`、按容器 TTL 的清理、`docker "
"rm`，或者镜像垃圾回收。查看和操作它们，要通过 Docker（`docker inspect`、`docker exec`、`docker "
"cp`，以及 sandbox manager 的 RPC），而不是直接翻 overlay 目录。只能在 Docker 和 containerd "
"都停掉的情况下，备份或搬动这两个存储，并且要保留属主、硬链接、扩展属性和稀疏文件。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3073
msgid ""
"This makes `docker stop`/`docker start` survive runner, Sandbox Manager, "
"Docker daemon, and host reboots as long as the same binds return. Another"
" host can continue a group only from its [restorable "
"checkpoint](#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes), and only once the "
"group is handed over while a current checkpoint covers it: its host is "
"removed from the pool, its node is confirmed terminated, or the host "
"moves out before its lease ends. Without one, loss of these graphs is "
"context `LOST`, and the control-plane database still supplies the "
"authoritative thread→host→container identity needed to locate it."
msgstr ""
"只要同样的绑定能恢复，这样 `docker stop`/`docker start` 就能扛过 runner、Sandbox "
"Manager、Docker 守护进程和主机的重启。别的主机要接手一个沙箱组，只能靠它的[可恢复检查点](#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-"
"sandboxes)，并且只能在这个组被交出去、而最新的检查点仍然覆盖它的时候：它的主机被移出资源池、它的节点被确认已回收，或者主机在租期结束前迁出。没有检查点的话，这两个存储一旦丢失，上下文就是"
" `LOST`；不过控制平面的数据库仍然记着找到它所需的、权威的\"对话→主机→容器\"对应关系。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3084
msgid ""
"A missed heartbeat, an offline/disabled host row, or a temporarily "
"unreachable sandbox manager is not evidence that this Docker state "
"vanished. Keep the chat pinned and unavailable, recover or re-enrol the "
"same named host, and reconcile its exact labelled container. Only an "
"inspection on that owning Docker daemon that proves the expected "
"container/data-root is gone may transition the context to `LOST`; never "
"create a blank replacement on another host."
msgstr ""
"错过一次心跳、主机记录显示离线或禁用、sandbox manager 暂时连不上，这些都不能证明这份 Docker "
"状态已经没了。让对话继续固定在原主机上并显示为不可用，恢复或重新注册同一台具名主机，然后调和它那个确切的、带标签的容器。只有在所属的那个 "
"Docker 守护进程上检查，证实预期的容器或数据目录确实没了，才可以把上下文改为 `LOST`；绝不要在另一台主机上建一个空白的替代品。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3091
msgid "How full is the sandbox storage?"
msgstr "沙箱存储用了多少？"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3093
msgid ""
"The Servers table has a **Storage** column beside CPU and Memory: how "
"much of the filesystem holding the retained sandbox writable layers is in"
" use, in `df` terms. It answers a question the sandbox count cannot — `25"
" stopped` says containers are retained, not how much disk they hold — and"
" it observes one filesystem, not one chat: a repository, its "
"dependencies, uncommitted changes and the native CLI session all live in "
"a container's writable layer, and stopping a container does not release "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Servers 表格里，CPU 和 Memory 旁边有一列 **Storage**：存放保留沙箱可写层的那个文件系统，按 `df` "
"的口径已经用了多少。这是沙箱数量回答不了的问题，`25 stopped` 只说明保留着 25 "
"个容器，没说它们占了多少磁盘。而且它观察的是整个文件系统，不是单个对话：仓库、依赖、没提交的改动和原生 CLI "
"会话，都在容器的可写层里，停掉容器也不会释放这些空间。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3101
msgid ""
"The same reading feeds **Storage reserve for new sandboxes** (default "
"1024 MiB): below it, the runner declines a turn that would create a "
"sandbox and returns it to the queue untouched. Free Docker storage or "
"lower the reserve to restore new allocation. [Host runtime settings"
"](runtime-settings.md) describes the guard and its limits."
msgstr ""
"**Storage reserve for new sandboxes**（默认 1024 MiB）用的也是这个读数：低于这个值时，runner "
"不接需要新建沙箱的轮次，并把它原样退回队列。腾出 Docker 存储，或者调低预留值，就能恢复新的分配。这道保护和它的局限，见[主机运行时设置"
"](runtime-settings.md)。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3107
msgid "What the reading measures"
msgstr "这个读数测的是什么"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3109
msgid ""
"A runner is an ordinary container under the same Docker daemon and "
"storage driver as the sandboxes, so OverlayFS's `statfs` semantics make "
"`os.statvfs(\"/\")` inside it describe the upper layer's filesystem — the"
" disk the writable layers are on. No host mount, no Docker query, no "
"child process. The figures are `df`'s: `used` is `total - free`, "
"`available` is what an unprivileged writer may still use, and the "
"percentage is taken over `used + available`. The blocks the filesystem "
"reserves for root that are still free are in neither figure — which is "
"why the two do not add up to the total, and why `total - available` is "
"not used space."
msgstr ""
"runner 也是同一个 Docker 守护进程、同一个存储驱动下的普通容器，和沙箱一样，所以按 OverlayFS 的 `statfs` "
"语义，它内部的 `os.statvfs(\"/\")` "
"返回的就是上层所在文件系统的信息，也就是可写层所在的那块磁盘。不需要挂载主机目录，不需要查询 Docker，也不需要起子进程。数字都按 `df` "
"的口径：`used` 是 `total - free`，`available` 是非特权写入方还能用的空间，百分比按 `used + "
"available` 计算。文件系统为 root 保留、目前仍空闲的块，两个数字里都不算，所以两者加起来不等于总量，`total - "
"available` 也不等于已用空间。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3119
msgid "Attesting the storage topology"
msgstr "证实存储拓扑"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3121
msgid ""
"Docker's `overlay2.size` (and a container's `--storage-opt size=` on XFS "
"with pquota) is implemented with project quotas, and a quota is what "
"`statfs` returns for a directory inside the project. A container reading "
"its own quota, and a host running `df <upperdir>`, would then report the "
"_quota_ — 10 GiB, say — with the same device number, so comparing those "
"two proves nothing. `sandbox_host.sh` therefore compares the container's "
"numbers against `df` of the **mount root** of the filesystem containing "
"the upper directory, which no container project covers, and writes the "
"verdict to `.storage-probe/verdict.json` beside `.shared-live-ready`:"
msgstr ""
"Docker 的 `overlay2.size`（以及在带 pquota 的 XFS 上，容器的 `--storage-opt "
"size=`）是用项目配额实现的，而对项目内的目录，`statfs` 返回的就是配额。所以一个读自己配额的容器，和一台执行 `df "
"<upperdir>` 的主机，报告的都是*配额*，比如 10 GiB，设备号也相同，拿这两者比较什么都证明不了。因此 "
"`sandbox_host.sh` 会拿容器的数字，去和包含上层目录的那个文件系统的**挂载根**的 `df` "
"结果比较，因为挂载根不在任何容器的项目配额之内，然后把结论写进 `.shared-live-ready` 旁边的 `.storage-"
"probe/verdict.json`："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3131
msgid ""
"the mount root's size must equal the container's own `total_bytes` "
"exactly — `size` does not move under writes, so this is the topology "
"test;"
msgstr "挂载根的大小，必须和容器自己读到的 `total_bytes` 完全相等。`size` 不会随写入变化，所以这一条就是拓扑测试；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3133
msgid ""
"`df <upperdir>` and `df <mount_root>` must agree on size, and "
"`daemon.json` / the `dockerd` command line must not mention "
"`overlay2.size`; either disagreement is recorded as `unsupported` "
"(project quota);"
msgstr ""
"`df <upperdir>` 和 `df <mount_root>` 的大小必须一致，并且 `daemon.json` 和 `dockerd` "
"的命令行里都不能出现 `overlay2.size`；任何一条对不上，都会记为 `unsupported`（项目配额）；"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3136
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`used` and `available` are compared within `max(1 GiB, 1% of size)` and "
"only as a diagnosis, because builds and cleanup interleave and nothing "
"pauses the world for monitoring."
msgstr ""
"`used` 和 `available` 只在 `max(1 GiB, 1% of size)` "
"的误差范围内比较，而且只用于诊断，因为构建和清理在交错进行，不会有谁为了监控让一切停下来。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3140
msgid ""
"A non-root deployment user may be unable to traverse Docker/containerd's "
"root-owned snapshot directories. When direct mount lookup fails, the "
"deployment uses the running replica's immutable image ID for a temporary "
"metadata helper. Docker resolves two non-recursive, read-only directory "
"binds: the candidate mount root and that replica's upper directory. The "
"helper checks the actual binds' device, filesystem root and type against "
"the host mount-table plan before reading counters. A guessed path or "
"mismatched mount never becomes verified."
msgstr ""
"非 root 的部署用户，可能没法进入 Docker 和 containerd 那些 root "
"所有的快照目录。直接查挂载失败时，部署会用正在运行的副本那个不可变的镜像 ID，起一个临时的元数据辅助容器。Docker "
"会解析两个非递归、只读的目录绑定：候选的挂载根，以及这个副本的上层目录。辅助程序在读取数据之前，会对照主机挂载表的预期，检查实际绑定的设备、文件系统根和类型。靠猜出来的路径，或者对不上的挂载，永远不会被判定为已核实。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3148
msgid ""
"The helper has no network, capabilities, host PID namespace, Docker "
"socket or credentials. Its root filesystem is read-only; it only reads "
"its own mount metadata and calls `fstatvfs` on the two bound directories."
" It shares the attestation's remaining deadline, has its own maximum "
"five-second alarm, and is removed on exit. Failed starts are cleaned up "
"within the remaining budget. This is a deployment-only mount exception; "
"collectors and job containers do not get these host views. No sudo rule "
"or host directory permission change is needed."
msgstr ""
"这个辅助容器没有网络、没有 capability、不共享主机的 PID 命名空间，也没有 Docker socket "
"和凭据。它的根文件系统是只读的，只读取自己的挂载元数据，并对两个绑定进来的目录调用 "
"`fstatvfs`。它共用证实流程剩下的时间预算，自己还有一个最多五秒的超时，退出时就被删除。启动失败的话，会在剩余的时间预算内清理掉。这是只在部署时才有的挂载例外；采集器和任务容器都拿不到这些主机视图。不需要任何"
" sudo 规则，也不需要改主机目录的权限。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3156
msgid ""
"Each runner reads that file every sampling round and publishes a number "
"only for its own upper directory, with a matching size. Anything else — "
"no file, no entry, an entry that says `unsupported`, a resized filesystem"
" — is reported as `unverified` / `unsupported` and the page says so "
"instead of drawing a number. A rebuilt container gets a new upper "
"directory, so an old attestation stops applying on its own; there is no "
"time-based expiry."
msgstr ""
"每个 runner 每轮采样都会读这个文件，并且只为自己的、大小对得上的那个上层目录发布数字。其他任何情况，比如没有文件、没有对应的条目、条目写着"
" `unsupported`、文件系统的大小变了，都会报告为 `unverified` 或 "
"`unsupported`，页面上会如实显示，而不是画出一个数字。重建的容器会有新的上层目录，所以旧的证实结果自然就不适用了；没有按时间过期的机制。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3163
msgid "Refreshing or disabling the metric"
msgstr "刷新或关闭这个指标"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3165
msgid ""
"Compose binds only the dedicated `.storage-probe/` directory read-only at"
" `/run/cloud-agent/storage-probe`. Each sample opens `verdict.json` by "
"name, so deleting it reports `unverified` on the next sample; "
"`sandbox_host.sh check` recreates it and sampling resumes without "
"restarting replicas. Keep the bound directory itself in place. The file "
"inside it is written beside itself and renamed over, never truncated "
"first, so a replica sampling during a refresh reads either the old "
"document or the new one and never an empty one. Upgrade from the old "
"`.storage-probe-verdict` file bind with a normal `up`, which recreates "
"runners with the new mount; `check` alone cannot change an existing "
"container's mount configuration. The legacy file is ignored and is not "
"used as a fallback."
msgstr ""
"Compose 只把专用的 `.storage-probe/` 目录以只读方式绑定到 `/run/cloud-agent/storage-"
"probe`。每次采样都按文件名打开 `verdict.json`，所以删掉它，下一次采样就会报告 "
"`unverified`；`sandbox_host.sh check` "
"会重新生成它，采样随即恢复，不需要重启副本。被绑定的目录本身要保留。目录里的文件是先写一个新文件、再重命名覆盖，从不会先清空，所以刷新期间正在采样的副本，读到的要么是旧内容，要么是新内容，不会读到空文件。如果是从旧的"
" `.storage-probe-verdict` 单文件绑定升级上来，执行一次普通的 `up` 即可，它会用新的挂载方式重建 "
"runner；光执行 `check` 改变不了已有容器的挂载配置。旧文件会被忽略，也不会作为备用。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3176
msgid ""
"Where the helper is used, it needs **Docker 25 or newer on the host**. It"
" binds its two directories non-recursively, which `--mount` spells `bind-"
"recursive=disabled` — parsed by the CLI itself, and added in 25. The "
"older spelling is not an alternative to fall back on: a current CLI "
"refuses it outright — 29.2.1 answers `bind-nonrecursive=true` by naming "
"its replacement and exiting 125 — so a build that reaches for it to "
"support older hosts loses every host that is not old. Below 25 the helper"
" call fails, the host reports `unverified`, and the warning quotes the "
"CLI's own complaint. Hosts whose deployment user can traverse the storage"
" root never take this path at all."
msgstr ""
"用到辅助容器时，**主机上需要 Docker 25 或更新版本**。它以非递归方式绑定那两个目录，在 `--mount` 里写作 `bind-"
"recursive=disabled`，这个写法由 CLI 自己解析，是在 25 版加入的。旧的写法不能拿来兜底：当前的 CLI "
"会直接拒绝它，29.2.1 遇到 `bind-nonrecursive=true` 时会提示新写法，然后以 125 "
"退出；所以为了兼容老主机去用旧写法，结果是所有不老的主机都用不了。Docker 低于 25 时，辅助容器的调用会失败，主机报告 "
"`unverified`，警告里会引用 CLI 自己的报错。部署用户本来就能进入存储根目录的主机，根本不会走这条路。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3186
msgid ""
"**Storage verification never blocks a deployment.** A metric that cannot "
"be established is not a reason to keep a working host out of the pool: "
"every failure above is a warning and a verdict entry, and `up` continues."
" The two operational consequences:"
msgstr ""
"**存储验证绝不会阻止部署。** "
"一个指标测不出来，不能成为把一台正常工作的主机挡在资源池外的理由：上面每一种失败，都只是一条警告和一条判定记录，`up` "
"会继续执行。由此在运维上有两点："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3201
msgid ""
"The `up` is not optional. A container's environment is fixed when it is "
"created, so replicas started before the edit keep measuring until they "
"are replaced; `up` replaces them. A `check` in between is still worth "
"running — it rewrites the verdict with no entries, which stops those "
"replicas publishing a figure on their next sample even though they are "
"still measuring. The variable takes `overlay_root` or `off` and nothing "
"else: any other spelling is refused at configuration time rather than "
"leaving the script and the runner to disagree about what it meant."
msgstr ""
"这里的 `up` 不能省。容器的环境变量在创建时就固定了，所以在改设置之前启动的副本，在被替换之前会一直测量；`up` "
"会替换它们。在两者之间执行一次 `check` "
"仍然有用：它会把判定结果重写为空，这样那些副本虽然还在测量，下一次采样时也不会再发布数字了。这个变量只接受 `overlay_root` 或 "
"`off`，没有别的：其他任何写法在配置阶段就会被拒绝，以免脚本和 runner 对它的理解不一致。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3210
msgid "Measurement limits"
msgstr "测量的局限"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3212
msgid ""
"The reading measures block space, so `available` does not promise that "
"any particular container can still write — inodes, quotas and a read-only"
" remount still fail. It includes every other writer on that filesystem, "
"so it is not the sum of Docker objects and it does not predict how many "
"more sandboxes fit. On the default host deployment the rollout also stops"
" reporting if the mount root itself is inside a size-limited project "
"quota, which `df` cannot distinguish; the configuration check is best "
"effort. Rootless, remote-Docker, btrfs/ZFS and devicemapper hosts are "
"unverified: the probe reports `unsupported` rather than guessing. On "
"Docker Desktop the host shell cannot see the VM's mounts, so local "
"development shows `unverified`."
msgstr ""
"这个读数测的是块空间，所以 `available` 并不保证某个容器还能写进去：inode "
"用完、配额满了、被重新挂载成只读，照样会写失败。它包括这个文件系统上的所有其他写入方，所以既不是 Docker "
"对象的总和，也没法预测还能再放下多少个沙箱。在默认的主机部署里，如果挂载根本身就在一个限制了大小的项目配额里，上线后也会停止报告，而这是 `df`"
" 分辨不出来的；配置检查只能尽力而为。rootless、远程 Docker、btrfs/ZFS 和 devicemapper "
"的主机都没有验证过：探针会报告 `unsupported`，而不是去猜。在 Docker Desktop 上，主机的 shell "
"看不到虚拟机里的挂载，所以本地开发时会显示 `unverified`。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3223
msgid "Which machine runs the jobs"
msgstr "任务在哪台机器上跑"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3225
msgid ""
"**Admin → Servers.** The list is every enrolled execution environment "
"with authenticated heartbeats, grouped by the physical server it "
"reported, and the **New chats** selector picks where a chat with no "
"sandbox may be materialized. Its default option is **Automatic**, which "
"means whoever polls first takes a new chat. Once a retained group exists,"
" its turns can be claimed only by that group's owning environment."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Servers。** 列表里是每一个发送着带认证心跳的已注册执行环境，按它们上报的物理服务器分组；**New chats** "
"选择器决定，还没有沙箱的对话可以在哪里创建。默认选项是 "
"**Automatic**，意思是谁先轮询到，新对话就归谁。一旦有了保留的沙箱组，它的轮次就只能由这个组所属的环境认领。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3232
msgid ""
"Runners pull work. Placement is enforced when a runner claims a job, "
"rather than through a dispatch request from the control plane. These "
"rules apply:"
msgstr "runner 是主动来拉任务的。放置规则是在 runner 认领任务时执行的，而不是由控制平面派发过去。规则如下："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3235
msgid ""
"**The switch is not preemptive, and not a drain.** The new host starts "
"claiming chats that do not have a sandbox yet; jobs already running on "
"the old one keep running to the end, holding their leases. Existing "
"retained chats stay hard-pinned to the host that owns their Docker "
"writable layer, so later follow-ups can still be claimed there. A group "
"moves only from a checkpoint that covers it, once its host is removed, "
"terminates or moves out before its lease ends ([restoring a removed "
"host's sandboxes](#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes)). The two hosts "
"can therefore overlap after the switch — a drain would mean waiting for "
"the old host to empty first, and this does not do that."
msgstr ""
"**切换不会抢占，也不是排空。** "
"新主机会开始认领还没有沙箱的对话；已经在旧主机上运行的任务会一直跑到结束，并持有各自的租约。已有的保留对话会被严格固定在持有它 Docker "
"可写层的那台主机上，所以之后的后续消息仍然可以在那里被认领。沙箱组只会通过覆盖它的检查点迁移，而且只在它的主机被移除、被回收，或者在租期结束前迁出之后（见[恢复被移除主机上的沙箱](#restoring-a"
"-removed-hosts-sandboxes)）。所以切换之后，两台主机可能会同时干活；排空的意思是先等旧主机清空，而这里不会这么做。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3245
msgid ""
"**An unenrolled runner cannot claim.** The control plane derives the host"
" from its persisted host credential; a request-body name cannot "
"impersonate a pinned machine."
msgstr "**没注册的 runner 认领不了任务。** 控制平面根据保存的主机凭据确定是哪台主机；请求体里写个名字，冒充不了被固定的那台机器。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3248
msgid ""
"**A machine joins through one-time enrollment.** `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` is "
"bound to the chosen host name and redeemed once. Replicas then share the "
"persisted host credential and heartbeat independently of claim traffic."
msgstr ""
"**机器通过一次性注册加入。** `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` "
"绑定到选定的主机名，只能兑换一次。之后各个副本共用保存下来的主机凭据，心跳也和认领请求互不相干。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3251
msgid ""
"**There is no storage failover.** If the selected host stops, new chats "
"wait rather than materializing somewhere else. Existing retained chats "
"likewise wait while their own host is enrolled but unavailable; changing "
"the selection cannot move their Docker layer. The admin page warns when "
"the selected host has not polled recently, but the authoritative "
"operational signals are its enrolled heartbeat and sandbox manager probe,"
" not whether one runner happened to claim recently."
msgstr ""
"**存储不会故障转移。** "
"如果选中的主机停了，新对话会一直等，而不是换个地方创建。已有的保留对话也一样：它们自己的主机虽然已注册、但不可用时，它们会等着；改选择也搬不走它们的"
" Docker 层。选中的主机最近没有轮询时，管理页面会给出警告；但真正权威的运维信号，是它已注册的心跳和 sandbox manager "
"探测，而不是最近有没有哪个 runner 碰巧认领过任务。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3258
msgid ""
"Adding a _second_ machine is not only this switch. The configured model "
"and MCP endpoints use the two relays on the sandbox's group bridge, with "
"private addresses otherwise blocked by the host rules. A runner box that "
"is not the gateway's host needs the two tunnels described next, and "
"everything in [§0 above](#0-the-sandbox-network-needs-its-host-rules-a"
"-resolver-and-both-relays). The gateway's public inference address may "
"also be reachable; replay of a leaked grant there is an [accepted risk"
"](#mcp-prerequisite-and-accepted-inference-grant-risk). Preflight refuses"
" at startup rather than failing jobs at their first model or MCP call, "
"but it refuses _there_, on that machine, not here."
msgstr ""
"加*第二台*机器，不只是拨一下这个开关。配置的模型端点和 MCP "
"端点，走的是沙箱组网桥上的两个中继，其他私有地址都被主机规则挡住了。不在网关那台主机上的 runner 机器，需要下面要讲的两条隧道，以及[上面 "
"§0](#0-the-sandbox-network-needs-its-host-rules-a-resolver-and-both-"
"relays) 里的全部内容。网关公开的推理地址也可能访问得到；泄露的授权在那里被重放，是一项[已接受的风险](#mcp-"
"prerequisite-and-accepted-inference-grant-"
"risk)。预检会在启动时就拒绝，而不是等到任务第一次调用模型或 MCP 时才失败；但它是在*那台*机器上拒绝，不是在这里。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3268
msgid "Running runners on another machine"
msgstr "在另一台机器上运行 runner"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3270
msgid ""
"A second machine is worth adding for capacity, or because it is the one "
"with the hardware. What makes it more than \"run the script over there\" "
"is how a sandbox reaches the platform. Its group bridge routes to the "
"public internet, but only on TCP 80/443, and the host rules refuse "
"private addresses except for the group's fixed relays. The configured "
"gateway and MCP endpoints use those relays, SSH tunnels that lifecycle "
"code finds on the relay network and attaches to each group's bridge. A "
"separate control-plane relay remains visible only to the runner:"
msgstr ""
"加第二台机器，可能是为了扩容，也可能因为硬件就在那台机器上。它之所以不是\"在那边跑一下脚本\"这么简单，是因为沙箱要能访问到平台。沙箱的组网桥可以访问公网，但只限"
" TCP 80/443；主机规则会拒绝私有地址，只放行这个组固定的那几个中继。配置的网关端点和 MCP 端点用的就是这些中继：它们是 SSH "
"隧道，生命周期代码在中继网络上找到它们，再接到每个组的网桥上。另外还有一个单独的控制平面中继，只有 runner 能看到："

#: ../developer/operations.md:3292
msgid ""
"Each tunnel is a relay, not a proxy — no CONNECT and no caller-chosen "
"destination — so nothing a sandbox sends can widen either route. Setup "
"and the agent share the group's bridge, so setup reaches package "
"registries over the same public TCP 80/443 as everything else. The "
"control-plane tunnel never joins a group bridge, and its address on the "
"runner's network is a private one the host rules refuse from every group."
msgstr ""
"每条隧道都是中继，而不是代理：没有 CONNECT，也不能由调用方选择目标，所以沙箱发出的任何东西，都没法把任何一条路由扩大。setup 和 "
"agent 共用这个组的网桥，所以 setup 访问软件包仓库时，走的也是和其他所有流量一样的公网 TCP "
"80/443。控制平面隧道从不接入任何组网桥，它在 runner 网络上的地址是一个私有地址，主机规则对所有沙箱组都会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3299
msgid ""
"**Why ssh rather than exposing the gateway's port.** Sandboxes carry "
"scoped inference grants and runners carry enrolled-host credentials. "
"Binding either service to the lab network puts those capabilities in "
"cleartext on a shared segment. The tunnel keeps each service listening on"
" loopback."
msgstr ""
"**为什么用 ssh，而不是直接把网关的端口暴露出来。** 沙箱里有限定范围的推理授权，runner "
"里有已注册主机的凭据。把任何一个服务绑到实验室网络上，都会让这些凭据以明文出现在一个共享网段上。用隧道的话，每个服务都只需要监听回环地址。"

#: ../developer/operations.md:3311
msgid ""
"`deploy/host/docker-compose.sandbox.yml` contains the runner, sandbox "
"manager, three purpose-scoped tunnels, and two networks: the stack's own "
"network and the route-less relay network. Runner and sandbox manager "
"create group bridges through Docker. This is the supported standalone "
"topology. It does not start a gateway `backend`, as the source "
"repository's old overlay could do through its `depends_on: backend` "
"declaration."
msgstr ""
"`deploy/host/docker-compose.sandbox.yml` 里包括 runner、sandbox "
"manager、三条按用途限定的隧道，以及两个网络：这套服务自己的网络，和不带路由的中继网络。runner 和 sandbox manager "
"通过 Docker 创建组网桥。这是官方支持的独立部署拓扑。它不会启动网关的 `backend`；源仓库以前那个 overlay，可以通过 "
"`depends_on: backend` 声明做到这一点。"

